(725710, 77548, 10414, '<td valign="top">Wow....I can relate to this picture. At first I was going to lecture you on your choice of using B&amp;W here, but then I got it...or at least I think I did. LOL For me, it means that the rainbow that you seek, is more or less unattainable, therefore, it may as well BE in black and white for all the good it does. Am I close? Anyway, you get a 9 for making me think so hard!  :)</td>', 'Wow....I can relate to this picture. At first I was going to lecture you on your choice of using B&W here, but then I got it...or at least I think I did. LOL For me, it means that the rainbow that you seek, is more or less unattainable, therefore, it may as well BE in black and white for all the good it does. Am I close? Anyway, you get a 9 for making me think so hard!  :)', '2004-05-19 01:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
