(726316, 77563, 1009, '<td valign="top">Cool picture, not sure about the habit though. I wouldn''t see it if it weren''t for the title.</td>', 'Cool picture, not sure about the habit though. I wouldn''t see it if it weren''t for the title.', '2004-05-19 09:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(726317, 76459, 1009, '<td valign="top">Cool lowlight macro shot! I like the lighting, the texture, contrast and sharpness. Good job.</td>', 'Cool lowlight macro shot! I like the lighting, the texture, contrast and sharpness. Good job.', '2004-05-19 09:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(726318, 77326, 19333, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, you have to take care of your habits after work :)</td>', 'Nice composition, you have to take care of your habits after work :)', '2004-05-19 09:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(726319, 77343, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, like the sharpness, detail, and POV. Photo isn''t very exciting though. Good job overall.</td>', 'Nice colors, like the sharpness, detail, and POV. Photo isn''t very exciting though. Good job overall.', '2004-05-19 09:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(726323, 76624, 1009, '<td valign="top">Funny take on an everyday habit. Nice stop motion, nice use of b&amp;w, nice sharpness, contrast and framing. Good job...</td>', 'Funny take on an everyday habit. Nice stop motion, nice use of b&w, nice sharpness, contrast and framing. Good job...', '2004-05-19 09:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(726324, 77673, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good use of b&amp;w, sharpness, contrast, and lighting all good.</td>', 'Nice shot, good use of b&w, sharpness, contrast, and lighting all good.', '2004-05-19 09:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(726326, 76769, 9295, '<td valign="top">I would like this much better if the hand were in focus. The composition is good, I like the lighting, and the soft pink of her lips being the only color other than the flesh is a nice touch, but without using a proper depth of field to create a focal point, this turns out to be just an out-of-focus shot.</td>', 'I would like this much better if the hand were in focus. The composition is good, I like the lighting, and the soft pink of her lips being the only color other than the flesh is a nice touch, but without using a proper depth of field to create a focal point, this turns out to be just an out-of-focus shot.', '2004-05-19 09:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(726327, 77010, 1009, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Kind of busy though, looks like a quick candid pic. Good job overall...</td>', 'Cool shot. Kind of busy though, looks like a quick candid pic. Good job overall...', '2004-05-19 09:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(726328, 77368, 7252, '<td valign="top">It''s sad but on any given day I couldn''t pull out of my pockets enough money to take this shot. :(</td>', 'It''s sad but on any given day I couldn''t pull out of my pockets enough money to take this shot. :(', '2004-05-19 09:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(726329, 76793, 19333, '<td valign="top">How can she concentrate in lessons with all that mess around and the music playing straight to her ears??? <br/> <br/>I find the lightning on the mess distracting, i''d better lighted her face. focus isn''t sharp either.</td>', 'How can she concentrate in lessons with all that mess around and the music playing straight to her ears???  I find the lightning on the mess distracting, i''d better lighted her face. focus isn''t sharp either.', '2004-05-19 09:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(726331, 77545, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot. Think I might have prefered color for once though. Nice sharpness, contrast and DOF though.</td>', 'Nice macro shot. Think I might have prefered color for once though. Nice sharpness, contrast and DOF though.', '2004-05-19 09:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(726332, 77399, 1009, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. I like the vibrant colors. I''d work on the lighting (too harsh) and the framing (maybe something closer up would work better). Good job...</td>', 'Cool idea. I like the vibrant colors. I''d work on the lighting (too harsh) and the framing (maybe something closer up would work better). Good job...', '2004-05-19 09:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(726333, 76251, 1009, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Nice clear background, great sharpness and framing. Great contrast! Top 20.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Nice clear background, great sharpness and framing. Great contrast! Top 20.', '2004-05-19 09:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(726334, 76497, 1009, '<td valign="top">Is this a good habit or a bad one? Subject doesn''t look very happy. Nice side lighting but could be a little more even and soft (looks like a flashlight?). I like the pose and the idea though...</td>', 'Is this a good habit or a bad one? Subject doesn''t look very happy. Nice side lighting but could be a little more even and soft (looks like a flashlight?). I like the pose and the idea though...', '2004-05-19 09:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(726336, 77359, 1009, '<td valign="top">Cool idea for a photo, good layout of the stuff. Lighting on this one is important, its to harsh and stark on this photo I think. I know lighting is really hard but maybe you can use some bounced lighting or camera settings to soften up the image? Good sharpness and colors though...</td>', 'Cool idea for a photo, good layout of the stuff. Lighting on this one is important, its to harsh and stark on this photo I think. I know lighting is really hard but maybe you can use some bounced lighting or camera settings to soften up the image? Good sharpness and colors though...', '2004-05-19 09:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(726337, 77271, 21833, '<td valign="top">I like the way the highlights on the hands and the smoke lead your eye to the face.  I would have like to seen more detail in the face, though.</td>', 'I like the way the highlights on the hands and the smoke lead your eye to the face.  I would have like to seen more detail in the face, though.', '2004-05-19 09:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(726338, 76986, 1009, '<td valign="top">Great shot of a cute basset hound. Nice use of DOF on the grass. Good sharpness, colors and contrast. Good job...</td>', 'Great shot of a cute basset hound. Nice use of DOF on the grass. Good sharpness, colors and contrast. Good job...', '2004-05-19 09:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(726339, 76624, 21833, '<td valign="top">I can relate.</td>', 'I can relate.', '2004-05-19 09:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(726340, 76863, 1009, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I can amost feel the speed. Good job...</td>', 'Very nice shot. I can amost feel the speed. Good job...', '2004-05-19 09:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(726342, 77513, 1009, '<td valign="top">Great idea for a photo. Wish it had some more detail somehow though, not sure how exactly. Maybe different lighting, something to bring out the contrast. Good job..</td>', 'Great idea for a photo. Wish it had some more detail somehow though, not sure how exactly. Maybe different lighting, something to bring out the contrast. Good job..', '2004-05-19 09:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(726344, 76207, 1009, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Nice use of negative space in the corner. I like the use of b&amp;w, great contrast, sharpness and love the framing/angle. Good job! Top 20.</td>', 'Great shot. Nice use of negative space in the corner. I like the use of b&w, great contrast, sharpness and love the framing/angle. Good job! Top 20.', '2004-05-19 09:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(726345, 77695, 21833, '<td valign="top">The subject is not in focus, but the background is.<br/> <br/>Maybe B&amp;W instead of Sepia?</td>', 'The subject is not in focus, but the background is. Maybe B&W instead of Sepia?', '2004-05-19 09:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(726346, 76607, 1009, '<td valign="top">Cool idea for a shot. Could use a little work, but I imagine its not that easy to pose an eating, wiggling baby! Good job overall... nice lighting and sharpness!</td>', 'Cool idea for a shot. Could use a little work, but I imagine its not that easy to pose an eating, wiggling baby! Good job overall... nice lighting and sharpness!', '2004-05-19 09:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(726348, 77282, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good detail, contrast and sharpness. Also a unique idea...</td>', 'Nice shot, good detail, contrast and sharpness. Also a unique idea...', '2004-05-19 09:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(726350, 76323, 1009, '<td valign="top">Great bird pic! If it weren''t for the title though I''d have no thought of a habit...</td>', 'Great bird pic! If it weren''t for the title though I''d have no thought of a habit...', '2004-05-19 09:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(726356, 76253, 21985, '<td valign="top">Out of theme</td>', 'Out of theme', '2004-05-19 09:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(726358, 76867, 7252, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of photos of cigarettes around. I think all of the better ones have some of the burning area visible and perhaps even some smoke. Aside from those issues I think it might have been better to take the photo before the cigarette was burned so much. That way you could have cropped off the section with the writing. I don''t think that portion is really necessary as we all know what a cigarette looks like and the writing pulls the eye away from the ash.</td>', 'There are a lot of photos of cigarettes around. I think all of the better ones have some of the burning area visible and perhaps even some smoke. Aside from those issues I think it might have been better to take the photo before the cigarette was burned so much. That way you could have cropped off the section with the writing. I don''t think that portion is really necessary as we all know what a cigarette looks like and the writing pulls the eye away from the ash.', '2004-05-19 09:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(726360, 76648, 20251, '<td valign="top">Good Title !<br/> <br/></td>', 'Good Title ! ', '2004-05-19 09:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(726365, 76797, 7252, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell, especially with this small of a photo, if this image is really as out of focus as it looks or if you just used too small an aperture. If it''s the first case I would try to use a higher ISO. If the later try a tighter aperture.</td>', 'It''s hard to tell, especially with this small of a photo, if this image is really as out of focus as it looks or if you just used too small an aperture. If it''s the first case I would try to use a higher ISO. If the later try a tighter aperture.', '2004-05-19 09:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(726367, 77401, 20251, '<td valign="top">well- thought of ....</td>', 'well- thought of ....', '2004-05-19 09:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(726371, 77265, 7252, '<td valign="top">This could have been an interesting photo with some extra context. A view of a person watching a TV for example.</td>', 'This could have been an interesting photo with some extra context. A view of a person watching a TV for example.', '2004-05-19 09:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(726382, 77065, 7252, '<td valign="top">lol... That''s not playing with food but simply the most efficient way of eating them!</td>', 'lol... That''s not playing with food but simply the most efficient way of eating them!', '2004-05-19 09:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(726391, 76987, 7252, '<td valign="top">Now this is much more interesting and creative than I would have expected from this site. The background lighting is a little hot but it''s not really a point of distraction.</td>', 'Now this is much more interesting and creative than I would have expected from this site. The background lighting is a little hot but it''s not really a point of distraction.', '2004-05-19 09:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(726392, 77549, 7252, '<td valign="top">ha ha ha... I called it in the forums, I just thought there would be more of picking in this challenge. I like the thoroughly involved expression. I would have given this bonus points if you could have gotten a knuckle inside.</td>', 'ha ha ha... I called it in the forums, I just thought there would be more of picking in this challenge. I like the thoroughly involved expression. I would have given this bonus points if you could have gotten a knuckle inside.', '2004-05-19 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(726399, 77695, 16301, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if you wanted the focus like that, but I think it would have been better if it was in focus, but thats just my opinion. I like the expression. I think its a bit tightly cropped from the top. The choice of tone is good. Maybe tweak the levels to darken the whole photo a bit?<br/> <br/>Nice effort...</td>', 'I don''t know if you wanted the focus like that, but I think it would have been better if it was in focus, but thats just my opinion. I like the expression. I think its a bit tightly cropped from the top. The choice of tone is good. Maybe tweak the levels to darken the whole photo a bit? Nice effort...', '2004-05-19 10:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(726401, 77271, 21995, '<td valign="top">I liked the she shot, great contrast but  then saw the skull which I think is far too cliche''d</td>', 'I liked the she shot, great contrast but  then saw the skull which I think is far too cliche''d', '2004-05-19 10:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(726402, 77520, 18219, '<td valign="top">good!</td>', 'good!', '2004-05-19 10:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(726404, 77267, 21995, '<td valign="top">Very sharp but it could have been framed / cropped much better</td>', 'Very sharp but it could have been framed / cropped much better', '2004-05-19 10:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(726408, 77673, 19670, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black &amp; white...Did you maybe mean, "Habituality Breeds Strength"?</td>', 'Nice use of black & white...Did you maybe mean, "Habituality Breeds Strength"?', '2004-05-19 10:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(726409, 76696, 7252, '<td valign="top">Yeah, guitars are a really bad habit and tend to annoy the neighbors. hint hint, electric guitars really suck at 8 am on a Sunday upstairs neighbor. As for the photo itself it is well composed and framed. Seems slightly back focused from the cigarette but it doesn''t distract. Good use of DOF.</td>', 'Yeah, guitars are a really bad habit and tend to annoy the neighbors. hint hint, electric guitars really suck at 8 am on a Sunday upstairs neighbor. As for the photo itself it is well composed and framed. Seems slightly back focused from the cigarette but it doesn''t distract. Good use of DOF.', '2004-05-19 10:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(726410, 76204, 19670, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t anybody flush...?!? :-)</td>', 'Doesn''t anybody flush...?!? :-)', '2004-05-19 10:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(726411, 77674, 19670, '<td valign="top">Funny image...it might have looked a little better if the lid and container were separated, looking more like they fell after the last bite...</td>', 'Funny image...it might have looked a little better if the lid and container were separated, looking more like they fell after the last bite...', '2004-05-19 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(726413, 76229, 19670, '<td valign="top">Crisp composition</td>', 'Crisp composition', '2004-05-19 10:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(726420, 76783, 21430, '<td valign="top">Bad use of a smoking person. It almost seems like something that would be in a cigarette advertisement, especially with that title. I am sorry, but this is bad form and goes against the rules, escpeially with all the talk on the forums leading up to this challenge due date.<br/> <br/>Other then that, there is a flash shadow that could have not been in the shot with additional lighting. The background is rather dry and uninteresting.</td>', 'Bad use of a smoking person. It almost seems like something that would be in a cigarette advertisement, especially with that title. I am sorry, but this is bad form and goes against the rules, escpeially with all the talk on the forums leading up to this challenge due date. Other then that, there is a flash shadow that could have not been in the shot with additional lighting. The background is rather dry and uninteresting.', '2004-05-19 10:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(726424, 77690, 19333, '<td valign="top">man''s?  what does your wife think about it? ;-)</td>', 'man''s?  what does your wife think about it? ;-)', '2004-05-19 10:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(726426, 76654, 15287, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this has to do with the theme.</td>', 'Not sure what this has to do with the theme.', '2004-05-19 10:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(726429, 77380, 15287, '<td valign="top">Love it!  This is my bad habit, too, and the DOF makes this picture.</td>', 'Love it!  This is my bad habit, too, and the DOF makes this picture.', '2004-05-19 10:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(726432, 76955, 15287, '<td valign="top">Yuuuuck.  That''s disgusting!</td>', 'Yuuuuck.  That''s disgusting!', '2004-05-19 10:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(726433, 77508, 9747, '<td valign="top">Good one!  I love how the smoke is wafting from the ashtray. Very nice effect. Unfortunately, the bottle cover is too bright (making it look washed out). Suggestions: Show the whole bottle instead of cutting the top off, make the background completely black (shoot the picture on/near the table''s edge so the table won''t show up in the background), and be conscious of perspective as it looks like the bottle is leaning just a bit to the left. (Could be me, though.) Overall, a very nice picture and it captures the "Habits" theme perfectly. Great work!</td>', 'Good one!  I love how the smoke is wafting from the ashtray. Very nice effect. Unfortunately, the bottle cover is too bright (making it look washed out). Suggestions: Show the whole bottle instead of cutting the top off, make the background completely black (shoot the picture on/near the table''s edge so the table won''t show up in the background), and be conscious of perspective as it looks like the bottle is leaning just a bit to the left. (Could be me, though.) Overall, a very nice picture and it captures the "Habits" theme perfectly. Great work!', '2004-05-19 10:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(726434, 76754, 20685, '<td valign="top">i like bug shots but it seems whatever the subject, somebody tries to fit a bug shot in there with virtually no relevance to the week''s theme.</td>', 'i like bug shots but it seems whatever the subject, somebody tries to fit a bug shot in there with virtually no relevance to the week''s theme.', '2004-05-19 10:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(726435, 77586, 20685, '<td valign="top">nice doodle - nice photo - a naturally creative person lies behind this lens - 8 from me</td>', 'nice doodle - nice photo - a naturally creative person lies behind this lens - 8 from me', '2004-05-19 10:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(726438, 77133, 7252, '<td valign="top">I think it would be more appropriate to pan with the subject to get some motion blur in the background rather than having the subject look like it''s standing still.</td>', 'I think it would be more appropriate to pan with the subject to get some motion blur in the background rather than having the subject look like it''s standing still.', '2004-05-19 10:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(726440, 76833, 10134, '<td valign="top">focus should be on the tip of the pencil and by keeping the same point of view it would create a better effect !</td>', 'focus should be on the tip of the pencil and by keeping the same point of view it would create a better effect !', '2004-05-19 10:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(726442, 77493, 10134, '<td valign="top">sometimes a good camera does almost all !!!</td>', 'sometimes a good camera does almost all !!!', '2004-05-19 10:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(726446, 77706, 10134, '<td valign="top">I like the angle.</td>', 'I like the angle.', '2004-05-19 10:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(726448, 76934, 10134, '<td valign="top">contrast too high, the dog looks FLAT !</td>', 'contrast too high, the dog looks FLAT !', '2004-05-19 10:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(726449, 76192, 9747, '<td valign="top">Had to laugh at this and at the cliche-ness! Good one. :-) Attractive flower, you did good in bringing out the whiteness of the flower petals. DOF is great. Just wish that the leaf in foreground isn''t in the way. Gave this a 6 for the humor and the lovely picture. (Edited to replace "petal" with "leaf" - my bad.)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-05-26 15:15:12.</i></td>', 'Had to laugh at this and at the cliche-ness! Good one. :-) Attractive flower, you did good in bringing out the whiteness of the flower petals. DOF is great. Just wish that the leaf in foreground isn''t in the way. Gave this a 6 for the humor and the lovely picture. (Edited to replace "petal" with "leaf" - my bad.)', '2004-05-19 10:43:41.000000', '2004-05-26 16:15:12.000000', 1),
(726450, 77650, 21995, '<td valign="top">great composition</td>', 'great composition', '2004-05-19 10:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(726454, 76254, 10134, '<td valign="top">it''s pity, you should use a better algorythm to resize your pictures, like bilinear... you get a lot of broken lines with stairs and it renders the picture less smooth... i like the idea of the disk that''s turning !</td>', 'it''s pity, you should use a better algorythm to resize your pictures, like bilinear... you get a lot of broken lines with stairs and it renders the picture less smooth... i like the idea of the disk that''s turning !', '2004-05-19 10:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
