(726540, 77512, 18331, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing photo.  DOF is used brilliantly.  Simplicity is beautiful, and this is definitely both simple and beautiful.  I''m giving this a 9, only because I really dislike borders, especially here since it takes away from the overall minimalism of this photo.</td>', 'This is an amazing photo.  DOF is used brilliantly.  Simplicity is beautiful, and this is definitely both simple and beautiful.  I''m giving this a 9, only because I really dislike borders, especially here since it takes away from the overall minimalism of this photo.', '2004-05-19 11:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(726543, 77654, 19841, '<td valign="top">The low contrast, and dim yellow lighting make this look like a bad habit.  I would prefer to see this more brightly lit.  More depth of field would help, as well.  <br/>It''s a good idea, and a good composition.</td>', 'The low contrast, and dim yellow lighting make this look like a bad habit.  I would prefer to see this more brightly lit.  More depth of field would help, as well.  It''s a good idea, and a good composition.', '2004-05-19 11:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(726546, 77443, 20538, '<td valign="top">Reallly cool picture and a cool title, but I think the habit thing is a stretch.</td>', 'Reallly cool picture and a cool title, but I think the habit thing is a stretch.', '2004-05-19 11:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(726547, 77548, 19333, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  souldn''t it be in color?</td>', 'Ouch!  souldn''t it be in color?', '2004-05-19 11:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(726549, 76680, 20538, '<td valign="top">Wowa, I hope the habit is referring to the toothpaste and not divorces!</td>', 'Wowa, I hope the habit is referring to the toothpaste and not divorces!', '2004-05-19 11:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(726550, 77673, 18331, '<td valign="top">This is a really nicely composed photo.  The subject matter, the model''s expression, the older looking weights, very nice.  The only thing I would look to change is the background.  It''s a little distracting (the ladder, the screen door, broom, baseball bat).  These all take away from what you are portraying. Also, the choice of black and white is good, but when shooting in b/w I would say your subject(s) should stand out from their background.  In this case, the grays are too close together to really *pop* out at me.  Otherwise, great shot.</td>', 'This is a really nicely composed photo.  The subject matter, the model''s expression, the older looking weights, very nice.  The only thing I would look to change is the background.  It''s a little distracting (the ladder, the screen door, broom, baseball bat).  These all take away from what you are portraying. Also, the choice of black and white is good, but when shooting in b/w I would say your subject(s) should stand out from their background.  In this case, the grays are too close together to really *pop* out at me.  Otherwise, great shot.', '2004-05-19 11:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(726551, 76937, 19841, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the composition is a little loose.  I would like to see this with everything closer together, maybe the coffe cup to the right of the pencil, and the glasses on the plexers ad.   This arrangement would not only be more dynamic, it would let you get away with less depth of field, so you coul use more dramatic lighting.</td>', 'Good idea, but the composition is a little loose.  I would like to see this with everything closer together, maybe the coffe cup to the right of the pencil, and the glasses on the plexers ad.   This arrangement would not only be more dynamic, it would let you get away with less depth of field, so you coul use more dramatic lighting.', '2004-05-19 11:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(726552, 77351, 19333, '<td valign="top">I dont know what''s wrong exactly with this one to me, the face isn''t in focus? the background should be more our of focus? nothing is in focus? Maybe I cannot point where the focus plane is, to me it should be on the models''s face clearly.</td>', 'I dont know what''s wrong exactly with this one to me, the face isn''t in focus? the background should be more our of focus? nothing is in focus? Maybe I cannot point where the focus plane is, to me it should be on the models''s face clearly.', '2004-05-19 11:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(726553, 76834, 19333, '<td valign="top">wasn''t one more cup of coffee for the road? ;)</td>', 'wasn''t one more cup of coffee for the road? ;)', '2004-05-19 11:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(726554, 77322, 19333, '<td valign="top">I can see only one m left on these! :)</td>', 'I can see only one m left on these! :)', '2004-05-19 11:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(726557, 77371, 19841, '<td valign="top">The composition comes off as just an overall texture, like wallpaper.  Something else in the image, like a hand with a bar of soap, or a shoulder, would have made it much more interesting.</td>', 'The composition comes off as just an overall texture, like wallpaper.  Something else in the image, like a hand with a bar of soap, or a shoulder, would have made it much more interesting.', '2004-05-19 11:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(726563, 77547, 19333, '<td valign="top">Quite a sparse habit, only one available every year!<br/> <br/>To me the pic''s a little soft overall, as if there is some kind of fog.</td>', 'Quite a sparse habit, only one available every year! To me the pic''s a little soft overall, as if there is some kind of fog.', '2004-05-19 11:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(726567, 77507, 9747, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this fits the theme, but I had to laugh at the coincidence... the statue''s stained face and her "reaction" to the bird sitting on her head! It''s like she''s screaming "Oh, nooo! Not again!". :-) The background is nicely blurred but I think it''d be better if it''s blurred a little more (shorter DOF). Just my opinion. Great shot!</td>', 'I''m not sure if this fits the theme, but I had to laugh at the coincidence... the statue''s stained face and her "reaction" to the bird sitting on her head! It''s like she''s screaming "Oh, nooo! Not again!". :-) The background is nicely blurred but I think it''d be better if it''s blurred a little more (shorter DOF). Just my opinion. Great shot!', '2004-05-19 11:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(726568, 77126, 19333, '<td valign="top">What''s it? water?<br/> <br/>The composition''s good, I wouldn''t have cut the glass bottom.</td>', 'What''s it? water? The composition''s good, I wouldn''t have cut the glass bottom.', '2004-05-19 11:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
