(726587, 77543, 9747, '<td valign="top">This is cool, a nun in habit with a bad habit! This picture would be great if it wasn''t so blurry. It also needs more contrast, and perhaps cropped a little more tightly (the light area to the right of the nun''s hand is distracting). But this fits the theme great!</td>', 'This is cool, a nun in habit with a bad habit! This picture would be great if it wasn''t so blurry. It also needs more contrast, and perhaps cropped a little more tightly (the light area to the right of the nun''s hand is distracting). But this fits the theme great!', '2004-05-19 11:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
