(726603, 76178, 9747, '<td valign="top">The concept''s right, but the picture''s too small. The background should be all white or very blurry, so that it would help draw the attention to the flame. The lighting on the subject''s face by the flame is great! Try to make the picture bigger the next time. Nicely done! [Edited to correct a minor spelling error.]<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-05-29 10:46:56.</i></td>', 'The concept''s right, but the picture''s too small. The background should be all white or very blurry, so that it would help draw the attention to the flame. The lighting on the subject''s face by the flame is great! Try to make the picture bigger the next time. Nicely done! [Edited to correct a minor spelling error.]', '2004-05-19 11:50:38.000000', '2004-05-29 11:46:56.000000', 1),
