(727229, 76397, 18331, '<td valign="top">Really nice capture.  I have read in books by movie directors that convention has it that moonlight is blue in movies.  I think if you used a blue gel over your lightsource it would improve the photo by making it look like night time.  Unless you were trying to capture dawn, in which case, you succeeded.</td>', 'Really nice capture.  I have read in books by movie directors that convention has it that moonlight is blue in movies.  I think if you used a blue gel over your lightsource it would improve the photo by making it look like night time.  Unless you were trying to capture dawn, in which case, you succeeded.', '2004-05-19 15:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(727231, 77264, 5364, '<td valign="top">If I was a psychoanalyst I could probably tell a lot about you from these doodles! A great picture, but I feel there is an empty space at the eraser end of the pencil (maybe that''s appropriate?)</td>', 'If I was a psychoanalyst I could probably tell a lot about you from these doodles! A great picture, but I feel there is an empty space at the eraser end of the pencil (maybe that''s appropriate?)', '2004-05-19 15:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
