(727393, 76251, 19608, '<td valign="top">Well - there were an awful lot of coffee entries - but yours is by far the best of the bunch, the cream of the crop (no I guess it''s black.)  I have one minor complaint - there is so little cup on the bottom edge that the white line between the cup and the black border really detracts.  It almost looks like some of the cup is missing.  Like I said, a minor gig - you image should still be in the top 3.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Well - there were an awful lot of coffee entries - but yours is by far the best of the bunch, the cream of the crop (no I guess it''s black.)  I have one minor complaint - there is so little cup on the bottom edge that the white line between the cup and the black border really detracts.  It almost looks like some of the cup is missing.  Like I said, a minor gig - you image should still be in the top 3.  Congratulations.', '2004-05-19 16:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
