(727549, 77527, 5354, '<td valign="top">How many times have I driven past this and thought - I must stop and take a photo <br/>Its a difficult subject to capture, I''ve yet to see a really good angel, but this is a reasonable attempt. You got the wings in and the sky is very very nice. I would have liked a whole photographer instead of a half, but thats a small point.<br/> <br/>All in all a good shot.</td>', 'How many times have I driven past this and thought - I must stop and take a photo Its a difficult subject to capture, I''ve yet to see a really good angel, but this is a reasonable attempt. You got the wings in and the sky is very very nice. I would have liked a whole photographer instead of a half, but thats a small point. All in all a good shot.', '2004-05-19 17:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
