(727927, 77706, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and I think hte angle works well. The lighting seems a little too dark. ISO adjustment maybe?</td>', 'Nice shot and I think hte angle works well. The lighting seems a little too dark. ISO adjustment maybe?', '2004-05-19 19:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(727930, 76192, 20235, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to "get it" ; )<br/>Nice shot and a very true habit in the challenges!</td>', 'Took me a minute to "get it" ; )Nice shot and a very true habit in the challenges!', '2004-05-19 19:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(727931, 77234, 20018, '<td valign="top">:) creative idea....definitely got a smile...lol even like the desire in the baby''s eyes or whatever that look is...bad light though...babies seem to look great if you use natural light by seating them next to an open window and turn the flash off.</td>', ':) creative idea....definitely got a smile...lol even like the desire in the baby''s eyes or whatever that look is...bad light though...babies seem to look great if you use natural light by seating them next to an open window and turn the flash off.', '2004-05-19 19:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
