(727934, 77472, 20235, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of the better "toilet" habit shots. I like the use of darkness and lighting to emphasize the seat aspect of this oh so common habit ; )</td>', 'Definitely one of the better "toilet" habit shots. I like the use of darkness and lighting to emphasize the seat aspect of this oh so common habit ; )', '2004-05-19 19:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
