(727976, 77076, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice sillouette, but perhaps better if the sky were not blown out.  Expose for the sun and sky, if you didn''t already do that.  Or try to intentionally underexpose and do the adjustments in PS.</td>', 'Nice sillouette, but perhaps better if the sky were not blown out.  Expose for the sun and sky, if you didn''t already do that.  Or try to intentionally underexpose and do the adjustments in PS.', '2004-05-19 20:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(727977, 76715, 19780, '<td valign="top">Beautiful comment - I like the vibrant colors. The light is a little harsh but somehow appropriate for "getting caught". The watch band is a little distracting within the frame. I like the off center composition with the hand.</td>', 'Beautiful comment - I like the vibrant colors. The light is a little harsh but somehow appropriate for "getting caught". The watch band is a little distracting within the frame. I like the off center composition with the hand.', '2004-05-19 20:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
