(728008, 77702, 19780, '<td valign="top">An interesting composition. I like the black and white and the curve of the lines. The DOF and focus is good. The background is a little distracting - the ionic breeze, the vote poster, the teddy bear ... they don''t feed the subject of the habit depicted. The textures on the wood and the metal contrasted are great.</td>', 'An interesting composition. I like the black and white and the curve of the lines. The DOF and focus is good. The background is a little distracting - the ionic breeze, the vote poster, the teddy bear ... they don''t feed the subject of the habit depicted. The textures on the wood and the metal contrasted are great.', '2004-05-19 20:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
