(728039, 76659, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here very much. The vibrancy of the red is wonderful compared to the muted greens in the background. I like the sharpness of the texutres on the gas bottles. The candidness of the shot is appropriate for the challenge - though the safety part is lost on me.</td>', 'I like the colors here very much. The vibrancy of the red is wonderful compared to the muted greens in the background. I like the sharpness of the texutres on the gas bottles. The candidness of the shot is appropriate for the challenge - though the safety part is lost on me.', '2004-05-19 20:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(728041, 77006, 19780, '<td valign="top">Great closeup. The DOF is good and the details are well captured. The composition is rather nice, I like the diagonal lines created by the fingers. The sepia choice makes this a more compelling shot - almost like one of those dreamy ring exchange shots from a wedding.</td>', 'Great closeup. The DOF is good and the details are well captured. The composition is rather nice, I like the diagonal lines created by the fingers. The sepia choice makes this a more compelling shot - almost like one of those dreamy ring exchange shots from a wedding.', '2004-05-19 20:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(728042, 77387, 20941, '<td valign="top">like this</td>', 'like this', '2004-05-19 20:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(728043, 77000, 19780, '<td valign="top">The colors are very nice and the focus is good. The staging of the photo lacks honesty. The child only has his finger in his nose - I don''t believe that he''s actually picking it, so the representation of the habit is a little diluted. The eyes could be lightened up, perhaps a little white bounceboard between you and the subject.</td>', 'The colors are very nice and the focus is good. The staging of the photo lacks honesty. The child only has his finger in his nose - I don''t believe that he''s actually picking it, so the representation of the habit is a little diluted. The eyes could be lightened up, perhaps a little white bounceboard between you and the subject.', '2004-05-19 20:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(728046, 76769, 19780, '<td valign="top">An interesting way of staging this habit. The soft, soft focus still allows us to see the fingers, lips and teeth. I like the lighting and exposure very much. It gives the habit a rather dreamy quality.</td>', 'An interesting way of staging this habit. The soft, soft focus still allows us to see the fingers, lips and teeth. I like the lighting and exposure very much. It gives the habit a rather dreamy quality.', '2004-05-19 20:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(728048, 77233, 20941, '<td valign="top">i like it</td>', 'i like it', '2004-05-19 20:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(728049, 76854, 19780, '<td valign="top">It''s a picture of a squirrel. How does it fit the challenge? The photo itself is rather charming. I like the squirrel''s pose - the colors are wonderful and I enjoy the way the posts and fencing in the background lead the eye around the frame. The tree to the right bothers me a little, I might like to see it cropped a bit to minimize it or a deeper DOF to give it more texture to contrast with the texture of the squirrel''s fir.</td>', 'It''s a picture of a squirrel. How does it fit the challenge? The photo itself is rather charming. I like the squirrel''s pose - the colors are wonderful and I enjoy the way the posts and fencing in the background lead the eye around the frame. The tree to the right bothers me a little, I might like to see it cropped a bit to minimize it or a deeper DOF to give it more texture to contrast with the texture of the squirrel''s fir.', '2004-05-19 20:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(728051, 76507, 19780, '<td valign="top">The colors here are nice. The background is a little bland and doesn''t add much to the composition. The contrast could be bumped up a little bit - it all seems slighly washed out. I''m not sure if it''s caused by her position, but it seems like the rotation is slightly off or maybe it''s just that the strap on the right side is higher and the butt cheek is lower.</td>', 'The colors here are nice. The background is a little bland and doesn''t add much to the composition. The contrast could be bumped up a little bit - it all seems slighly washed out. I''m not sure if it''s caused by her position, but it seems like the rotation is slightly off or maybe it''s just that the strap on the right side is higher and the butt cheek is lower.', '2004-05-19 20:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(728056, 77648, 19751, '<td valign="top">is anything in focus?</td>', 'is anything in focus?', '2004-05-19 20:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(728058, 76867, 7151, '<td valign="top">I thought this looked more like a "Habit" shot than a "Macro" shot...  ;-)  But it fits both.  A nice touch would have been rising smoke and/or a little glow.  Don''t know if you had practical reasons for not doing that.  The composition is a bit centered, but OK.  The results are generally good - sharp, nice lighting, good job of keeping the background black.</td>', 'I thought this looked more like a "Habit" shot than a "Macro" shot...  ;-)  But it fits both.  A nice touch would have been rising smoke and/or a little glow.  Don''t know if you had practical reasons for not doing that.  The composition is a bit centered, but OK.  The results are generally good - sharp, nice lighting, good job of keeping the background black.', '2004-05-19 20:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
