(728416, 77268, 20235, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo. I think the challenge in capturing these "smoking" shots in b&amp;w is difficult because of the obvious need to contrast. But here, you''ve done it nicely. Composition is nice with good use of f-value to emphasize the theme. Nice work!</td>', 'This is a great photo. I think the challenge in capturing these "smoking" shots in b&w is difficult because of the obvious need to contrast. But here, you''ve done it nicely. Composition is nice with good use of f-value to emphasize the theme. Nice work!', '2004-05-20 00:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(728417, 77674, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice photo! The title and the composition are very interesting and it leads the eye towards the main subject. Very nicely done......... I would have preffered Ben &amp; Jerry''s myself ; )</td>', 'Nice photo! The title and the composition are very interesting and it leads the eye towards the main subject. Very nicely done......... I would have preffered Ben & Jerry''s myself ; )', '2004-05-20 00:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(728418, 76833, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo. Not much I sould think to suggest to make it better.... Nice work!</td>', 'Very interesting photo. Not much I sould think to suggest to make it better.... Nice work!', '2004-05-20 00:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(728419, 77322, 20662, '<td valign="top">Now there''s a habit I really understand!</td>', 'Now there''s a habit I really understand!', '2004-05-20 00:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(728423, 76643, 20662, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this better in color. Why did you decide to go black and white?</td>', 'I think I would have liked this better in color. Why did you decide to go black and white?', '2004-05-20 01:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(728424, 76589, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great idea. I''m not crazy about the lighting though as it seems somewhat harsh. I think the reflections throughout the photo detract a little fomr the overall effect.</td>', 'Great idea. I''m not crazy about the lighting though as it seems somewhat harsh. I think the reflections throughout the photo detract a little fomr the overall effect.', '2004-05-20 01:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
