(728433, 77488, 20662, '<td valign="top">I"m a newbie here but I sure am beginning to understand this habit!</td>', 'I"m a newbie here but I sure am beginning to understand this habit!', '2004-05-20 01:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(728448, 77569, 20662, '<td valign="top">Wish the focus was better. Otherwise, it''s a fitting picture for the title.</td>', 'Wish the focus was better. Otherwise, it''s a fitting picture for the title.', '2004-05-20 01:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(728453, 76930, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good perspective for this</td>', 'Good perspective for this', '2004-05-20 01:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(728465, 77350, 21367, '<td valign="top">Great Idea for a habit, most original "real" habit I have seen in this challenge.  Every one of us has that one.  I think this one would have worked better in color (something would have to be done with the wall in that case, maybe a dark sheet).  All the different colors on the books and table would have played well together.   The virgo in me tells me that I might have had the binder paper that looks like I was intending to write something down.  Nice picture.</td>', 'Great Idea for a habit, most original "real" habit I have seen in this challenge.  Every one of us has that one.  I think this one would have worked better in color (something would have to be done with the wall in that case, maybe a dark sheet).  All the different colors on the books and table would have played well together.   The virgo in me tells me that I might have had the binder paper that looks like I was intending to write something down.  Nice picture.', '2004-05-20 01:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(728480, 77664, 18677, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but the file size is only 20K. The limit is 150K!  This was compressed way too much.  Less compression would improve this one dramatically.</td>', 'Great idea, but the file size is only 20K. The limit is 150K!  This was compressed way too much.  Less compression would improve this one dramatically.', '2004-05-20 01:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
