(728835, 77010, 20685, '<td valign="top">i really like this, it looks very natural (not sure if it''s set-up) which is great</td>', 'i really like this, it looks very natural (not sure if it''s set-up) which is great', '2004-05-20 11:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(728836, 77510, 19841, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to realize that you were showing the bad habit of leaving the seat up.   (and not cleaning the toilet often).   There must have been a better way to present this idea.  Even indoors, try first to find a way to get the shot whithout using the flash attached to your camera.  That practically guarantees flat lighting.  Perhaps cropping or zooming in closer on the toilet seat, and getting rid os the extraneous stuff like the sink and trash can.  You are off to a good start, but you need to take that little bit of extra thought.  Check all the angles, try different lightings.</td>', 'It took me a while to realize that you were showing the bad habit of leaving the seat up.   (and not cleaning the toilet often).   There must have been a better way to present this idea.  Even indoors, try first to find a way to get the shot whithout using the flash attached to your camera.  That practically guarantees flat lighting.  Perhaps cropping or zooming in closer on the toilet seat, and getting rid os the extraneous stuff like the sink and trash can.  You are off to a good start, but you need to take that little bit of extra thought.  Check all the angles, try different lightings.', '2004-05-20 11:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(728837, 77576, 20685, '<td valign="top">really good idea but not great to look at so wouldn''t work without a title - still love to see good ideas as much as good photos</td>', 'really good idea but not great to look at so wouldn''t work without a title - still love to see good ideas as much as good photos', '2004-05-20 11:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(728839, 76948, 11518, '<td valign="top">Lots of loonies there. Nice</td>', 'Lots of loonies there. Nice', '2004-05-20 11:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(728841, 76833, 4747, '<td valign="top">So far this is my fav in appropriateness to the category and photo quality... well done</td>', 'So far this is my fav in appropriateness to the category and photo quality... well done', '2004-05-20 11:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(728842, 76204, 20685, '<td valign="top">completely gross so gets high marks for that alone, technically could have been shot better which is ashame because great opportunity for great shot</td>', 'completely gross so gets high marks for that alone, technically could have been shot better which is ashame because great opportunity for great shot', '2004-05-20 11:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(728844, 77337, 4747, '<td valign="top">too bad you didn''t bet more than a few quarters</td>', 'too bad you didn''t bet more than a few quarters', '2004-05-20 11:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(728846, 76955, 19841, '<td valign="top">A little on the gross side, but effective.  I wonder how this shot would have looked from a step to the left, to get that coke umbrella out from behind his head.  The heart health t-shirt is a nice ironic touch, well spotted!</td>', 'A little on the gross side, but effective.  I wonder how this shot would have looked from a step to the left, to get that coke umbrella out from behind his head.  The heart health t-shirt is a nice ironic touch, well spotted!', '2004-05-20 11:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(728848, 77697, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptionally ORIGINAL take on the challenge.  A breath of fresh air when compared to the multitude of nail biting images! <br/>Excellent composition, focus, lighting.  The only thing I would suggest to improve the image is a very dark colored "pillow" (or whatever her head is on).  The current color is close enough to the skin tone that it doesn''t make much contrast.  That''s a VERY minor point with no points deducted - but a way to make it "sing" just a little louder.</td>', 'Exceptionally ORIGINAL take on the challenge.  A breath of fresh air when compared to the multitude of nail biting images! Excellent composition, focus, lighting.  The only thing I would suggest to improve the image is a very dark colored "pillow" (or whatever her head is on).  The current color is close enough to the skin tone that it doesn''t make much contrast.  That''s a VERY minor point with no points deducted - but a way to make it "sing" just a little louder.', '2004-05-20 11:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(728849, 77492, 19841, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but I would rather have seen the watcher in focus.  Is he naked? Also, he doesn''t seem to be watching much, if you had stood on something so that you could see "people level" in the window, the view would be more effective.<br/>The hat and pipe give this a nice surreal Church of the Subgenius touch, but it''s not enough to make the image work.</td>', 'Good idea, but I would rather have seen the watcher in focus.  Is he naked? Also, he doesn''t seem to be watching much, if you had stood on something so that you could see "people level" in the window, the view would be more effective.The hat and pipe give this a nice surreal Church of the Subgenius touch, but it''s not enough to make the image work.', '2004-05-20 11:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(728850, 77511, 19914, '<td valign="top">I heard an explanation of why 17 years.. it is prime, so the potential eaters, that also "sleep" for a fixed number of years (always prime), can''t never get in sync with them and terminate with all in some cicles... if one year they coincide, they have many many years to recover.</td>', 'I heard an explanation of why 17 years.. it is prime, so the potential eaters, that also "sleep" for a fixed number of years (always prime), can''t never get in sync with them and terminate with all in some cicles... if one year they coincide, they have many many years to recover.', '2004-05-20 11:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(728853, 77563, 19322, '<td valign="top">A nice shot in some ways, but for me it is too contrived.</td>', 'A nice shot in some ways, but for me it is too contrived.', '2004-05-20 11:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(728854, 77010, 4747, '<td valign="top">Life long habbit...Great appropriateness to the category and photo quality... well done</td>', 'Life long habbit...Great appropriateness to the category and photo quality... well done', '2004-05-20 11:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(728855, 77527, 19914, '<td valign="top">... I know better ones ;)</td>', '... I know better ones ;)', '2004-05-20 11:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
