(728857, 77526, 19322, '<td valign="top">I like it, even though I haven''t figured it out.</td>', 'I like it, even though I haven''t figured it out.', '2004-05-20 11:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(728859, 76582, 19914, '<td valign="top">where is the habit? sorry i don''t get your intentions.</td>', 'where is the habit? sorry i don''t get your intentions.', '2004-05-20 11:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(728860, 77233, 19914, '<td valign="top">very nice... all! 9</td>', 'very nice... all! 9', '2004-05-20 11:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(728861, 77258, 19914, '<td valign="top">it is burned... flash was way too close, you had to adjust aperture manually and/or put something in front of the flash (some paper to dimish the light). The idea was very good anyway.</td>', 'it is burned... flash was way too close, you had to adjust aperture manually and/or put something in front of the flash (some paper to dimish the light). The idea was very good anyway.', '2004-05-20 11:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(728864, 77276, 16241, '<td valign="top">should have paid more than R5 for this shot.........</td>', 'should have paid more than R5 for this shot.........', '2004-05-20 11:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(728867, 77379, 19914, '<td valign="top">It looks like you casted the image with some proyector right from the same position that you placed the camera to avoid distortion... good idea, and nice result. I would have used a image of smoke or similar to make it looks like the pot was semi transparent so you can see the coffe and smoke in the interior... just another idea.</td>', 'It looks like you casted the image with some proyector right from the same position that you placed the camera to avoid distortion... good idea, and nice result. I would have used a image of smoke or similar to make it looks like the pot was semi transparent so you can see the coffe and smoke in the interior... just another idea.', '2004-05-20 11:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(728868, 77133, 4747, '<td valign="top">a very expensive habit too</td>', 'a very expensive habit too', '2004-05-20 11:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(728876, 77505, 4747, '<td valign="top">This is the best angle I''ve seen in the habit''s selection of toilet seats! (And I did a toilet set shot myself)<br/>So much white is difficult.<br/>The bowl is over expose and could be a little sharper.<br/></td>', 'This is the best angle I''ve seen in the habit''s selection of toilet seats! (And I did a toilet set shot myself)So much white is difficult.The bowl is over expose and could be a little sharper.', '2004-05-20 11:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(728886, 77650, 4747, '<td valign="top">Love the tilt of the photo<br/>Love the sign outside the window<br/>Love the cup of thick catsup, the crispy golden fries and the colorful wax paper wrapping... heck I even love the truck pulling in the driveway.<br/></td>', 'Love the tilt of the photoLove the sign outside the windowLove the cup of thick catsup, the crispy golden fries and the colorful wax paper wrapping... heck I even love the truck pulling in the driveway.', '2004-05-20 12:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(728892, 77673, 4747, '<td valign="top">Experiment with changing your angle or where you have the subject focus his gaze, to minimize the appearance of lazy eye.</td>', 'Experiment with changing your angle or where you have the subject focus his gaze, to minimize the appearance of lazy eye.', '2004-05-20 12:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(728893, 76291, 15642, '<td valign="top">Cute, but I''d let the photo tell the story instead of the title.</td>', 'Cute, but I''d let the photo tell the story instead of the title.', '2004-05-20 12:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(728895, 77654, 15642, '<td valign="top">What''s man''s oldest habit? Crucifixion? The title confuses a rather sharp picture.</td>', 'What''s man''s oldest habit? Crucifixion? The title confuses a rather sharp picture.', '2004-05-20 12:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(728896, 77645, 15642, '<td valign="top">What habit is being represented here?</td>', 'What habit is being represented here?', '2004-05-20 12:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(728897, 76348, 18374, '<td valign="top">I think the majority of this image is too dark.  The truck is the only element that seems to be properly exposed.  I like the humor in the shot.  Unfortunately, I don''t find a picture of a messy garage too aesthetically pleasing, so my score will reflect that.</td>', 'I think the majority of this image is too dark.  The truck is the only element that seems to be properly exposed.  I like the humor in the shot.  Unfortunately, I don''t find a picture of a messy garage too aesthetically pleasing, so my score will reflect that.', '2004-05-20 12:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(728898, 77387, 15642, '<td valign="top">Feeding what habit?</td>', 'Feeding what habit?', '2004-05-20 12:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(728900, 77193, 15642, '<td valign="top">This is not a habit, it''s a necessity.</td>', 'This is not a habit, it''s a necessity.', '2004-05-20 12:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
