(728934, 76873, 4747, '<td valign="top">I really do like this photo, but the cigarette should be facing filter end toward the subject. In addition, I think somethings not right with the cup.<br/>It may be either too large or too dark.<br/> <br/>I love the window, the garden outside, the lace, the cigarette and the light it has a morning feel to it.<br/></td>', 'I really do like this photo, but the cigarette should be facing filter end toward the subject. In addition, I think somethings not right with the cup.It may be either too large or too dark. I love the window, the garden outside, the lace, the cigarette and the light it has a morning feel to it.', '2004-05-20 12:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(728938, 77657, 18374, '<td valign="top">I find this to be a pretty boring photo.  I can''t say I would want to hang a picture of floss on my wall.  This photo is also out of focus.  The light reflection in the top center of the picture is a bit distracting.  Some suggestions to improve your photography: try setting the floss in a more interesting location, or show somebody using the floss to add some interest to the picture.  Also, read the manual for your camera and learn how to lock the focus on a specific spot.</td>', 'I find this to be a pretty boring photo.  I can''t say I would want to hang a picture of floss on my wall.  This photo is also out of focus.  The light reflection in the top center of the picture is a bit distracting.  Some suggestions to improve your photography: try setting the floss in a more interesting location, or show somebody using the floss to add some interest to the picture.  Also, read the manual for your camera and learn how to lock the focus on a specific spot.', '2004-05-20 12:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(728942, 77510, 18374, '<td valign="top">While I can appreciate the statement you are making with your title, I don''t think this is a very good photo to enter in a photography contest.  Do you really think anybody wants to see a picture of your dirty toilet?!  I, for one, don''t.  On the plus side, at least it''s in focus.</td>', 'While I can appreciate the statement you are making with your title, I don''t think this is a very good photo to enter in a photography contest.  Do you really think anybody wants to see a picture of your dirty toilet?!  I, for one, don''t.  On the plus side, at least it''s in focus.', '2004-05-20 12:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(728946, 76460, 18374, '<td valign="top">The lighting and setting for this photo could be better.  The bright light in the background distracts attention foreground.  Using something other than a concrete patio would improve the aesthetic value of this photo.  The focus on the cat could also be sharper.</td>', 'The lighting and setting for this photo could be better.  The bright light in the background distracts attention foreground.  Using something other than a concrete patio would improve the aesthetic value of this photo.  The focus on the cat could also be sharper.', '2004-05-20 12:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
