(729003, 77496, 19608, '<td valign="top">Superb lighting, action, exposure, expression.  Not sure I''d call it a "habit" but it''s close enough for me!  Sure hope others don''t deducts points for not meeting the challenge.  Composition may be a wee bit too centered, but that''s a gnat.  Overall - WAY better than most of the submissions.  It should finish VERY high.</td>', 'Superb lighting, action, exposure, expression.  Not sure I''d call it a "habit" but it''s close enough for me!  Sure hope others don''t deducts points for not meeting the challenge.  Composition may be a wee bit too centered, but that''s a gnat.  Overall - WAY better than most of the submissions.  It should finish VERY high.', '2004-05-20 13:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
