(729090, 77640, 18374, '<td valign="top">I like the glow of the fire and the color of the smoke, but the rest of the picture is too dark to be interesting.  It also looks a bit out of focus.</td>', 'I like the glow of the fire and the color of the smoke, but the rest of the picture is too dark to be interesting.  It also looks a bit out of focus.', '2004-05-20 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(729093, 77705, 18374, '<td valign="top">I think the framing of this shot has room for improvement.  The eye/glasses half in and half out of the picture are a little distracting and the large light area on the right side of the face is where my attention naturally falls instead of on the nail biting.</td>', 'I think the framing of this shot has room for improvement.  The eye/glasses half in and half out of the picture are a little distracting and the large light area on the right side of the face is where my attention naturally falls instead of on the nail biting.', '2004-05-20 14:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(729096, 77380, 21198, '<td valign="top">Best one i''ve seen so far. Tells an excellent story without needing to rely on the headline. Although the headline does add to the photo. But the photo stands by itself very well.</td>', 'Best one i''ve seen so far. Tells an excellent story without needing to rely on the headline. Although the headline does add to the photo. But the photo stands by itself very well.', '2004-05-20 14:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(729099, 77551, 18374, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure see how this qualifies as a habit.  Focus is good.  The subject is somewhat interesting, but the background looks marred and dirty.</td>', 'I''m not sure see how this qualifies as a habit.  Focus is good.  The subject is somewhat interesting, but the background looks marred and dirty.', '2004-05-20 14:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(729103, 77258, 18374, '<td valign="top">To me, this picture is not very interesting- it isn''t something I would want to hang on my wall.  Technically, the main point of interest looks overexposed a bit.  I would also have preferred a greater depth of field so that at least the entire remote and fingers were in focus.  I also think the shot could be improved by featuring the remote more and not having it half in and half out of the frame.</td>', 'To me, this picture is not very interesting- it isn''t something I would want to hang on my wall.  Technically, the main point of interest looks overexposed a bit.  I would also have preferred a greater depth of field so that at least the entire remote and fingers were in focus.  I also think the shot could be improved by featuring the remote more and not having it half in and half out of the frame.', '2004-05-20 14:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(729106, 77006, 18374, '<td valign="top">This image seems a little dark and lifeless.  Maybe if it weren''t in B&amp;W it would show some skin tones and color in the ring.  Good focus and depth of field.</td>', 'This image seems a little dark and lifeless.  Maybe if it weren''t in B&W it would show some skin tones and color in the ring.  Good focus and depth of field.', '2004-05-20 14:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(729108, 77550, 18374, '<td valign="top">This photo seems a little out of focus, or maye suffers from motion blur.  I think the subject is not that interesting.</td>', 'This photo seems a little out of focus, or maye suffers from motion blur.  I think the subject is not that interesting.', '2004-05-20 14:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(729109, 77413, 18374, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this photo has no significant problems, but it doesn''t really appeal to me.  The grayish background is kind of dull and the light reflections on the nails are a bit distracting.</td>', 'In my opinion, this photo has no significant problems, but it doesn''t really appeal to me.  The grayish background is kind of dull and the light reflections on the nails are a bit distracting.', '2004-05-20 14:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(729114, 76930, 15642, '<td valign="top">This one''s definitely a bad habit!</td>', 'This one''s definitely a bad habit!', '2004-05-20 15:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(729116, 76963, 5364, '<td valign="top">Just for once your "habit" has got you a good picture - I like it.</td>', 'Just for once your "habit" has got you a good picture - I like it.', '2004-05-20 15:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(729117, 76937, 15642, '<td valign="top">a tad sterile for me...</td>', 'a tad sterile for me...', '2004-05-20 15:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(729119, 77674, 15642, '<td valign="top">Funny and well done.</td>', 'Funny and well done.', '2004-05-20 15:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(729121, 77550, 15642, '<td valign="top">Stop what? I''m confused.</td>', 'Stop what? I''m confused.', '2004-05-20 15:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(729128, 76204, 15642, '<td valign="top">Peeing is not a habit, but interesting pic nonetheless.</td>', 'Peeing is not a habit, but interesting pic nonetheless.', '2004-05-20 15:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(729129, 76696, 15642, '<td valign="top">Quit smoking or quit playing the guitar with your shirt off?</td>', 'Quit smoking or quit playing the guitar with your shirt off?', '2004-05-20 15:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(729130, 77560, 15642, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. Crapping is not really a habit, but interesting take.</td>', 'Hmmm. Crapping is not really a habit, but interesting take.', '2004-05-20 15:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(729131, 76481, 15642, '<td valign="top">You lost me. What habit? What ceiling?</td>', 'You lost me. What habit? What ceiling?', '2004-05-20 15:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(729133, 76566, 15642, '<td valign="top">What habit is pictured here?</td>', 'What habit is pictured here?', '2004-05-20 15:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(729141, 76769, 9690, '<td valign="top">I like this alot.... i like the soft focus</td>', 'I like this alot.... i like the soft focus', '2004-05-20 15:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(729144, 76951, 21978, '<td valign="top">Good use of color and lighting, good work. Very imaginative.</td>', 'Good use of color and lighting, good work. Very imaginative.', '2004-05-20 15:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(729145, 77645, 9690, '<td valign="top">well... im not sure how this counts as a habit, but its funny as heck ! ! !</td>', 'well... im not sure how this counts as a habit, but its funny as heck ! ! !', '2004-05-20 15:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(729155, 77674, 5364, '<td valign="top">As I''m on dial-up your picture took a while to load, so as it loaded I thought "here''s another drugs reference". When I saw the ice-cream I laughed. It''s all in the anticipation. Technically the bright spot at the top is probably a bit too bright, but it''s a good picture.</td>', 'As I''m on dial-up your picture took a while to load, so as it loaded I thought "here''s another drugs reference". When I saw the ice-cream I laughed. It''s all in the anticipation. Technically the bright spot at the top is probably a bit too bright, but it''s a good picture.', '2004-05-20 15:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(729158, 76247, 19780, '<td valign="top">I was confused if the habit was recycling or drinking. The lighting and chaotic assembly of the bottles and cans is nice. I like the colors and some of the keylight reflections - but the hot contrast on the keystone is a little too much. I like the lines of your composition - the diagonals work well and the DOF and focus is good.</td>', 'I was confused if the habit was recycling or drinking. The lighting and chaotic assembly of the bottles and cans is nice. I like the colors and some of the keylight reflections - but the hot contrast on the keystone is a little too much. I like the lines of your composition - the diagonals work well and the DOF and focus is good.', '2004-05-20 15:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(729163, 77128, 20779, '<td valign="top">My top pick for this one. Just perfect. As a newbie, I owuld love to know later how you achieved the perfect color, softness and clarity of the girls'' skin.</td>', 'My top pick for this one. Just perfect. As a newbie, I owuld love to know later how you achieved the perfect color, softness and clarity of the girls'' skin.', '2004-05-20 15:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(729167, 77655, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the composition very much. The angles of the ashtrays and their positions work well. The focus could be crisper - or to really go for a "look" the DOF could allow for one or two to be softer than the other with a different angle.</td>', 'I like the colors and the composition very much. The angles of the ashtrays and their positions work well. The focus could be crisper - or to really go for a "look" the DOF could allow for one or two to be softer than the other with a different angle.', '2004-05-20 15:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(729169, 77690, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF here, the creases in the thumb and the numbers on the buttons come across loud and clear. The black and white choice is great - it helps to minimize the background items that don''t relate to the TV and the "viewer".  A less centered composition might make for a stronger comment.</td>', 'I like the DOF here, the creases in the thumb and the numbers on the buttons come across loud and clear. The black and white choice is great - it helps to minimize the background items that don''t relate to the TV and the "viewer".  A less centered composition might make for a stronger comment.', '2004-05-20 15:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(729170, 77645, 3102, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the connection to the challenge...?</td>', 'I don''t get the connection to the challenge...?', '2004-05-20 15:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(729171, 77424, 19780, '<td valign="top">This is a great candid capture. I like the color, exposure and DOF. The composition and position of the people is really interesting and compelling. You''ve picked up some nice textures on the fabric of his jeans and the folds of her jacket.</td>', 'This is a great candid capture. I like the color, exposure and DOF. The composition and position of the people is really interesting and compelling. You''ve picked up some nice textures on the fabric of his jeans and the folds of her jacket.', '2004-05-20 15:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(729172, 76229, 20779, '<td valign="top">One of my three favorites in the Habit challenge. This type of shot has been done many times before, but for me this is an example of a fresh take that has a lot of impact for me. Very well executed IMHO.</td>', 'One of my three favorites in the Habit challenge. This type of shot has been done many times before, but for me this is an example of a fresh take that has a lot of impact for me. Very well executed IMHO.', '2004-05-20 15:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(729173, 76948, 5364, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture, but I think the watch and ring are a bit distracting</td>', 'Excellent picture, but I think the watch and ring are a bit distracting', '2004-05-20 15:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(729176, 77650, 20779, '<td valign="top">I think that the tilted angle and crisp colors take this from being ordinary to very engaging.</td>', 'I think that the tilted angle and crisp colors take this from being ordinary to very engaging.', '2004-05-20 16:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(729177, 77010, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very affecting, especially for an ex-smoker.</td>', 'Very affecting, especially for an ex-smoker.', '2004-05-20 16:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(729178, 77512, 20779, '<td valign="top">Love the crisp simplicity.</td>', 'Love the crisp simplicity.', '2004-05-20 16:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(729179, 77375, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like your off-centered composition with the dark bathtub to the right - it really helps to anchor the frame and the up-rightness of the figure''s legs and the shower curtain. The colors seem a little dim with the light so yellow - a little additional light bounced against the tile walls would probably help that and mimize the reflection on the tiles.</td>', 'I like your off-centered composition with the dark bathtub to the right - it really helps to anchor the frame and the up-rightness of the figure''s legs and the shower curtain. The colors seem a little dim with the light so yellow - a little additional light bounced against the tile walls would probably help that and mimize the reflection on the tiles.', '2004-05-20 16:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(729180, 76825, 20779, '<td valign="top">I wonder if your being recognizable will affect your score? This is one of the shots I wanted to try, but failed; your take is great!!!</td>', 'I wonder if your being recognizable will affect your score? This is one of the shots I wanted to try, but failed; your take is great!!!', '2004-05-20 16:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(729181, 77233, 20779, '<td valign="top">How did you happen to catch this one? Too funny!</td>', 'How did you happen to catch this one? Too funny!', '2004-05-20 16:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(729183, 76169, 20779, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling this might score lower than it would otherwise for being weak on "meeting the challenge". Hopefully not, because I found it a superb shot and I like the more subtle connection.</td>', 'I have a feeling this might score lower than it would otherwise for being weak on "meeting the challenge". Hopefully not, because I found it a superb shot and I like the more subtle connection.', '2004-05-20 16:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(729184, 77368, 5364, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, just a little too dark, but I have to know - did you put the queen face-down?</td>', 'Nice idea, just a little too dark, but I have to know - did you put the queen face-down?', '2004-05-20 16:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(729185, 76631, 20779, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and feel here. I think I might have straightened it veritcally a little more.</td>', 'Nice colors and feel here. I think I might have straightened it veritcally a little more.', '2004-05-20 16:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(729186, 77472, 21820, '<td valign="top">Yet another toilet up<br/>and this one isn''t even a good photograph</td>', 'Yet another toilet upand this one isn''t even a good photograph', '2004-05-20 16:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(729187, 77520, 21820, '<td valign="top">good...</td>', 'good...', '2004-05-20 16:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(729188, 76261, 21820, '<td valign="top">nope</td>', 'nope', '2004-05-20 16:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(729190, 77508, 20779, '<td valign="top">The icy blue a very nice contrast. I would like to see this shot with a crisp, clear glass of "vodka", sharper focus and straightened. Black a good choice for background.</td>', 'The icy blue a very nice contrast. I would like to see this shot with a crisp, clear glass of "vodka", sharper focus and straightened. Black a good choice for background.', '2004-05-20 16:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(729191, 77651, 21820, '<td valign="top">don''t get it</td>', 'don''t get it', '2004-05-20 16:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(729192, 76314, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very original thought. I would have like to have seen a little less cropping and cleaner focus. Perhaps a dash of color for interest?</td>', 'Very original thought. I would have like to have seen a little less cropping and cleaner focus. Perhaps a dash of color for interest?', '2004-05-20 16:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(729196, 77365, 20779, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle of this shot and the slight colorization of some of the bricks. I am very loose on "meeting the challenge", but even for me, a bit of a stretch thinking of inanimate objects having habits. Too bad -- I think it would have been an awesome pick for the "unusual viewpoint" challenge.</td>', 'I really like the angle of this shot and the slight colorization of some of the bricks. I am very loose on "meeting the challenge", but even for me, a bit of a stretch thinking of inanimate objects having habits. Too bad -- I think it would have been an awesome pick for the "unusual viewpoint" challenge.', '2004-05-20 16:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(729197, 77551, 20779, '<td valign="top">I think the crisp focus and lighting are great. I don''t quite get it, though. Probably me.</td>', 'I think the crisp focus and lighting are great. I don''t quite get it, though. Probably me.', '2004-05-20 16:15:51.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(729198, 77645, 20779, '<td valign="top">I don''t get a connection to the challenge. I like the hare placed off-centered as he is. I would have liked a little more DOF.</td>', 'I don''t get a connection to the challenge. I like the hare placed off-centered as he is. I would have liked a little more DOF.', '2004-05-20 16:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(729199, 77397, 20779, '<td valign="top">I love flowers, particularly yellow. But I really can''t put this with the challenge at all.</td>', 'I love flowers, particularly yellow. But I really can''t put this with the challenge at all.', '2004-05-20 16:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(729202, 77065, 20779, '<td valign="top">That a Fiesta plate, isn''t it? Love ''em. Very original idea; I would have liked "seeing" the food being played with. Very pixelated on my monitor.</td>', 'That a Fiesta plate, isn''t it? Love ''em. Very original idea; I would have liked "seeing" the food being played with. Very pixelated on my monitor.', '2004-05-20 16:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(729205, 76754, 20779, '<td valign="top">Great macro. I really couldn''t make a connection to the challenge, though.</td>', 'Great macro. I really couldn''t make a connection to the challenge, though.', '2004-05-20 16:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(729206, 77510, 20779, '<td valign="top">I personally didn''t care for the toilet shots in this challenge, but tried not to base my scoring on that. However, I would have scored this higher with a tighter composition and focal point of interest.</td>', 'I personally didn''t care for the toilet shots in this challenge, but tried not to base my scoring on that. However, I would have scored this higher with a tighter composition and focal point of interest.', '2004-05-20 16:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(729211, 77698, 21367, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, great colors and dof.   I like the ripples around the bobber adds a great feel to this shot.  Did a fish just strike the line?</td>', 'Nice shot, great colors and dof.   I like the ripples around the bobber adds a great feel to this shot.  Did a fish just strike the line?', '2004-05-20 16:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(729214, 77701, 16408, '<td valign="top">I like the way the glass and the film roll, olive, etc. look but the colors of the bacjground look very much like they were created in photoshop detracting from an otherwise fine image</td>', 'I like the way the glass and the film roll, olive, etc. look but the colors of the bacjground look very much like they were created in photoshop detracting from an otherwise fine image', '2004-05-20 16:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(729224, 76207, 3102, '<td valign="top">I must admit, this is probably the best nose-picking image I have seen so far on DPC!  :)</td>', 'I must admit, this is probably the best nose-picking image I have seen so far on DPC!  :)', '2004-05-20 16:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(729230, 76251, 21920, '<td valign="top">Clean shot, though not one of my habits a suggestive picture. Some light steam from the liquid might have made it more real, crispness makes it look cold and clinical.</td>', 'Clean shot, though not one of my habits a suggestive picture. Some light steam from the liquid might have made it more real, crispness makes it look cold and clinical.', '2004-05-20 17:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(729232, 77646, 21367, '<td valign="top">Oh, I know this one too well.  I had a Lvl 99 Sorceress that rocked, 5 years of my life that I''ll never get back from Diablo, DII and the rest.<br/> <br/>Cool shot, a lot of color going on in here.  I beleive you were going for the look in the subjects eyes but I think I would have done more of a over the shoulder shot, which might have hid the file cabinet behind subject but left the Computer in view.  Shoting monitors are tough to get colors right, the only way I could get it to work (without bluing) was to light the room with flourescent lights and using the flourescent w/b of the camera.  Still a very good shot.</td>', 'Oh, I know this one too well.  I had a Lvl 99 Sorceress that rocked, 5 years of my life that I''ll never get back from Diablo, DII and the rest. Cool shot, a lot of color going on in here.  I beleive you were going for the look in the subjects eyes but I think I would have done more of a over the shoulder shot, which might have hid the file cabinet behind subject but left the Computer in view.  Shoting monitors are tough to get colors right, the only way I could get it to work (without bluing) was to light the room with flourescent lights and using the flourescent w/b of the camera.  Still a very good shot.', '2004-05-20 17:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(729243, 77501, 21367, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot, I think I still have this habit.   I like the blonde hair and eyes against the dark background.  I think the whack hair and bit of the tounge adds to this picture.  Great shot.</td>', 'Pretty cool shot, I think I still have this habit.   I like the blonde hair and eyes against the dark background.  I think the whack hair and bit of the tounge adds to this picture.  Great shot.', '2004-05-20 17:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(729247, 77326, 21920, '<td valign="top">Relaxing indeed... though imnsho the ice is a bit blasphemous =)</td>', 'Relaxing indeed... though imnsho the ice is a bit blasphemous =)', '2004-05-20 17:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(729250, 76987, 21920, '<td valign="top">Novel take and well focused.</td>', 'Novel take and well focused.', '2004-05-20 17:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(729251, 77586, 21920, '<td valign="top">For some reason this appeals alot to me.</td>', 'For some reason this appeals alot to me.', '2004-05-20 17:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(729254, 77355, 21920, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting, the pasta might be a little too "designed" but the complete picture is wonderful.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting, the pasta might be a little too "designed" but the complete picture is wonderful.', '2004-05-20 17:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(729256, 77548, 16408, '<td valign="top">nice pic but why B&amp;W?  if ever there were a subject appropriate for color it is a rainbow, or did you just add in the rainbow with photoshop?</td>', 'nice pic but why B&W?  if ever there were a subject appropriate for color it is a rainbow, or did you just add in the rainbow with photoshop?', '2004-05-20 17:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(729257, 76229, 21920, '<td valign="top">Stylish and well contained reflections.</td>', 'Stylish and well contained reflections.', '2004-05-20 17:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(729259, 77691, 3102, '<td valign="top">Did you really need to tell us it''s unedited...?</td>', 'Did you really need to tell us it''s unedited...?', '2004-05-20 17:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(729261, 77443, 21920, '<td valign="top">Not sure I see the connection to the challenge but the picture is suggestive.</td>', 'Not sure I see the connection to the challenge but the picture is suggestive.', '2004-05-20 17:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(729266, 77695, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like this as a portrait very much. The sepia tone gives it a timeless quality and the trouble expression is really wonderful. The harsh shadow where the hand is at the face is a little distracting - more fill light would help. The focus could be crisper, but it doesn''t have to be completely sharp. It seems to capture the habit challenge well - more of the emotion of nail biting than the act of it.</td>', 'I like this as a portrait very much. The sepia tone gives it a timeless quality and the trouble expression is really wonderful. The harsh shadow where the hand is at the face is a little distracting - more fill light would help. The focus could be crisper, but it doesn''t have to be completely sharp. It seems to capture the habit challenge well - more of the emotion of nail biting than the act of it.', '2004-05-20 17:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(729270, 77569, 21920, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture.</td>', 'Wonderful picture.', '2004-05-20 17:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(729273, 76586, 19780, '<td valign="top">Very nicely captured. I like the lighting and the severe use of negative space to give it an eerie quality. The composition is very good and the DOF and focus is spot on.</td>', 'Very nicely captured. I like the lighting and the severe use of negative space to give it an eerie quality. The composition is very good and the DOF and focus is spot on.', '2004-05-20 17:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(729283, 77383, 19751, '<td valign="top">a little grainy</td>', 'a little grainy', '2004-05-20 17:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(729291, 76963, 21920, '<td valign="top">Suggestive and in this instance being out of focus is the correct thing.</td>', 'Suggestive and in this instance being out of focus is the correct thing.', '2004-05-20 17:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(729292, 77691, 19333, '<td valign="top">good idea, but it seems out of focus to me.</td>', 'good idea, but it seems out of focus to me.', '2004-05-20 17:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(729294, 76294, 21920, '<td valign="top">You have to love that tounge</td>', 'You have to love that tounge', '2004-05-20 18:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(729307, 76407, 19914, '<td valign="top">it was about habits!</td>', 'it was about habits!', '2004-05-20 18:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(729312, 77073, 20210, '<td valign="top">Is this supposed to encourage drinking and driving? I''m a little confused.</td>', 'Is this supposed to encourage drinking and driving? I''m a little confused.', '2004-05-20 18:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(729313, 77307, 19914, '<td valign="top">Yes, it is a horse... but where is the "habit"?</td>', 'Yes, it is a horse... but where is the "habit"?', '2004-05-20 18:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(729316, 76251, 20210, '<td valign="top">great capture.  the lighting on the coffee is perfect!</td>', 'great capture.  the lighting on the coffee is perfect!', '2004-05-20 18:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(729320, 76192, 19914, '<td valign="top">At least you don0t say something like "the habit of shoting at the flowers"! Very nice shot. As you are not going to win, here goes a 10 for your nice flowers ;)</td>', 'At least you don0t say something like "the habit of shoting at the flowers"! Very nice shot. As you are not going to win, here goes a 10 for your nice flowers ;)', '2004-05-20 18:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(729326, 76481, 19914, '<td valign="top">It looks a little over sharpened to me, look at the white halos along the legs.</td>', 'It looks a little over sharpened to me, look at the white halos along the legs.', '2004-05-20 18:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
