(729356, 77508, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the curve of the smoke very much. The overall composition is a little bland for me - a tighter crop, less glare from the flash would have helped (but I understand lighting smoke is pretty tough). The look of the photo now gives a sense of these habits as unappealing, which works well for the challenge - they''re something that you do, but after a while you must do but not necessarily take the same enjoyment from anymore.</td>', 'I like the curve of the smoke very much. The overall composition is a little bland for me - a tighter crop, less glare from the flash would have helped (but I understand lighting smoke is pretty tough). The look of the photo now gives a sense of these habits as unappealing, which works well for the challenge - they''re something that you do, but after a while you must do but not necessarily take the same enjoyment from anymore.', '2004-05-20 18:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
