(729565, 77486, 19841, '<td valign="top">I like the motion effect of the server behind the counter.  It contrasts nicely with the stillness of the people in the foreground.  *They* aren''t in any hurry. Using the natural lighting with a slow shutter worked great on this.</td>', 'I like the motion effect of the server behind the counter.  It contrasts nicely with the stillness of the people in the foreground.  *They* aren''t in any hurry. Using the natural lighting with a slow shutter worked great on this.', '2004-05-20 22:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
