(729585, 77700, 19608, '<td valign="top">White knuckles and you''re sitting still?  Great idea and indeed a nasty habit.  Your image is at least ORIGINAL unlike a vast majority of the entries!  Lighting is superb, exposure right on.  May be a bit more effective if it weren''t quite so centerd.  A real grabber would be if the brake lights on the gray car were brightly on.</td>', 'White knuckles and you''re sitting still?  Great idea and indeed a nasty habit.  Your image is at least ORIGINAL unlike a vast majority of the entries!  Lighting is superb, exposure right on.  May be a bit more effective if it weren''t quite so centerd.  A real grabber would be if the brake lights on the gray car were brightly on.', '2004-05-20 22:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(729586, 77365, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, composition and idea.  The OOF pillar at the right front a bit troublesome.</td>', 'Nice colors, composition and idea.  The OOF pillar at the right front a bit troublesome.', '2004-05-20 22:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(729587, 77368, 21367, '<td valign="top">Great choice for a habit.    As the picture is I think the lighting could be a little better.  To really stress the habit, I may have added the human element by having  just the hands of someone holding the fanned cards in from the bottom, to give the sense that someone was looking into the cards.  There is a lot of white in this shot, I might have staged this on woodgrained table/desk just to add a little more color.  Add a cigar and a few beers (this is a boys in the kitchen setting) and you would have have many habits in one.  Good shot though, just seems a little staged without the human element to me.</td>', 'Great choice for a habit.    As the picture is I think the lighting could be a little better.  To really stress the habit, I may have added the human element by having  just the hands of someone holding the fanned cards in from the bottom, to give the sense that someone was looking into the cards.  There is a lot of white in this shot, I might have staged this on woodgrained table/desk just to add a little more color.  Add a cigar and a few beers (this is a boys in the kitchen setting) and you would have have many habits in one.  Good shot though, just seems a little staged without the human element to me.', '2004-05-20 22:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(729589, 77267, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very nice habit to have!  Good exposure and capture of the action.  The girl model does look like there''s some Adrenalin  flowing.  Composition a bit weak with the front of the boat cut off.</td>', 'A very nice habit to have!  Good exposure and capture of the action.  The girl model does look like there''s some Adrenalin  flowing.  Composition a bit weak with the front of the boat cut off.', '2004-05-20 22:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(729594, 76349, 19608, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea - nice effect to use tungsten lighting.  The shallow DoF makes it a bit difficult to read - and the bright spots in the background draw unnecessary attention.</td>', 'Interesting idea - nice effect to use tungsten lighting.  The shallow DoF makes it a bit difficult to read - and the bright spots in the background draw unnecessary attention.', '2004-05-20 22:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(729597, 77586, 21367, '<td valign="top">Excellent sharpness and detail.  I like this one.  Not quite sure if I like the dof or not, still an Excellent Shot</td>', 'Excellent sharpness and detail.  I like this one.  Not quite sure if I like the dof or not, still an Excellent Shot', '2004-05-20 22:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(729598, 77507, 19608, '<td valign="top">A lot of bad habits accumulated!  Exposure right on.  Composition leading you in from the bottom left works well.</td>', 'A lot of bad habits accumulated!  Exposure right on.  Composition leading you in from the bottom left works well.', '2004-05-20 22:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(729600, 76397, 21367, '<td valign="top">Nice, clear shot with excellent lighting.  Great job.</td>', 'Nice, clear shot with excellent lighting.  Great job.', '2004-05-20 22:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(729603, 76696, 19608, '<td valign="top">Of all the cigarette submissions, this is the most original.  It also would qualify for "unusual viewpoint."  Nice work with the wide angle lens.  Make it pop even more with a whisp of smoke from the cigarette - moved down away from his beard.  (The smoke would relly look good right in front of the strap.)  Overall - high marks!</td>', 'Of all the cigarette submissions, this is the most original.  It also would qualify for "unusual viewpoint."  Nice work with the wide angle lens.  Make it pop even more with a whisp of smoke from the cigarette - moved down away from his beard.  (The smoke would relly look good right in front of the strap.)  Overall - high marks!', '2004-05-20 22:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
