(729609, 77647, 19608, '<td valign="top">There''s a wonderful feel to this image.  Nice subtle colors both in the buildings and their reflection. Composition good but a bit crowded at the bottom.  The softness of focus on the buildings may bother some - but I kinda like it.  I toss the heavy black border.</td>', 'There''s a wonderful feel to this image.  Nice subtle colors both in the buildings and their reflection. Composition good but a bit crowded at the bottom.  The softness of focus on the buildings may bother some - but I kinda like it.  I toss the heavy black border.', '2004-05-20 22:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
