(729613, 77050, 21367, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice for habit.  I don''t know if I would have used red for the background in this shot.  I can''t seem to tell where the glass ends and the reflection starts.  If I was going to shot this with a mirror, I would have chose a darker neutral color and used a lessor angle on the shot.   Honestly I don''t think I would have tried the mirror here, instead maybe near the kitchen or bathroom sink or on a vanity to give the rich person habit feel.</td>', 'Excellent choice for habit.  I don''t know if I would have used red for the background in this shot.  I can''t seem to tell where the glass ends and the reflection starts.  If I was going to shot this with a mirror, I would have chose a darker neutral color and used a lessor angle on the shot.   Honestly I don''t think I would have tried the mirror here, instead maybe near the kitchen or bathroom sink or on a vanity to give the rich person habit feel.', '2004-05-20 22:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
