(729650, 76566, 10818, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo.  Well done.<br/> <br/>At first I was going to say...well thats not a habit, but really when you put salt and pepper on things do you really think about it?  NO.  You just do it because you have always done it. like um ........ a habit  :)</td>', 'Very cool photo.  Well done. At first I was going to say...well thats not a habit, but really when you put salt and pepper on things do you really think about it?  NO.  You just do it because you have always done it. like um ........ a habit  :)', '2004-05-20 23:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(729651, 76937, 20027, '<td valign="top">We must think alike. I ended up doing something completely different but this was almost identical to the vision I was going to try to create. DOF seems to be on the coffee mug. I might have tried a wider DOF to bring the paper into focus. Then again, that might have made the photo to busy.  Nice job.</td>', 'We must think alike. I ended up doing something completely different but this was almost identical to the vision I was going to try to create. DOF seems to be on the coffee mug. I might have tried a wider DOF to bring the paper into focus. Then again, that might have made the photo to busy.  Nice job.', '2004-05-20 23:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
