(729653, 77515, 13305, '<td valign="top">Nice pic of a senior citizen and the birds.  I think this would have more impact as a habit from the other side, and on the same level as the man''s face.  Keep on trying.</td>', 'Nice pic of a senior citizen and the birds.  I think this would have more impact as a habit from the other side, and on the same level as the man''s face.  Keep on trying.', '2004-05-20 23:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(729654, 77511, 20027, '<td valign="top">Very nice. It''s seems a bit of a stretch for the habits theme but it doesn''t change the fact that it''s an amazing photo. The color of their eyes is amazing.</td>', 'Very nice. It''s seems a bit of a stretch for the habits theme but it doesn''t change the fact that it''s an amazing photo. The color of their eyes is amazing.', '2004-05-20 23:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(729656, 77486, 21542, '<td valign="top">All in all, one of the more charming shots I''ve seen of late -- a good capture of "life per normal".  My only really concern is that it doesn''t quite scream "COFFEE" at me, as all of the logos are covered. Still an 8 in my book, though.</td>', 'All in all, one of the more charming shots I''ve seen of late -- a good capture of "life per normal".  My only really concern is that it doesn''t quite scream "COFFEE" at me, as all of the logos are covered. Still an 8 in my book, though.', '2004-05-20 23:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(729657, 77701, 13305, '<td valign="top">I like the visual jest.  I like the background,  it sort of leaps out at you.  I like the idea of using film as a garnish for the drink.  Is that a nail with the olive glued to it?  Really interesting photo.</td>', 'I like the visual jest.  I like the background,  it sort of leaps out at you.  I like the idea of using film as a garnish for the drink.  Is that a nail with the olive glued to it?  Really interesting photo.', '2004-05-20 23:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
