(729662, 77044, 20027, '<td valign="top">Very good. Great lighting and composition. One suggestion: The bottles don''t look cold. I don''t see any condensation on them. As a product shot, they would look much more tempting and refreshing if they had condensation on them. Great nonetheless! 7</td>', 'Very good. Great lighting and composition. One suggestion: The bottles don''t look cold. I don''t see any condensation on them. As a product shot, they would look much more tempting and refreshing if they had condensation on them. Great nonetheless! 7', '2004-05-20 23:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
