(729664, 76178, 21542, '<td valign="top">I like the flame capture (and that''s saying something after having looked at WAY too many "Fire &amp; Ice"''s in the opposites challenge), and there''s certainly no confussion over the "bad habit" depicted.  If there had been a way to capture a little less of the blues on the right side of the shot, it would have been just that much better in my book, but it''s still a solid shot.</td>', 'I like the flame capture (and that''s saying something after having looked at WAY too many "Fire & Ice"''s in the opposites challenge), and there''s certainly no confussion over the "bad habit" depicted.  If there had been a way to capture a little less of the blues on the right side of the shot, it would have been just that much better in my book, but it''s still a solid shot.', '2004-05-20 23:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
