(729673, 76586, 21542, '<td valign="top">I like the idea presented, but for me the shot is just dark enough to mask the fact that the subject''s opening a refridgerator door.  Just a touch more light on the outside of the door would have lent a whole new world of character to the shot.</td>', 'I like the idea presented, but for me the shot is just dark enough to mask the fact that the subject''s opening a refridgerator door.  Just a touch more light on the outside of the door would have lent a whole new world of character to the shot.', '2004-05-20 23:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(729678, 76716, 21367, '<td valign="top">I like the white ashtray against the dark background here, it really makes it jump out at ya.  However It also makes the cropped edge of the ashtray stand out.  I like the simple approach that you have taken but I don''t think that I would have cropped it the same way.  I would have included the entire ashtray and might have left a bit more on top to catch a little more of the smoke.   Just my thoughts.</td>', 'I like the white ashtray against the dark background here, it really makes it jump out at ya.  However It also makes the cropped edge of the ashtray stand out.  I like the simple approach that you have taken but I don''t think that I would have cropped it the same way.  I would have included the entire ashtray and might have left a bit more on top to catch a little more of the smoke.   Just my thoughts.', '2004-05-20 23:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(729679, 76586, 20027, '<td valign="top">dramatic lighting, well done. I''d like to see more of your face by changing the angle of the shot and cropping some of the black space from the left side.</td>', 'dramatic lighting, well done. I''d like to see more of your face by changing the angle of the shot and cropping some of the black space from the left side.', '2004-05-20 23:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
