(729682, 77133, 21542, '<td valign="top">From this shot, all I''m getting is a parked car.   Parking is rarely a common "habit", though this does appear to be parked in the middle of the road, and that could be a little dangerous (::grin::).  Regardless, a slightly longer shutter speed to capture just a bit of the motion blur would give us a significantly stronger whack over the head as to what''s going on here and what the "habit" might be.</td>', 'From this shot, all I''m getting is a parked car.   Parking is rarely a common "habit", though this does appear to be parked in the middle of the road, and that could be a little dangerous (::grin::).  Regardless, a slightly longer shutter speed to capture just a bit of the motion blur would give us a significantly stronger whack over the head as to what''s going on here and what the "habit" might be.', '2004-05-20 23:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
