(729693, 77699, 21542, '<td valign="top">absolutely, bloody FANTASTIC!!!!!  This is certainly one of those moments where the title makes the shot (though it could live w/o the "bad -" portion and still get the point across).  And not only is the topic top-notch, but it''s also technically flawless as far as I can tell.  Ya have to respect a photographer w/ this twisted a sense of humor! ::grin::</td>', 'absolutely, bloody FANTASTIC!!!!!  This is certainly one of those moments where the title makes the shot (though it could live w/o the "bad -" portion and still get the point across).  And not only is the topic top-notch, but it''s also technically flawless as far as I can tell.  Ya have to respect a photographer w/ this twisted a sense of humor! ::grin::', '2004-05-20 23:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
