(729700, 77505, 21542, '<td valign="top">The title doesn''t do anything for me, and the giant blotch of white just doesn''t serve the picture for the better.</td>', 'The title doesn''t do anything for me, and the giant blotch of white just doesn''t serve the picture for the better.', '2004-05-20 23:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(729701, 77695, 21542, '<td valign="top">Conceptually, a good start to an idea.  Technically, it leaves quite a bit to be desired.  The lack of focus detracts from the shot and brings out too much of a "snapshot" characteristic for my taste.  The sepia tone is a good choice, but unfortunately it''s not enough to mask the haloing around so many of the high-contrast boundries.  And with a bedspread that busy, a much shallower DOF would have served you many times better.</td>', 'Conceptually, a good start to an idea.  Technically, it leaves quite a bit to be desired.  The lack of focus detracts from the shot and brings out too much of a "snapshot" characteristic for my taste.  The sepia tone is a good choice, but unfortunately it''s not enough to mask the haloing around so many of the high-contrast boundries.  And with a bedspread that busy, a much shallower DOF would have served you many times better.', '2004-05-20 23:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(729703, 76934, 21542, '<td valign="top">The topic doesn''t do it for me, and the lack of any hint as to the action taking place (other than the title) leaves me thinking only, "Huh?"  Everybody has their opinions, though.</td>', 'The topic doesn''t do it for me, and the lack of any hint as to the action taking place (other than the title) leaves me thinking only, "Huh?"  Everybody has their opinions, though.', '2004-05-20 23:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
