(729710, 77501, 21542, '<td valign="top">Eeewwww.... Should never let a kid''s first habit be playing in the hair gel!!!  That''s just WAY messy! ::huge grin::<br/> <br/>Honestly, I like it.  It''s cute, it''s homey, it''s warm. Technically it''s got good skin tone, the focus is solid, and the composition leaves little to be desired.  Unfortunately, I am left guessing what the topic of the shot is, or rather, what the "habit" is that we''re going for here.  While I enjoy the shot, I can''t pull enough topic out of it to rank it highly.</td>', 'Eeewwww.... Should never let a kid''s first habit be playing in the hair gel!!!  That''s just WAY messy! ::huge grin:: Honestly, I like it.  It''s cute, it''s homey, it''s warm. Technically it''s got good skin tone, the focus is solid, and the composition leaves little to be desired.  Unfortunately, I am left guessing what the topic of the shot is, or rather, what the "habit" is that we''re going for here.  While I enjoy the shot, I can''t pull enough topic out of it to rank it highly.', '2004-05-20 23:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
