(729718, 77510, 21542, '<td valign="top">While it fits the topic (sort of), personally, I can find nothing artistic to praise about this shot.  I suppose it would work for rental documentation, but beyond that, it''s severely lacking on every major point.</td>', 'While it fits the topic (sort of), personally, I can find nothing artistic to praise about this shot.  I suppose it would work for rental documentation, but beyond that, it''s severely lacking on every major point.', '2004-05-21 00:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(729719, 77671, 18349, '<td valign="top">Now that deserves some therapy, don''t you think?  :o)</td>', 'Now that deserves some therapy, don''t you think?  :o)', '2004-05-21 00:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(729721, 76863, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great title...fitting!   Bet you aren''t the only one with a secret speeding habit! :o)</td>', 'Great title...fitting!   Bet you aren''t the only one with a secret speeding habit! :o)', '2004-05-21 00:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(729726, 77673, 21542, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  The lighting is wonderful!  I''m left wanting a shallower DOF, but to me it''s not tradgic enough to score down much at all for it. The tonalities of the face are just unbelievable!!!</td>', 'Great shot!  The lighting is wonderful!  I''m left wanting a shallower DOF, but to me it''s not tradgic enough to score down much at all for it. The tonalities of the face are just unbelievable!!!', '2004-05-21 00:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(729731, 77375, 21542, '<td valign="top">Nice.  This would probably be one of those rare moments that I''d play on the stereotypes and use a woman for the model, but that''s really grasping at staws.  All in all, a fresh, creative piece that even holds together technically.</td>', 'Nice.  This would probably be one of those rare moments that I''d play on the stereotypes and use a woman for the model, but that''s really grasping at staws.  All in all, a fresh, creative piece that even holds together technically.', '2004-05-21 00:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(729736, 77702, 21542, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Simply put, one of the strongest shots I''ve seen yet.  I t does leave me want a shallower DOF, though, so not _quite_ top marks...</td>', 'Love it.  Simply put, one of the strongest shots I''ve seen yet.  I t does leave me want a shallower DOF, though, so not _quite_ top marks...', '2004-05-21 00:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(729747, 77006, 21542, '<td valign="top">I think the concept is fabulous, and there''s real skill in macro work here.  My only disenchantment with the piece is that I have to look at the title to understand whic direction, if any, the ring is travelling, and the title is also my only clue as to how this fits in with "habits".  While dreadfully difficult to do in macor shots, a shutter speed long enough to create a blur on the ring and "right" hand to denote direction of motion would have been a stronger clue.</td>', 'I think the concept is fabulous, and there''s real skill in macro work here.  My only disenchantment with the piece is that I have to look at the title to understand whic direction, if any, the ring is travelling, and the title is also my only clue as to how this fits in with "habits".  While dreadfully difficult to do in macor shots, a shutter speed long enough to create a blur on the ring and "right" hand to denote direction of motion would have been a stronger clue.', '2004-05-21 00:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(729753, 77674, 21542, '<td valign="top">While Ben &amp; Jerry''s may have been a better choice from where I sit, I love it!  Technically I think the shot may have been better served by a narrower brightness gradiant, i.e. I find the brightness of the  top too far contrasted with the darkness of the bottom.  Mind, you, not really tradgic enough to take away from the shot!</td>', 'While Ben & Jerry''s may have been a better choice from where I sit, I love it!  Technically I think the shot may have been better served by a narrower brightness gradiant, i.e. I find the brightness of the  top too far contrasted with the darkness of the bottom.  Mind, you, not really tradgic enough to take away from the shot!', '2004-05-21 00:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(729755, 77372, 21367, '<td valign="top">Excellent details, great colors and dof.  I think you could have cropped the left side a little to remove the person standing in the background leaving your subject to the left side of the frame.  The hardest thing about taking pictures for me (being a virgo every thing has to be organized) was learning to not center everything.  The woman is looking to our right so it is ok to leave that space as if she is looking out over something.  Just my thoughts. Excellent picture.</td>', 'Excellent details, great colors and dof.  I think you could have cropped the left side a little to remove the person standing in the background leaving your subject to the left side of the frame.  The hardest thing about taking pictures for me (being a virgo every thing has to be organized) was learning to not center everything.  The woman is looking to our right so it is ok to leave that space as if she is looking out over something.  Just my thoughts. Excellent picture.', '2004-05-21 00:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(729756, 76459, 21542, '<td valign="top">great start, but take it a step further...  The characters on the buttons are going to be the defining point of your subject, so use them!  The lighting is bold, and the shadows really help to define the angle.  Definitely a great start.</td>', 'great start, but take it a step further...  The characters on the buttons are going to be the defining point of your subject, so use them!  The lighting is bold, and the shadows really help to define the angle.  Definitely a great start.', '2004-05-21 00:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(729757, 77686, 21367, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Good lighting and dof.  Excellent details.  Good Job.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Good lighting and dof.  Excellent details.  Good Job.', '2004-05-21 00:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(729758, 76955, 21542, '<td valign="top">Well, the topic pretty much works, but the composition is just too haphazard for me to take the shot for much more than a snapshot at a family reunion.  The noise level is also so high in this shot as to distract from most of the other content (and yes, I''m looking at the subject''s left arm, shirt, and shorts to see the noise, not the sausages).  And anytime such a large white spot appears in a shot, you can be assured that all attention will be dragged away from your subjects.</td>', 'Well, the topic pretty much works, but the composition is just too haphazard for me to take the shot for much more than a snapshot at a family reunion.  The noise level is also so high in this shot as to distract from most of the other content (and yes, I''m looking at the subject''s left arm, shirt, and shorts to see the noise, not the sausages).  And anytime such a large white spot appears in a shot, you can be assured that all attention will be dragged away from your subjects.', '2004-05-21 00:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(729759, 77424, 21542, '<td valign="top">Not really enough "habit" for me to go on here, and I find myself thinking the shot''s too cluttered to hold my attention.</td>', 'Not really enough "habit" for me to go on here, and I find myself thinking the shot''s too cluttered to hold my attention.', '2004-05-21 00:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(729760, 77675, 21542, '<td valign="top">Add a revolver, and you''ve got a fantastic poster with which to plasters the walls of the ATF! ::grin::  Great shot.  The dust on the mirror in the lower right is just the slightest bit distracting to me, but in the concept of the whole shot, I forget about it quickly.  Nice job!</td>', 'Add a revolver, and you''ve got a fantastic poster with which to plasters the walls of the ATF! ::grin::  Great shot.  The dust on the mirror in the lower right is just the slightest bit distracting to me, but in the concept of the whole shot, I forget about it quickly.  Nice job!', '2004-05-21 00:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(729762, 77488, 21542, '<td valign="top">LOVE IT!  Just the littlest bit of the "SONY" label showing is keeping me from giving it a 10, as I find that too distracting. but it''s certainly a solid 9 in my book!</td>', 'LOVE IT!  Just the littlest bit of the "SONY" label showing is keeping me from giving it a 10, as I find that too distracting. but it''s certainly a solid 9 in my book!', '2004-05-21 00:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(729764, 77691, 21367, '<td valign="top">Great colors, nice pic.  I think you have just a little too much light directly on the brush.  The detail in the bristle area seem to disappear.  I like that effect I beleive that you was going for (that little twinkle thing we see on peoples teeth in TV commercials) in the area top left of the brush.  It just seems a little bright to me.</td>', 'Great colors, nice pic.  I think you have just a little too much light directly on the brush.  The detail in the bristle area seem to disappear.  I like that effect I beleive that you was going for (that little twinkle thing we see on peoples teeth in TV commercials) in the area top left of the brush.  It just seems a little bright to me.', '2004-05-21 00:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(729765, 77701, 18461, '<td valign="top">Love it.  The background makes the glass stand out.</td>', 'Love it.  The background makes the glass stand out.', '2004-05-21 00:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(729766, 77675, 21367, '<td valign="top">Nice, very nice.  You got the lighting right, clarity and detail are excellent.  Great props and crop.  Great job.</td>', 'Nice, very nice.  You got the lighting right, clarity and detail are excellent.  Great props and crop.  Great job.', '2004-05-21 00:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(729767, 76904, 21542, '<td valign="top">almost wasn''t going to comment on this one, just give it a great score and move on, but...<br/> <br/>WHERE CAN I GET SMARTIES CHOCOLATES!!!!!!!!!!<br/> <br/>(guess you''re not the only one with the addiction. ::grin::)</td>', 'almost wasn''t going to comment on this one, just give it a great score and move on, but... WHERE CAN I GET SMARTIES CHOCOLATES!!!!!!!!!! (guess you''re not the only one with the addiction. ::grin::)', '2004-05-21 00:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(729768, 77128, 18461, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Great job on the lightingm</td>', 'Nice photo.  Great job on the lightingm', '2004-05-21 00:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(729769, 77372, 21542, '<td valign="top">gotta love a good faire pic...</td>', 'gotta love a good faire pic...', '2004-05-21 00:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(729770, 77666, 21542, '<td valign="top">power lines, but you''ll probably get that a few times...  Great title, though!</td>', 'power lines, but you''ll probably get that a few times...  Great title, though!', '2004-05-21 00:32:29.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(729772, 76715, 21542, '<td valign="top">too harsh for my taste (the shot, not the sugar-shock!)</td>', 'too harsh for my taste (the shot, not the sugar-shock!)', '2004-05-21 00:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(729775, 76254, 21542, '<td valign="top">great motion capture!  I love it!  Of course, the fact that I''m a recording engineer certainly doesn''t make me enjoy this shot any _less_! ::grin::</td>', 'great motion capture!  I love it!  Of course, the fact that I''m a recording engineer certainly doesn''t make me enjoy this shot any _less_! ::grin::', '2004-05-21 00:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(729777, 77307, 21542, '<td valign="top">yup, it''s a horse.  And now for a "habit"?</td>', 'yup, it''s a horse.  And now for a "habit"?', '2004-05-21 00:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(729780, 77586, 18461, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like how you can see the indentations in the paper.  I also like how the pen and the word habit is in focus and the rest is blurred.  Great job.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like how you can see the indentations in the paper.  I also like how the pen and the word habit is in focus and the rest is blurred.  Great job.', '2004-05-21 00:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(729781, 76584, 21542, '<td valign="top">bedspread looks more like  tablecloth than anything else, and the coffee is down-played so much that I only went searching for it after reading the title.</td>', 'bedspread looks more like  tablecloth than anything else, and the coffee is down-played so much that I only went searching for it after reading the title.', '2004-05-21 00:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(729784, 77698, 18461, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I hope you cought something.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I hope you cought something.', '2004-05-21 00:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(729785, 77259, 21542, '<td valign="top">good motion capture, but there''s still enough noise in the shot to make it look like a still from a digital video.  I do appreciate the concept, though.</td>', 'good motion capture, but there''s still enough noise in the shot to make it look like a still from a digital video.  I do appreciate the concept, though.', '2004-05-21 00:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(729791, 77371, 21542, '<td valign="top">while it would probably make for a great texture layer in Photoshop, I can''t even begin to imagine what this picture might be</td>', 'while it would probably make for a great texture layer in Photoshop, I can''t even begin to imagine what this picture might be', '2004-05-21 00:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(729792, 77006, 18461, '<td valign="top">Great job with the lighting.  I also like the sepia tone.  I don''t think it would have been as effective just black and white.</td>', 'Great job with the lighting.  I also like the sepia tone.  I don''t think it would have been as effective just black and white.', '2004-05-21 00:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(729793, 77704, 21542, '<td valign="top">This has corporate brochure all over it! ::grin:: At LEAST an 8!</td>', 'This has corporate brochure all over it! ::grin:: At LEAST an 8!', '2004-05-21 00:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(729795, 77276, 21542, '<td valign="top">Well if that isn''t one of the more disturbing shots I''ve come across!?!?!  But, not only does it fit the topic solidly enough, it''s also pretty impressive from a technical note.  An 8!</td>', 'Well if that isn''t one of the more disturbing shots I''ve come across!?!?!  But, not only does it fit the topic solidly enough, it''s also pretty impressive from a technical note.  An 8!', '2004-05-21 00:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(729797, 76291, 18461, '<td valign="top">Backgound is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Backgound is a bit distracting.', '2004-05-21 00:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(729799, 77657, 21542, '<td valign="top">Focus. It''s a killer...</td>', 'Focus. It''s a killer...', '2004-05-21 00:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(729801, 77675, 18461, '<td valign="top">Great compostiton and very effective lighting.</td>', 'Great compostiton and very effective lighting.', '2004-05-21 00:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(729802, 77206, 21542, '<td valign="top">Wish there were a good way to get rid of noise in cases like these, because, in my book, the noise level is about the only thing keeping this from being a 10.  Gotta go with a 7, though.</td>', 'Wish there were a good way to get rid of noise in cases like these, because, in my book, the noise level is about the only thing keeping this from being a 10.  Gotta go with a 7, though.', '2004-05-21 00:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(729806, 77010, 21542, '<td valign="top">a good shot, but the reflections are just too distracting in this case.  A polarizing filter would do wonders.</td>', 'a good shot, but the reflections are just too distracting in this case.  A polarizing filter would do wonders.', '2004-05-21 00:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(729807, 76754, 18461, '<td valign="top">Great detail.</td>', 'Great detail.', '2004-05-21 00:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(729808, 77703, 21542, '<td valign="top">This has a great warm feel to it, but I find the silver nail polish (or in fact, and polish at all) to be distracting.</td>', 'This has a great warm feel to it, but I find the silver nail polish (or in fact, and polish at all) to be distracting.', '2004-05-21 00:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(729809, 77513, 19608, '<td valign="top">Sometimes I wish I had gone fishin'' - rather than score image after image of toliet seats, cigarettes, and noses!  You get an extra point just for the relief!  It''s an ORIGINAL idea (sigh) and well exposed and composed.  Not terribly exciting however.</td>', 'Sometimes I wish I had gone fishin'' - rather than score image after image of toliet seats, cigarettes, and noses!  You get an extra point just for the relief!  It''s an ORIGINAL idea (sigh) and well exposed and composed.  Not terribly exciting however.', '2004-05-21 00:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(729810, 76213, 18461, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the lighting.</td>', 'Nice job with the lighting.', '2004-05-21 00:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(729811, 76349, 21542, '<td valign="top">waiting a split second longer to grab a full "drip" would have bumped this one up a few point, for me anyway.</td>', 'waiting a split second longer to grab a full "drip" would have bumped this one up a few point, for me anyway.', '2004-05-21 00:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(729812, 77569, 18461, '<td valign="top">Love it.  It reminds me of my cousin.</td>', 'Love it.  It reminds me of my cousin.', '2004-05-21 00:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(729814, 77550, 19608, '<td valign="top">It certainly is a habit - apparently a  very popular one considering the number of entries of a similar vein.  Unfortunately I don''t see much more than that - nothing reaches out and says "wow."</td>', 'It certainly is a habit - apparently a  very popular one considering the number of entries of a similar vein.  Unfortunately I don''t see much more than that - nothing reaches out and says "wow."', '2004-05-21 00:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(729816, 76937, 21542, '<td valign="top">A solid shot.  Pulling down the blue might have been an option, but I don''t think it''s problematic this time ''round.</td>', 'A solid shot.  Pulling down the blue might have been an option, but I don''t think it''s problematic this time ''round.', '2004-05-21 00:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(729817, 76242, 19608, '<td valign="top">Of all the "smoking" images, this is one that has some redeeming value.  Has a bit of a "Norman Rockwall" feel.  The smoke by your models ear is great.</td>', 'Of all the "smoking" images, this is one that has some redeeming value.  Has a bit of a "Norman Rockwall" feel.  The smoke by your models ear is great.', '2004-05-21 00:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(729819, 77271, 18461, '<td valign="top">Absolutely awesome!</td>', 'Absolutely awesome!', '2004-05-21 00:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(729822, 77233, 18461, '<td valign="top">Nice job.</td>', 'Nice job.', '2004-05-21 00:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(729823, 77581, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s great rendition - nice work on the composition, exposure and "printing."  Nice blacks alng with some white whites and a good tonal range in between.  The background and its textures goes well.  I think it would be even more powerful if the model did exactly what he was doing but shifted his eyes towards the camera (not the head - just the eyes) - maybe not full eye contact, but some the eyes were more visible.</td>', 'It''s great rendition - nice work on the composition, exposure and "printing."  Nice blacks alng with some white whites and a good tonal range in between.  The background and its textures goes well.  I think it would be even more powerful if the model did exactly what he was doing but shifted his eyes towards the camera (not the head - just the eyes) - maybe not full eye contact, but some the eyes were more visible.', '2004-05-21 00:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(729826, 77268, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very unusual portrait.  At first glance, I saw a hand under her chin with a finger pushing the chin up....  So it''s abit mysterious and makes you look twice.</td>', 'A very unusual portrait.  At first glance, I saw a hand under her chin with a finger pushing the chin up....  So it''s abit mysterious and makes you look twice.', '2004-05-21 01:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(729831, 76986, 19608, '<td valign="top">Habit?  Not likely - just a trait of the breed.  But it is still a very captivating image nonetheless.  Very nice exposure, composition and lighting.  And... it''s not a toilet seat!</td>', 'Habit?  Not likely - just a trait of the breed.  But it is still a very captivating image nonetheless.  Very nice exposure, composition and lighting.  And... it''s not a toilet seat!', '2004-05-21 01:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(729832, 77698, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - colorful image - and it''s not gross like many that were submitted.</td>', 'Nice idea - colorful image - and it''s not gross like many that were submitted.', '2004-05-21 01:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(729837, 76542, 19608, '<td valign="top">Ah, one of the few ORIGINAL ideas in this challenge.  Looks good in the "slim Jim" framing.  Techinique wise, it has some problems:  1) The print is "muddy" with o real crisp whites and no "black blacks."  2) This is exacerbated by the bright white in your frame - that white competes with the image ... and it wins.</td>', 'Ah, one of the few ORIGINAL ideas in this challenge.  Looks good in the "slim Jim" framing.  Techinique wise, it has some problems:  1) The print is "muddy" with o real crisp whites and no "black blacks."  2) This is exacerbated by the bright white in your frame - that white competes with the image ... and it wins.', '2004-05-21 01:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(729841, 77073, 21367, '<td valign="top">Just a little too dark for me, I would like to see a little (just a little) more detail of the keys.  I might have tried a maglite (tight circle on the keys) to give the impression of a cops flashlight going through the car or something of that nature.  Good idea, bad habit.</td>', 'Just a little too dark for me, I would like to see a little (just a little) more detail of the keys.  I might have tried a maglite (tight circle on the keys) to give the impression of a cops flashlight going through the car or something of that nature.  Good idea, bad habit.', '2004-05-21 01:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(729851, 76948, 21367, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the white background sets this all up nicely.  Very clear and lots of detail.   Great shot.  Being nit picky in a commercial sense (no points off here) the angle in which the hand is placing the coin makes the index finger appear a little puffy and unnatural near the knuckle .  This would be a good stock photo.  Great job.</td>', 'Very nice, the white background sets this all up nicely.  Very clear and lots of detail.   Great shot.  Being nit picky in a commercial sense (no points off here) the angle in which the hand is placing the coin makes the index finger appear a little puffy and unnatural near the knuckle .  This would be a good stock photo.  Great job.', '2004-05-21 01:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(729852, 77515, 21158, '<td valign="top">capturing the bird in mid flight transforms this scene from average to above average.  great pic</td>', 'capturing the bird in mid flight transforms this scene from average to above average.  great pic', '2004-05-21 01:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(729853, 76268, 21367, '<td valign="top">This looks like an expense habit to have.   Great composition but a tad bit too dark for me.  Maybe a soft light in the room would have lit it up to pick up just a little more detail.  Good shot.</td>', 'This looks like an expense habit to have.   Great composition but a tad bit too dark for me.  Maybe a soft light in the room would have lit it up to pick up just a little more detail.  Good shot.', '2004-05-21 01:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(729854, 77413, 21367, '<td valign="top">Now there''s an expensive habit.  Nice detail and clarity.  good dof.</td>', 'Now there''s an expensive habit.  Nice detail and clarity.  good dof.', '2004-05-21 01:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(729855, 76251, 21158, '<td valign="top">my only complaint is the black/white border should have been all black. the white gets lost in the background.</td>', 'my only complaint is the black/white border should have been all black. the white gets lost in the background.', '2004-05-21 01:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
