(729994, 76830, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice balance between the design elements.  If it were possible to take this from a lower point of view it would have obscured the background greenery and houses which are somewhat distracting.  Also a touch underexposed on the bottom which removes some detail.  That''s not all bad if it was your intent to do so in order to emphasize the brighter graphiti elements.</td>', 'Nice balance between the design elements.  If it were possible to take this from a lower point of view it would have obscured the background greenery and houses which are somewhat distracting.  Also a touch underexposed on the bottom which removes some detail.  That''s not all bad if it was your intent to do so in order to emphasize the brighter graphiti elements.', '2004-05-21 07:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(729995, 76146, 20204, '<td valign="top">Depth of field problem - the hand is out of focus, as is part of the lower computer screen.</td>', 'Depth of field problem - the hand is out of focus, as is part of the lower computer screen.', '2004-05-21 08:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(729997, 76607, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great expression!</td>', 'Great expression!', '2004-05-21 08:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(729998, 77259, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great use of motion blur.  The front foot is very clear, and the back one captures the running motion perfectly.  There''s a little distraction from the window on the left.</td>', 'Great use of motion blur.  The front foot is very clear, and the back one captures the running motion perfectly.  There''s a little distraction from the window on the left.', '2004-05-21 08:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
