(730005, 77028, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the darkness of this image and the mezmerized look on the child''s face - well composed.  I''m not sure if its lacking focus, or if its just the dark exposure, but I would like to see more sharpness / clariy in the child''s face.</td>', 'I like the darkness of this image and the mezmerized look on the child''s face - well composed.  I''m not sure if its lacking focus, or if its just the dark exposure, but I would like to see more sharpness / clariy in the child''s face.', '2004-05-21 08:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(730006, 77664, 20204, '<td valign="top">Not a very sharp image, and the background elements are competing with the subject.</td>', 'Not a very sharp image, and the background elements are competing with the subject.', '2004-05-21 08:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(730007, 76253, 20204, '<td valign="top">This guy looks like subject of another recent chalenge.  Either way he''s very photogenic.  I like the use of depth of field here to keep the background realistic but not competing with the competition.  Nice lighting as well.</td>', 'This guy looks like subject of another recent chalenge.  Either way he''s very photogenic.  I like the use of depth of field here to keep the background realistic but not competing with the competition.  Nice lighting as well.', '2004-05-21 08:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
