(730009, 77044, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the combination with the shadows on the floor, but the baseboard molding in the background is a distraction.  It also appears that only the first bottle is in focus, so some depth of field adjustments were needed.</td>', 'I like the combination with the shadows on the floor, but the baseboard molding in the background is a distraction.  It also appears that only the first bottle is in focus, so some depth of field adjustments were needed.', '2004-05-21 08:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
