(730013, 77254, 20204, '<td valign="top">The Irish Mist bottle has a focus issue.  There''s also a lack of sharpness which detracts from the image.  I think a bit more lighting on the upper parts would have helped fill in some of the shadows as well.  There is a notable tilt (see left side) which could have been fixed in your editor.</td>', 'The Irish Mist bottle has a focus issue.  There''s also a lack of sharpness which detracts from the image.  I think a bit more lighting on the upper parts would have helped fill in some of the shadows as well.  There is a notable tilt (see left side) which could have been fixed in your editor.', '2004-05-21 08:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(730016, 77355, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this, and the gradient of the lighting.  The fork feels fuzzy to me though.  If this were razor sharp I would have rated it very highly.</td>', 'I like the composition of this, and the gradient of the lighting.  The fork feels fuzzy to me though.  If this were razor sharp I would have rated it very highly.', '2004-05-21 08:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
