(730018, 77508, 20204, '<td valign="top">The subject is significantly tilted.  There is some overexposure on the bottle - looks like you used flash.  I like the uncluttered background keeping your attention where it should be.</td>', 'The subject is significantly tilted.  There is some overexposure on the bottle - looks like you used flash.  I like the uncluttered background keeping your attention where it should be.', '2004-05-21 08:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
