(730020, 77647, 16126, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, nice composition. Don''t like the DOF though: the background should be either sharp or more out of focus, as it is now it draws my attention away from the bird. 6</td>', 'Nice colors, nice composition. Don''t like the DOF though: the background should be either sharp or more out of focus, as it is now it draws my attention away from the bird. 6', '2004-05-21 08:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
