(730120, 77267, 14202, '<td valign="top">Good photo... but I feel it is to tightly cropped...would have liked to have seen the entire boat..</td>', 'Good photo... but I feel it is to tightly cropped...would have liked to have seen the entire boat..', '2004-05-21 10:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
