(730136, 76146, 14202, '<td valign="top">I think there are a few ppl with this habit... :)  I find the finger and hand being out of focus a bit distracting.</td>', 'I think there are a few ppl with this habit... :)  I find the finger and hand being out of focus a bit distracting.', '2004-05-21 10:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
