(730141, 77488, 14202, '<td valign="top">Quite a few ppl with this habit I''m sure.  Love the way how the entire pict. is in folocus and the lighting has been done well... congrats.</td>', 'Quite a few ppl with this habit I''m sure.  Love the way how the entire pict. is in folocus and the lighting has been done well... congrats.', '2004-05-21 10:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(730143, 77655, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great pastel colors against a perfect black background.  A bit soft in spots.</td>', 'Great pastel colors against a perfect black background.  A bit soft in spots.', '2004-05-21 10:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(730144, 77128, 18820, '<td valign="top">Great Idea... Super Picture - I thought of the "habit" and couldn''t figure a creative way to portray them, this picture is SUPER!</td>', 'Great Idea... Super Picture - I thought of the "habit" and couldn''t figure a creative way to portray them, this picture is SUPER!', '2004-05-21 10:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(730149, 77699, 19608, '<td valign="top">Graphic lines and shapes against a dark background.  Nice lighting.  Smoke well positioned and adds a nice visual element.  The title is a definite "gotcha."</td>', 'Graphic lines and shapes against a dark background.  Nice lighting.  Smoke well positioned and adds a nice visual element.  The title is a definite "gotcha."', '2004-05-21 10:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(730150, 76624, 14202, '<td valign="top">very sharp, great tones and perfect timing  (scuse the pun).  Well done.</td>', 'very sharp, great tones and perfect timing  (scuse the pun).  Well done.', '2004-05-21 10:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(730152, 76904, 19608, '<td valign="top">Yum yum.  Nice use of the hints of color. Well composed and exposed.  Not a lot of "impact"</td>', 'Yum yum.  Nice use of the hints of color. Well composed and exposed.  Not a lot of "impact"', '2004-05-21 10:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(730153, 77497, 11895, '<td valign="top">nice pictire but it''s over exposed; and cropping some off the left side would eliminate dark spots in 2 corners</td>', 'nice pictire but it''s over exposed; and cropping some off the left side would eliminate dark spots in 2 corners', '2004-05-21 10:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(730154, 76830, 21816, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this one!</td>', 'I like the idea of this one!', '2004-05-21 10:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(730155, 77076, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very nice silhouette well composed.  The slanting line from bottom left leading you up to the biker is perfect.  Sepia effect works.  Water in the sunlit area is blown out a bit and the sky doesn''t do much for you but makes an effective negative space.</td>', 'A very nice silhouette well composed.  The slanting line from bottom left leading you up to the biker is perfect.  Sepia effect works.  Water in the sunlit area is blown out a bit and the sky doesn''t do much for you but makes an effective negative space.', '2004-05-21 10:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(730156, 77551, 16241, '<td valign="top">i like this</td>', 'i like this', '2004-05-21 10:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(730158, 76178, 15919, '<td valign="top">Ok image, though very small and maybe not very original.</td>', 'Ok image, though very small and maybe not very original.', '2004-05-21 10:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(730159, 76873, 14202, '<td valign="top">IMO this may have looked better in colour..but still a good photo as is.</td>', 'IMO this may have looked better in colour..but still a good photo as is.', '2004-05-21 10:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(730160, 76403, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice abstract</td>', 'nice abstract', '2004-05-21 10:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(730161, 77640, 19608, '<td valign="top">An effective very low light shot.  Too bad the light is right next to the top of the model''s head.</td>', 'An effective very low light shot.  Too bad the light is right next to the top of the model''s head.', '2004-05-21 10:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(730162, 77234, 14202, '<td valign="top">nice shot, just a little to burnt are the eyes and forehead...</td>', 'nice shot, just a little to burnt are the eyes and forehead...', '2004-05-21 10:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(730163, 77545, 19841, '<td valign="top">I think black-and-white was a poor choice for this shot.  Grey skin looks dead.  Either sepia tone or full color would have been more appealing.  I am impressed by the clear focus and dynamic composition.</td>', 'I think black-and-white was a poor choice for this shot.  Grey skin looks dead.  Either sepia tone or full color would have been more appealing.  I am impressed by the clear focus and dynamic composition.', '2004-05-21 10:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(730164, 76253, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great exposure on the critter!  Beautiful colors and perfect focus on the eye.  You absolutely MUST get rid of that car!</td>', 'Great exposure on the critter!  Beautiful colors and perfect focus on the eye.  You absolutely MUST get rid of that car!', '2004-05-21 10:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(730165, 77685, 16241, '<td valign="top">good one</td>', 'good one', '2004-05-21 10:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(730167, 77407, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2004-05-21 10:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(730168, 76643, 14202, '<td valign="top">Like the contrast of the coffee and the cup and the angle taken and the lighting...well done</td>', 'Like the contrast of the coffee and the cup and the angle taken and the lighting...well done', '2004-05-21 10:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(730169, 76875, 15919, '<td valign="top">It´s hard to say it fits the challenge but this image is just to good to rate it low.</td>', 'It´s hard to say it fits the challenge but this image is just to good to rate it low.', '2004-05-21 10:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(730170, 76843, 21816, '<td valign="top">This is cool. The rich colour is fantastic. I find it to be one of those photos that has me examining every little part of it. The pineapple shaped chocolate works well as the main point of focus. Well done.</td>', 'This is cool. The rich colour is fantastic. I find it to be one of those photos that has me examining every little part of it. The pineapple shaped chocolate works well as the main point of focus. Well done.', '2004-05-21 10:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(730171, 76254, 16241, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2004-05-21 10:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(730172, 77407, 19608, '<td valign="top">A refreshing entry among the "ugly" submissions.  This is very well done.</td>', 'A refreshing entry among the "ugly" submissions.  This is very well done.', '2004-05-21 10:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(730173, 76696, 19841, '<td valign="top">Overall the composition is nice, but you have an unfortunate overlap.  <br/>The position of the hot end of the cigarette adds a diluting touch of humor to an otherwise dramatic and intense image.  Your beard is on fire!</td>', 'Overall the composition is nice, but you have an unfortunate overlap.  The position of the hot end of the cigarette adds a diluting touch of humor to an otherwise dramatic and intense image.  Your beard is on fire!', '2004-05-21 10:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(730174, 77543, 15919, '<td valign="top">It´s totaly out of focus.  Also I would have give it a litle tighter croping.  The pros are that it´s pretty comic and I´ve never before seen a nun with a red-painted nails (cant imagine that they taist good).</td>', 'It´s totaly out of focus.  Also I would have give it a litle tighter croping.  The pros are that it´s pretty comic and I´ve never before seen a nun with a red-painted nails (cant imagine that they taist good).', '2004-05-21 10:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(730176, 77680, 19841, '<td valign="top">More depth of field would have helped this a lot.  Fuzzy glass just doesn''t sparkle like it should.</td>', 'More depth of field would have helped this a lot.  Fuzzy glass just doesn''t sparkle like it should.', '2004-05-21 10:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(730180, 76680, 14202, '<td valign="top">This could have been a far better photo if the entire shot was in focus, just leaves me wondering...Hmmmm</td>', 'This could have been a far better photo if the entire shot was in focus, just leaves me wondering...Hmmmm', '2004-05-21 10:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(730183, 77076, 19841, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  Crop a little more empty sky off the top, for a more dynamic horizontal composition, and it would be perfect.  Still, you get an 8 from me!</td>', 'Lovely!  Crop a little more empty sky off the top, for a more dynamic horizontal composition, and it would be perfect.  Still, you get an 8 from me!', '2004-05-21 10:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(730184, 77691, 14202, '<td valign="top">Great colour and lighting, but IMO wish it was more in focus...well done</td>', 'Great colour and lighting, but IMO wish it was more in focus...well done', '2004-05-21 10:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(730185, 77044, 19841, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation of the subject!  I like the way the sunshine makes the ale glow.</td>', 'Nice presentation of the subject!  I like the way the sunshine makes the ale glow.', '2004-05-21 10:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(730186, 76849, 14202, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but I feel would have been better if not so soft  IMO.</td>', 'Nice composition, but I feel would have been better if not so soft  IMO.', '2004-05-21 10:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(730188, 77694, 19841, '<td valign="top">I wish you could have found some other way to light this besides the attached flash.  The glare on the baby''s face spoils the softness of the scene.</td>', 'I wish you could have found some other way to light this besides the attached flash.  The glare on the baby''s face spoils the softness of the scene.', '2004-05-21 10:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(730189, 76207, 21816, '<td valign="top">This is dramatically done!</td>', 'This is dramatically done!', '2004-05-21 10:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(730191, 77686, 14202, '<td valign="top">Best toothpaste photo in the contest...well done, good focus DoF, colour and lighting...well done = 8</td>', 'Best toothpaste photo in the contest...well done, good focus DoF, colour and lighting...well done = 8', '2004-05-21 10:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(730193, 77387, 14202, '<td valign="top">Well done...I really like this shot...tone, composition and the general ''feel'' of the photo. = 7</td>', 'Well done...I really like this shot...tone, composition and the general ''feel'' of the photo. = 7', '2004-05-21 10:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(730195, 76349, 14202, '<td valign="top">Very eye catching,  Great DoF, colour and you have depicted a habit with a different slant to evrybody else...Very nice...well done. =8</td>', 'Very eye catching,  Great DoF, colour and you have depicted a habit with a different slant to evrybody else...Very nice...well done. =8', '2004-05-21 11:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(730196, 76170, 19841, '<td valign="top">the composition is very cluttered.  Particularly unfortunate is the coffee cup in front of the windows.  They sort of run together and flatten out your perspective.   I wonder if it would have been better to crop in very close to your center of interest, even to the point of cropping off the top of his head, the left shoulder to the neck, and everything to the right of the fingers.  This would flatten the whole thing, and the coffee cup would be less distracting.</td>', 'the composition is very cluttered.  Particularly unfortunate is the coffee cup in front of the windows.  They sort of run together and flatten out your perspective.   I wonder if it would have been better to crop in very close to your center of interest, even to the point of cropping off the top of his head, the left shoulder to the neck, and everything to the right of the fingers.  This would flatten the whole thing, and the coffee cup would be less distracting.', '2004-05-21 11:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(730198, 77645, 21816, '<td valign="top">The expression on it''s face is cool! Good shot!</td>', 'The expression on it''s face is cool! Good shot!', '2004-05-21 11:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(730199, 77380, 14202, '<td valign="top">Excellent DoF, great tones, you have really nailed this one, very cleverly done.</td>', 'Excellent DoF, great tones, you have really nailed this one, very cleverly done.', '2004-05-21 11:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(730203, 77545, 14202, '<td valign="top">The best nail-biter in this contest..great focus, tones and done without the grossness, a nice capture of a horrible habit.</td>', 'The best nail-biter in this contest..great focus, tones and done without the grossness, a nice capture of a horrible habit.', '2004-05-21 11:09:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(730204, 77050, 20204, '<td valign="top">Image is tilted and out of focus.</td>', 'Image is tilted and out of focus.', '2004-05-21 11:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(730206, 77443, 19841, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the border.  However, I find negative images more "clever" than "talented".  It makes it look like you are not confident on your abilities, so you rely on special effects.  I inverted this, and it looked pretty good "straight".   The overall effect is dramatic, though!  And grabbing things is a habit I see a lot in my shop.   So, an 8 from me.</td>', 'Nice use of the border.  However, I find negative images more "clever" than "talented".  It makes it look like you are not confident on your abilities, so you rely on special effects.  I inverted this, and it looked pretty good "straight".   The overall effect is dramatic, though!  And grabbing things is a habit I see a lot in my shop.   So, an 8 from me.', '2004-05-21 11:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(730207, 76192, 9821, '<td valign="top">:)</td>', ':)', '2004-05-21 11:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(730208, 76996, 12475, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait--8 despite the title! This photo really conveys the topic all by itself.</td>', 'Wonderful portrait--8 despite the title! This photo really conveys the topic all by itself.', '2004-05-21 11:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(730209, 76614, 20210, '<td valign="top">I wish the horizon was level, instead of tiled.  Otherwise, pretty shot.</td>', 'I wish the horizon was level, instead of tiled.  Otherwise, pretty shot.', '2004-05-21 11:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(730210, 77496, 13735, '<td valign="top">Wau! Nice atmosphere! Back light masterly utilized.</td>', 'Wau! Nice atmosphere! Back light masterly utilized.', '2004-05-21 11:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(730211, 77548, 20204, '<td valign="top">Lost a little bit for the wire in the upper left corner, but I really like the overall mood of this image.  The black and white is an interesting medium for expressing a rainbow.</td>', 'Lost a little bit for the wire in the upper left corner, but I really like the overall mood of this image.  The black and white is an interesting medium for expressing a rainbow.', '2004-05-21 11:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(730212, 77560, 13735, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!</td>', 'Fantastic!', '2004-05-21 11:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(730213, 77496, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the sense of motion in this - the water droplets, the woman''s facial expression.  This is a fantastic image!</td>', 'I love the sense of motion in this - the water droplets, the woman''s facial expression.  This is a fantastic image!', '2004-05-21 11:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(730215, 77443, 13735, '<td valign="top">Really wierd! And one among the best!</td>', 'Really wierd! And one among the best!', '2004-05-21 11:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(730216, 76251, 20204, '<td valign="top">Excellent clean background emphasizes the subtle subjects.  I really like the cropping which makes the subject obvious, yet leaves something for the imagination.  I really enjoyed this image!</td>', 'Excellent clean background emphasizes the subtle subjects.  I really like the cropping which makes the subject obvious, yet leaves something for the imagination.  I really enjoyed this image!', '2004-05-21 11:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(730217, 76607, 19841, '<td valign="top">I really think black-and-white is unappetizing.  In color, we would have the tasty orange of the sweet potatoes, the glow of the baby''s face, and tghe lively colors of the blanket behind.  Much more approprate for the subject.  At least, you might want to try sepia tone, so the food doesn''t look so much like axle grease.</td>', 'I really think black-and-white is unappetizing.  In color, we would have the tasty orange of the sweet potatoes, the glow of the baby''s face, and tghe lively colors of the blanket behind.  Much more approprate for the subject.  At least, you might want to try sepia tone, so the food doesn''t look so much like axle grease.', '2004-05-21 11:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(730218, 77425, 20204, '<td valign="top">This looks like it could have come right out of Newsweek.  Great photojournalistic style in this image.</td>', 'This looks like it could have come right out of Newsweek.  Great photojournalistic style in this image.', '2004-05-21 11:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(730220, 77050, 21755, '<td valign="top">why haven''t you cleaned that gladd before?</td>', 'why haven''t you cleaned that gladd before?', '2004-05-21 11:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(730221, 77707, 20210, '<td valign="top">I rarely like a blurred photo, but this works really well to show the motion and angst of rubbing the eyes.  I like it!</td>', 'I rarely like a blurred photo, but this works really well to show the motion and angst of rubbing the eyes.  I like it!', '2004-05-21 11:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(730223, 77368, 21755, '<td valign="top">you shouldv''e done it with a hand holding those cards</td>', 'you shouldv''e done it with a hand holding those cards', '2004-05-21 11:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(730224, 77307, 20210, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I get how this fits the "habits" challenge.</td>', 'I don''t think I get how this fits the "habits" challenge.', '2004-05-21 11:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(730226, 76542, 20210, '<td valign="top">clever idea.  the bunched up shirt creates a distracting vertical line.  And the photo quality looks like it was either very low res, or very highly JPG compressed.</td>', 'clever idea.  the bunched up shirt creates a distracting vertical line.  And the photo quality looks like it was either very low res, or very highly JPG compressed.', '2004-05-21 11:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(730229, 77702, 20210, '<td valign="top">The stuffed animal in the back makes this look like a kid''s room.  Which definitely makes it more disturbing than adventurous.  But I won''t dock points for that.  Just a comment...</td>', 'The stuffed animal in the back makes this look like a kid''s room.  Which definitely makes it more disturbing than adventurous.  But I won''t dock points for that.  Just a comment...', '2004-05-21 11:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(730232, 76251, 11895, '<td valign="top">this shot leaves me thinking more about what is not shown than-- the cuo, the piture--  what is in the frame; the crop on the right side is pretty close, leaving just a bit more space between the edge of the cup''s rim and the border would have avoided confusion as to whether part of the rim was cut out</td>', 'this shot leaves me thinking more about what is not shown than-- the cuo, the piture--  what is in the frame; the crop on the right side is pretty close, leaving just a bit more space between the edge of the cup''s rim and the border would have avoided confusion as to whether part of the rim was cut out', '2004-05-21 11:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(730233, 77699, 20210, '<td valign="top">Very good photo.  It *almost* gets your idea across, but not quite effective enough.  Still a great stand-alone shot.</td>', 'Very good photo.  It *almost* gets your idea across, but not quite effective enough.  Still a great stand-alone shot.', '2004-05-21 11:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
