(730270, 77492, 16106, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge. Not a shot that shows technical mastery, but one that implies an emotional depth that is not often on display here. An evocative image with bold composition and a lovely use of the symbols of suburbia with a feeling of despair and loss. I don''t know if any of this is what you intended, but it works for me. My only beef is the slight rotation of the horizontal lines are a bit distracting from the static frame you have going.</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge. Not a shot that shows technical mastery, but one that implies an emotional depth that is not often on display here. An evocative image with bold composition and a lovely use of the symbols of suburbia with a feeling of despair and loss. I don''t know if any of this is what you intended, but it works for me. My only beef is the slight rotation of the horizontal lines are a bit distracting from the static frame you have going.', '2004-05-21 12:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(730271, 77654, 19322, '<td valign="top">I simply don''t get it.  What are we supposed to see?</td>', 'I simply don''t get it.  What are we supposed to see?', '2004-05-21 12:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(730275, 77663, 15810, '<td valign="top">The composition is bad, the large area of black space in the centre of the frame is ugly. Also if your depicting gambling as your habit I dont think this really hits the mark. A person leaving the casino looking like they''ve lost all their money would be an idea or vice versa a person leaving with wads of cash would say more than this.</td>', 'The composition is bad, the large area of black space in the centre of the frame is ugly. Also if your depicting gambling as your habit I dont think this really hits the mark. A person leaving the casino looking like they''ve lost all their money would be an idea or vice versa a person leaving with wads of cash would say more than this.', '2004-05-21 12:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(730276, 77369, 21241, '<td valign="top">the starbucks cup is slightly out of focus...</td>', 'the starbucks cup is slightly out of focus...', '2004-05-21 12:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(730280, 77691, 15810, '<td valign="top">Exposure and focus are problems here. I know your trying to get the gleaming white thing going and it does work to some extent on the bristles, but the handle of the brush is burnt out too which spoils the bristle effect. 4</td>', 'Exposure and focus are problems here. I know your trying to get the gleaming white thing going and it does work to some extent on the bristles, but the handle of the brush is burnt out too which spoils the bristle effect. 4', '2004-05-21 12:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(730281, 77258, 19608, '<td valign="top">Aha - and I thought it was a "guy thing!"  Nice take on the challenge - nice colors but scene is a bit contrasty.</td>', 'Aha - and I thought it was a "guy thing!"  Nice take on the challenge - nice colors but scene is a bit contrasty.', '2004-05-21 12:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(730283, 77031, 15810, '<td valign="top">Nice crop, focus and colours. I love this pic and it''s subtelty.Great work.</td>', 'Nice crop, focus and colours. I love this pic and it''s subtelty.Great work.', '2004-05-21 12:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(730284, 76706, 19322, '<td valign="top">This rather nice photo would be improved by slight cropping at the top, more at the bottom.  The space under the bench is distracting and unnecessary, and unbalances the picture.  Too bad the light in the eye could not have been avoided.</td>', 'This rather nice photo would be improved by slight cropping at the top, more at the bottom.  The space under the bench is distracting and unnecessary, and unbalances the picture.  Too bad the light in the eye could not have been avoided.', '2004-05-21 12:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(730285, 77401, 19608, '<td valign="top">Hey - my name''s Tom!  Great take on the challenge - way better than a lot of the toliet seats, cigarettes, and ugly stuff.  It''s a good composition but the lighting didn''t work well for you.  The silhouette of "Tom" shows no detail at all - and it''s 1/4 of the image or so.  That''s not too bad, but you do need to pop some light onto the binoculars for sure.</td>', 'Hey - my name''s Tom!  Great take on the challenge - way better than a lot of the toliet seats, cigarettes, and ugly stuff.  It''s a good composition but the lighting didn''t work well for you.  The silhouette of "Tom" shows no detail at all - and it''s 1/4 of the image or so.  That''s not too bad, but you do need to pop some light onto the binoculars for sure.', '2004-05-21 12:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(730286, 76229, 15810, '<td valign="top">Great photo, colours focus and composition.One of my faves and a top scorer I hope.</td>', 'Great photo, colours focus and composition.One of my faves and a top scorer I hope.', '2004-05-21 12:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
