(730328, 77322, 18525, '<td valign="top">Is the lighting a little harsh or did you bump saturation to much? Both?<br/> <br/>Nice image I see some noise in the M&amp;M''s however that seems to take away from the clairity.<br/> <br/>I like the arrangement. The negative space on the right side might have benifited from the placement of a half bitten M&amp;M,to show your addiction/habit to them.<br/> <br/>A 6 from me <br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Is the lighting a little harsh or did you bump saturation to much? Both? Nice image I see some noise in the M&M''s however that seems to take away from the clairity. I like the arrangement. The negative space on the right side might have benifited from the placement of a half bitten M&M,to show your addiction/habit to them. A 6 from me  Good luck', '2004-05-21 12:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(730329, 77496, 15810, '<td valign="top">Great great photo, Brilliiant expression on the model and superb motion freeze. Great work. 10</td>', 'Great great photo, Brilliiant expression on the model and superb motion freeze. Great work. 10', '2004-05-21 12:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(730330, 77399, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a visually cluttered snap shot.<br/> <br/>By cluttered I mean there are too many colors and patterns that don''t harmonize well. For instance, the blue flowered comforter adds absolutely nothing of visual interest to this shot. Nor does that yellow jacket or shirt she is laying on that also seems to be showing up behind her head. The lighting is flat and uninteresting. <br/> <br/> You can''t see the subject''s face which may have helped a little toward making it more appealing as a snap shot. Unfortunately, it''s not even a good snap shot. Sorry.</td>', 'This is a visually cluttered snap shot. By cluttered I mean there are too many colors and patterns that don''t harmonize well. For instance, the blue flowered comforter adds absolutely nothing of visual interest to this shot. Nor does that yellow jacket or shirt she is laying on that also seems to be showing up behind her head. The lighting is flat and uninteresting.   You can''t see the subject''s face which may have helped a little toward making it more appealing as a snap shot. Unfortunately, it''s not even a good snap shot. Sorry.', '2004-05-21 12:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(730332, 77700, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is blurry for one thing. The set-up is rather preposterous. The background is very distracting.</td>', 'This is blurry for one thing. The set-up is rather preposterous. The background is very distracting.', '2004-05-21 12:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
