(730357, 76547, 15810, '<td valign="top">It''s potentially a great shot but seems to be lacking something. I think if th elighting was improved this would be stunning.</td>', 'It''s potentially a great shot but seems to be lacking something. I think if th elighting was improved this would be stunning.', '2004-05-21 13:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(730359, 77126, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is overly red. There are too many highlights competing with the reflection in the glass. Very cluttered.In spite of the blurred background there is still to much going on in terms of contrast and hot spots. The glass is falling off the bottom of the frame. A bit more care should have gone in to composing it.</td>', 'This is overly red. There are too many highlights competing with the reflection in the glass. Very cluttered.In spite of the blurred background there is still to much going on in terms of contrast and hot spots. The glass is falling off the bottom of the frame. A bit more care should have gone in to composing it.', '2004-05-21 13:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(730360, 77488, 19608, '<td valign="top">Definitely a habit - nice idea.  Print is a little flat.  A minor point - the hint of the name at the top could easily be cropped away.</td>', 'Definitely a habit - nice idea.  Print is a little flat.  A minor point - the hint of the name at the top could easily be cropped away.', '2004-05-21 13:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(730361, 76547, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is lit in a flat and unintersting way. There are many distracting hot spots (glares in the plastic).<br/>It is out of focus. You might have had something interesting with that one yellow cap amidst all the blue but it is too small to be more than a distraction.</td>', 'This is lit in a flat and unintersting way. There are many distracting hot spots (glares in the plastic).It is out of focus. You might have had something interesting with that one yellow cap amidst all the blue but it is too small to be more than a distraction.', '2004-05-21 13:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(730362, 77282, 18525, '<td valign="top">Truly a habit  I scored this only a 6  because while it is sharp and is composed well for its intention.<br/>It really is a nothing shot for the most part.I mean nothing in the sense that it holds very little interest as a picture outside of this challenge.<br/>I am guilty of this too, and thats why there are no ribbons on my DP wall of fame<br/>;-)</td>', 'Truly a habit  I scored this only a 6  because while it is sharp and is composed well for its intention.It really is a nothing shot for the most part.I mean nothing in the sense that it holds very little interest as a picture outside of this challenge.I am guilty of this too, and thats why there are no ribbons on my DP wall of fame;-)', '2004-05-21 13:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(730363, 77685, 19608, '<td valign="top">Ah yes - I know the feeling.  Nice take on the challenge.  Well exposed.  Not sure I agree with the magenta background.</td>', 'Ah yes - I know the feeling.  Nice take on the challenge.  Well exposed.  Not sure I agree with the magenta background.', '2004-05-21 13:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(730366, 77704, 7322, '<td valign="top">This just isn''t interesting. Too many glaring hot spots from the table, the lights in the ceiling, and the blown out window. Also, it is a bit tilted.</td>', 'This just isn''t interesting. Too many glaring hot spots from the table, the lights in the ceiling, and the blown out window. Also, it is a bit tilted.', '2004-05-21 13:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(730367, 77044, 19608, '<td valign="top">Food? Oh - that''s the part I forgot.  I like the way you''ve staggared the bottles - makes great shadows.</td>', 'Food? Oh - that''s the part I forgot.  I like the way you''ve staggared the bottles - makes great shadows.', '2004-05-21 13:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(730369, 77228, 19608, '<td valign="top">Cute model, nice lighting.  Good composition taken from unusual angle.  The halo around the guitar is a bit distracting.  Finally a dark background would probably work a bit better.</td>', 'Cute model, nice lighting.  Good composition taken from unusual angle.  The halo around the guitar is a bit distracting.  Finally a dark background would probably work a bit better.', '2004-05-21 13:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(730372, 77472, 19608, '<td valign="top">You are the victim of being in a large group with the same idea.  The bottom 1/3 of your image is nothing at all.  Lighting is pretty good.</td>', 'You are the victim of being in a large group with the same idea.  The bottom 1/3 of your image is nothing at all.  Lighting is pretty good.', '2004-05-21 13:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(730375, 77125, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is really stretching the idea of habit. It more aptly depicts habitat than habit. It would have been a more effective photograph if you had isolated the mass of flowers from the rest of the scene and focused a lot more carefully.</td>', 'This is really stretching the idea of habit. It more aptly depicts habitat than habit. It would have been a more effective photograph if you had isolated the mass of flowers from the rest of the scene and focused a lot more carefully.', '2004-05-21 13:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(730377, 77560, 19608, '<td valign="top">Defintely a habit - and a messy one at that.  Abstract is not very compelling.</td>', 'Defintely a habit - and a messy one at that.  Abstract is not very compelling.', '2004-05-21 13:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(730379, 77663, 7322, '<td valign="top">This shot is too dark and it is out of focus most likely do to camera shake. A longer exposure using a tripod would help immensely.</td>', 'This shot is too dark and it is out of focus most likely do to camera shake. A longer exposure using a tripod would help immensely.', '2004-05-21 13:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(730381, 77510, 19608, '<td valign="top">You are the victim of selecting an idea that many others used.  You do have some irony though - the "unclean" seat bottom - and a bachelor with pretty fishy curtain.</td>', 'You are the victim of selecting an idea that many others used.  You do have some irony though - the "unclean" seat bottom - and a bachelor with pretty fishy curtain.', '2004-05-21 13:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(730383, 77254, 7322, '<td valign="top">Quite a bit tilted and it looks like there was a bit of camera shake. The hot spots at the lower edge and cutting across the middle are very distracting. Too orangey. I suggest paying attention to the white balance setting on your camera.</td>', 'Quite a bit tilted and it looks like there was a bit of camera shake. The hot spots at the lower edge and cutting across the middle are very distracting. Too orangey. I suggest paying attention to the white balance setting on your camera.', '2004-05-21 13:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(730384, 76986, 7322, '<td valign="top">C''mon, this doesn''t depict a habit. Sad is a state of being. Nice dog shot though.</td>', 'C''mon, this doesn''t depict a habit. Sad is a state of being. Nice dog shot though.', '2004-05-21 13:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(730386, 76223, 7322, '<td valign="top">Out of focus. Not an interesting depiction of a toilet.</td>', 'Out of focus. Not an interesting depiction of a toilet.', '2004-05-21 13:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(730388, 77351, 19322, '<td valign="top">Except for flat lighting, a nice shot, easily interpreted.</td>', 'Except for flat lighting, a nice shot, easily interpreted.', '2004-05-21 13:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(730389, 77508, 7322, '<td valign="top">Horizon is very tilted. It looks out of focus (note the blurriness of the label). There are a lot of hot spots from flash (in the glass, in the lower edge of the bottle and it''s reflection,in the neck of the bottle, in the lower edge of the ashtray and inside the ashtray). I''m guessing this was taken using just a flash. This would account for the flat lighting and all the glare.</td>', 'Horizon is very tilted. It looks out of focus (note the blurriness of the label). There are a lot of hot spots from flash (in the glass, in the lower edge of the bottle and it''s reflection,in the neck of the bottle, in the lower edge of the ashtray and inside the ashtray). I''m guessing this was taken using just a flash. This would account for the flat lighting and all the glare.', '2004-05-21 13:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(730391, 76934, 7322, '<td valign="top">Instinct not habit. Photographically yoru subject is out of focus and the scene is very contrasty. I like the point of view but I think it would work better in black and white because all the different squares of color add visual clutter.</td>', 'Instinct not habit. Photographically yoru subject is out of focus and the scene is very contrasty. I like the point of view but I think it would work better in black and white because all the different squares of color add visual clutter.', '2004-05-21 13:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(730392, 77520, 7322, '<td valign="top">A habit of squeezing asses? Maybe...but it''s stretching it. At any rate, this doesn''t show that in anything but the most literal way. It''s an obvious set-up which deadens the humorous factor.It''s not funny in other words.</td>', 'A habit of squeezing asses? Maybe...but it''s stretching it. At any rate, this doesn''t show that in anything but the most literal way. It''s an obvious set-up which deadens the humorous factor.It''s not funny in other words.', '2004-05-21 13:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(730394, 77271, 19322, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and idea.</td>', 'Very nice lighting and idea.', '2004-05-21 13:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(730395, 77228, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like unusual perspectives but I don''t think this one is working. I like the expression on her face and the simple background.<br/> <br/> I play a few instruments, including guitar, and while I might call it a hobby, a passion, a neccessity....I wouldn''t call it a habit. A habit implies an unconscious act or gesture.</td>', 'I like unusual perspectives but I don''t think this one is working. I like the expression on her face and the simple background.  I play a few instruments, including guitar, and while I might call it a hobby, a passion, a neccessity....I wouldn''t call it a habit. A habit implies an unconscious act or gesture.', '2004-05-21 13:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(730397, 77651, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very out of focus otherwise it has some potential but I''m not convinced it is a natural scene and not a set-up. I''m a bit turned off by the fakey look of the girls'' gestures, as if they have been posed an directed. They look overly conscious of what they are doing which kind of ruins the appeal. I think the problem is overkill. Only one of the girls really needed to be fidgeting (my money is on the nail biter---she looks more ''real'').</td>', 'Very out of focus otherwise it has some potential but I''m not convinced it is a natural scene and not a set-up. I''m a bit turned off by the fakey look of the girls'' gestures, as if they have been posed an directed. They look overly conscious of what they are doing which kind of ruins the appeal. I think the problem is overkill. Only one of the girls really needed to be fidgeting (my money is on the nail biter---she looks more ''real'').', '2004-05-21 13:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(730398, 77128, 472, '<td valign="top">lol - awesome</td>', 'lol - awesome', '2004-05-21 13:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(730399, 77527, 19322, '<td valign="top">A very pleasing photo, though I haven''t grasped the meaning (don''t recognize the long, diagonal object).</td>', 'A very pleasing photo, though I haven''t grasped the meaning (don''t recognize the long, diagonal object).', '2004-05-21 13:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(730404, 76582, 15919, '<td valign="top">And whats the habit?  Very soft focused but like the skycolor though.</td>', 'And whats the habit?  Very soft focused but like the skycolor though.', '2004-05-21 13:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(730407, 77387, 19322, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  I like the way the overhead lights and the reflections on the floor converge toward the door, but with the human figure maintaining the balance.</td>', 'Nicely composed.  I like the way the overhead lights and the reflections on the floor converge toward the door, but with the human figure maintaining the balance.', '2004-05-21 13:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
