(730448, 77065, 15810, '<td valign="top">Terrible. Out of focus, badly framed, poorly exposed but worst of all, not at all interesting. Go on, print this out A2 size and hang it on your wall...I dare you!</td>', 'Terrible. Out of focus, badly framed, poorly exposed but worst of all, not at all interesting. Go on, print this out A2 size and hang it on your wall...I dare you!', '2004-05-21 14:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
