(730585, 76797, 15810, '<td valign="top">bad focus and the photo is too busy, needing a focal point.</td>', 'bad focus and the photo is too busy, needing a focal point.', '2004-05-21 16:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(730590, 77380, 21367, '<td valign="top">This is very nice, great dof, excellent use of b/w very nice tones and lighting, you keep us focused on the snooze button.  Excellent job.</td>', 'This is very nice, great dof, excellent use of b/w very nice tones and lighting, you keep us focused on the snooze button.  Excellent job.', '2004-05-21 16:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(730660, 77133, 5534, '<td valign="top">Fast car, sure. Unfortunately having the car looking perfectly still doesn''t really convey a sense of speed to me. Maybe using a slower shutter speed to create motion blur would''ve helped a bit more.</td>', 'Fast car, sure. Unfortunately having the car looking perfectly still doesn''t really convey a sense of speed to me. Maybe using a slower shutter speed to create motion blur would''ve helped a bit more.', '2004-05-21 18:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(730666, 77337, 21367, '<td valign="top">Pretty good, and an Interesting angle.  Nice detail.  I may have used softer lighting (or not directly light the face up cards) for this environment , something to give that friday night poker feeling.   I just seems a little bright (white) to me.  Very nice shot.</td>', 'Pretty good, and an Interesting angle.  Nice detail.  I may have used softer lighting (or not directly light the face up cards) for this environment , something to give that friday night poker feeling.   I just seems a little bright (white) to me.  Very nice shot.', '2004-05-21 18:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(730692, 77563, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like it very much.</td>', 'I like it very much.', '2004-05-21 18:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(730694, 76955, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like aspects of this photo as a candid. I would suggest that in the future you move around a bit more to eliminate (or at least place in a less distracting point in the frame) clutter like the folded umbrella which is growing out of his head. It also would have been better to get a shot when there wasn''t so much smoke obscuring his face. The smoke *is* good, don''t get me wrong, but it''s not (generally) a good idea to obscure the face of the main subject. I do like the station wagon in the background with its hatch open. It adds a timeless feel. I''m upping my original vote by one point after having another look.</td>', 'I like aspects of this photo as a candid. I would suggest that in the future you move around a bit more to eliminate (or at least place in a less distracting point in the frame) clutter like the folded umbrella which is growing out of his head. It also would have been better to get a shot when there wasn''t so much smoke obscuring his face. The smoke *is* good, don''t get me wrong, but it''s not (generally) a good idea to obscure the face of the main subject. I do like the station wagon in the background with its hatch open. It adds a timeless feel. I''m upping my original vote by one point after having another look.', '2004-05-21 18:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(730698, 76348, 7322, '<td valign="top">I get the habit (packrat) but this is a really visually cluttered photo. There is just too much jumble for the eye to have a chance to rest. The placement of the truck on top of the Shop-Vac in the middle of all the mess isn''t really convincing me.</td>', 'I get the habit (packrat) but this is a really visually cluttered photo. There is just too much jumble for the eye to have a chance to rest. The placement of the truck on top of the Shop-Vac in the middle of all the mess isn''t really convincing me.', '2004-05-21 19:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(730700, 77510, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is just a snap shot of a toilet with the seat left up. While it does depict a habit not a lot of thought went into showing us something new in this photo. Meeting the challenge is more than just depicting the idea but depicting it in a way that is visually pleasing and interesting.</td>', 'This is just a snap shot of a toilet with the seat left up. While it does depict a habit not a lot of thought went into showing us something new in this photo. Meeting the challenge is more than just depicting the idea but depicting it in a way that is visually pleasing and interesting.', '2004-05-21 19:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(730701, 77674, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a bit too dark. I like the perspective. I generally don''t like goofy, set-up shots but this one isn''t bad. I upped my vote by one after looking a second time to write this comment.</td>', 'This is a bit too dark. I like the perspective. I generally don''t like goofy, set-up shots but this one isn''t bad. I upped my vote by one after looking a second time to write this comment.', '2004-05-21 19:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(730704, 76849, 7322, '<td valign="top">This isn''t lit particulalry well and the details aren''t crips enough. This should look lucious and delicious but it isn''t tempting me.  It looks rather dewey for some reason (frozen, hasn''t had time to thaw?). The composition isn''t bad but the cake is falling off the lower edge a bit.</td>', 'This isn''t lit particulalry well and the details aren''t crips enough. This should look lucious and delicious but it isn''t tempting me.  It looks rather dewey for some reason (frozen, hasn''t had time to thaw?). The composition isn''t bad but the cake is falling off the lower edge a bit.', '2004-05-21 19:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(730706, 77350, 7322, '<td valign="top">While this depicts a habit, it does so in a rather dull, literal way. You have to work a bit harder to make a still-life of economics and calculus text books visually appealing.</td>', 'While this depicts a habit, it does so in a rather dull, literal way. You have to work a bit harder to make a still-life of economics and calculus text books visually appealing.', '2004-05-21 19:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(730727, 77073, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is just way too dark. The key chain practically disappears right into the background.</td>', 'This is just way too dark. The key chain practically disappears right into the background.', '2004-05-21 19:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(730729, 76715, 7322, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is flat and uninteresting. The candy isn''t focused very well. The hand (I suspect yours) isn''t focused at all, accept in the index and middle finger. This is a very literal depiction of a habit. It doesn''t really show us anything new or interesting about sugar cravings and it is not visually appealing.</td>', 'The lighting on this is flat and uninteresting. The candy isn''t focused very well. The hand (I suspect yours) isn''t focused at all, accept in the index and middle finger. This is a very literal depiction of a habit. It doesn''t really show us anything new or interesting about sugar cravings and it is not visually appealing.', '2004-05-21 19:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(730734, 77307, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice pony but not a habit. Riding is a hobby not a habit. I''ll grant that someone can have a habit of taking a daily ride but then why not show someone riding? This is really stretching the boundaries of the guidelines. Astheticallly, the background is very blah. There is very little visual contrast between the color of the pony and the dirt. <br/> <br/>If it is some habit of the pony''s you are depicting (eating dirt?) it isn''t very clear from this shot because its muzzle is falling out of the frame. I know equines can have some very bad habits but this really isn''t showing it. I upped this by a point after reevaluating it but I''m still sceptical about it meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Nice pony but not a habit. Riding is a hobby not a habit. I''ll grant that someone can have a habit of taking a daily ride but then why not show someone riding? This is really stretching the boundaries of the guidelines. Astheticallly, the background is very blah. There is very little visual contrast between the color of the pony and the dirt.  If it is some habit of the pony''s you are depicting (eating dirt?) it isn''t very clear from this shot because its muzzle is falling out of the frame. I know equines can have some very bad habits but this really isn''t showing it. I upped this by a point after reevaluating it but I''m still sceptical about it meeting the challenge.', '2004-05-21 19:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(730739, 77511, 21621, '<td valign="top">Great shot, nice work.</td>', 'Great shot, nice work.', '2004-05-21 19:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(730740, 77307, 10702, '<td valign="top">habits ?</td>', 'habits ?', '2004-05-21 19:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(730742, 77645, 16965, '<td valign="top">totally wild picture, but how is this a habit?  Do they do this 24-7?</td>', 'totally wild picture, but how is this a habit?  Do they do this 24-7?', '2004-05-21 19:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(730743, 77307, 16965, '<td valign="top">I think that the habit of eating grass (maybe that is the habit here) is obscured by the crop.  not much habit in this photo, sorry</td>', 'I think that the habit of eating grass (maybe that is the habit here) is obscured by the crop.  not much habit in this photo, sorry', '2004-05-21 19:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(730745, 77364, 7322, '<td valign="top">The main subject is much to dark and my eye is drawn to all that clutter in the background which, unfortunately, is very brightly lit. This just has the look of a poor snap shot. The slightly elevated angle makes me wonder if you held the camera over your head and off to the side to get the shot. This would account for why the backgroun dis lit so well and the face isn''t.</td>', 'The main subject is much to dark and my eye is drawn to all that clutter in the background which, unfortunately, is very brightly lit. This just has the look of a poor snap shot. The slightly elevated angle makes me wonder if you held the camera over your head and off to the side to get the shot. This would account for why the backgroun dis lit so well and the face isn''t.', '2004-05-21 19:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(730751, 77698, 18349, '<td valign="top">My personal favorite for this challenge.   Really nice work; love the texture of the water rippling.  Great composition!</td>', 'My personal favorite for this challenge.   Really nice work; love the texture of the water rippling.  Great composition!', '2004-05-21 19:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(730752, 77425, 18349, '<td valign="top">Wow...this says more than 1000 words.   Immensely emotional capture.   Hope you win a ribbon with this one.</td>', 'Wow...this says more than 1000 words.   Immensely emotional capture.   Hope you win a ribbon with this one.', '2004-05-21 19:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(730753, 76930, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is too small to really get much out of it. The man in the plaid shirt in the foreground has a strange orange halo around his head. It looks like he is holding a frisbee in front of his face. This is basically a poor snap shot. Consider spending more time waiting for an interesting moment and framing your subject so that there isn''t so much visual clutter. Some examples of visual clutter are the disembodied head which seems to have its nose stuck in the denim jacket person''s butt, the aforementioned orange halo man, the woman with the bright turquoise shirt in the foreground and whatever that black and white thing is coming out of her shoulder.</td>', 'This is too small to really get much out of it. The man in the plaid shirt in the foreground has a strange orange halo around his head. It looks like he is holding a frisbee in front of his face. This is basically a poor snap shot. Consider spending more time waiting for an interesting moment and framing your subject so that there isn''t so much visual clutter. Some examples of visual clutter are the disembodied head which seems to have its nose stuck in the denim jacket person''s butt, the aforementioned orange halo man, the woman with the bright turquoise shirt in the foreground and whatever that black and white thing is coming out of her shoulder.', '2004-05-21 19:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(730758, 77664, 7322, '<td valign="top">Visually cluttered background (flowery, striped wallpaper, horizontal lines of the mini-blinds, vertical line of the moulding) which doesn''t really go well with the image of a cop (it looks like the cop is in his kitchen). This would have worked better if the cop was eating the donut on duty somewhere since you are working from a stereotype. The image itself is very contrasty.That bite isn''t really convincing. It looks very set-up. On the plus side, the cropping is good for a candid portrait if you lose the cluttered background.</td>', 'Visually cluttered background (flowery, striped wallpaper, horizontal lines of the mini-blinds, vertical line of the moulding) which doesn''t really go well with the image of a cop (it looks like the cop is in his kitchen). This would have worked better if the cop was eating the donut on duty somewhere since you are working from a stereotype. The image itself is very contrasty.That bite isn''t really convincing. It looks very set-up. On the plus side, the cropping is good for a candid portrait if you lose the cluttered background.', '2004-05-21 19:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(730766, 76615, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a really unflattering and unpleasant view of this poor cat although kind of amusing. At first I didn''t like it but on second viewing I''ve changed my mind. I had a thought that it would look much better in black and white so I downloaded it and converted it to grayscale and I was right. Much more striking and appealing. You should try it out.<br/> <br/>I''m guessing the habit is meant to be the cat using the scratching rope. I call that instinct not habit. While I''ll concede that individuals of higher functioning animal species can have habits, claw sharpening is something all felines do. My recently deceased cat had an endearing habit of sleeping on papers and open books. His mother had a habit of tapping paper suspended in air with her paw as if she was dribbling a ball. I''m not talking about paper someone would hold out for her in play. She would come across a piece of paper hanging over the edge of a desk or book or something and then start tapping it.  It has to be seen to be understood. Too hard to describe. Anyway, the point is these are individual idiosyncracies whereas, claw-scratching is instinctive and neccessary to the cat.   I upped your score because I think it''s a much better shot than when I initially looked at it but you still lost a point because I don''t think it meets the challenge.</td>', 'This is a really unflattering and unpleasant view of this poor cat although kind of amusing. At first I didn''t like it but on second viewing I''ve changed my mind. I had a thought that it would look much better in black and white so I downloaded it and converted it to grayscale and I was right. Much more striking and appealing. You should try it out. I''m guessing the habit is meant to be the cat using the scratching rope. I call that instinct not habit. While I''ll concede that individuals of higher functioning animal species can have habits, claw sharpening is something all felines do. My recently deceased cat had an endearing habit of sleeping on papers and open books. His mother had a habit of tapping paper suspended in air with her paw as if she was dribbling a ball. I''m not talking about paper someone would hold out for her in play. She would come across a piece of paper hanging over the edge of a desk or book or something and then start tapping it.  It has to be seen to be understood. Too hard to describe. Anyway, the point is these are individual idiosyncracies whereas, claw-scratching is instinctive and neccessary to the cat.   I upped your score because I think it''s a much better shot than when I initially looked at it but you still lost a point because I don''t think it meets the challenge.', '2004-05-21 20:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(730771, 77586, 4729, '<td valign="top">Great!</td>', 'Great!', '2004-05-21 20:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(730786, 76769, 21820, '<td valign="top">nice soft focus<br/>10</td>', 'nice soft focus10', '2004-05-21 20:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(730793, 77044, 20088, '<td valign="top">Incredible work with the position of the beer bottles...creates a great composition.</td>', 'Incredible work with the position of the beer bottles...creates a great composition.', '2004-05-21 20:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(730796, 77443, 7322, '<td valign="top">Huh? Don''t get even remotely how this depicts curiosity, which isn''t even a habit but a state of being. Photographically, it''s okay but kind of fuzzy. <br/> <br/>Edited: Since you found my comment mocking and unhelpful,  which I truly did not intend, I decided to ammend it somewhat, for clarification. <br/> <br/>I do not see the connection between a hand clutching at nothing and curiosity. If this were a challenge entitled "Curiosity", I would still think it failed to meet that challenge. As it is, it is a challenge entitled "Habits".  I do not agree, as you insisted in your angry private message to me,  that curiosity is a habit, but rather a characteristic of human, and other higher animal species'', nature; a state of being. One is curious, one is creative, one is easygoing. These are things we *are*, as in the verb ''to be''. A habit is something that we do; an action of some kind that is performed repeatedly, consciously or not (for instance, we can be in the habit of daily grooming and still be conscious of what we are doing). <br/> <br/>Asthetically, the composition is fine. I generally don''t care for thin, inside borders but in this instance I like how you made it seem as though the hand is breaking through. I found that the image was fuzzy and lacking detail. This may have been an intentional asthetic choice, as you stated in your message, but it does not work on that level for me. My opinion, of course.</td>', 'Huh? Don''t get even remotely how this depicts curiosity, which isn''t even a habit but a state of being. Photographically, it''s okay but kind of fuzzy.  Edited: Since you found my comment mocking and unhelpful,  which I truly did not intend, I decided to ammend it somewhat, for clarification.  I do not see the connection between a hand clutching at nothing and curiosity. If this were a challenge entitled "Curiosity", I would still think it failed to meet that challenge. As it is, it is a challenge entitled "Habits".  I do not agree, as you insisted in your angry private message to me,  that curiosity is a habit, but rather a characteristic of human, and other higher animal species'', nature; a state of being. One is curious, one is creative, one is easygoing. These are things we *are*, as in the verb ''to be''. A habit is something that we do; an action of some kind that is performed repeatedly, consciously or not (for instance, we can be in the habit of daily grooming and still be conscious of what we are doing).  Asthetically, the composition is fine. I generally don''t care for thin, inside borders but in this instance I like how you made it seem as though the hand is breaking through. I found that the image was fuzzy and lacking detail. This may have been an intentional asthetic choice, as you stated in your message, but it does not work on that level for me. My opinion, of course.', '2004-05-21 21:03:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(730821, 77012, 1368, '<td valign="top">Mundi?</td>', 'Mundi?', '2004-05-21 21:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(730877, 77326, 13305, '<td valign="top">Good photo, although I don''t care for habits presented.  I especially like the reflections. 8</td>', 'Good photo, although I don''t care for habits presented.  I especially like the reflections. 8', '2004-05-21 22:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(730881, 76875, 13305, '<td valign="top">Neat pic.  But the title alone doesnt make it a habit.  The lizard would be better if all it were in focus.  Work on depth of field.</td>', 'Neat pic.  But the title alone doesnt make it a habit.  The lizard would be better if all it were in focus.  Work on depth of field.', '2004-05-21 23:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(730884, 77360, 13305, '<td valign="top">Cute pup waiting for her owner.  Definitely one of the more original photos in the challenge.  Photographically, not much to gripe about.  Nice composition, excellent capture on her face.  I might like a little more fill light on the lower half of her body by the wall, but that''s pretty minor.   10</td>', 'Cute pup waiting for her owner.  Definitely one of the more original photos in the challenge.  Photographically, not much to gripe about.  Nice composition, excellent capture on her face.  I might like a little more fill light on the lower half of her body by the wall, but that''s pretty minor.   10', '2004-05-21 23:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(730888, 76754, 13305, '<td valign="top">You know, only the queen bee ever gets laid, she has multiple partners, and does it in full view of the entire hive.  I''ve never heard of an insect voyeur.  But a really nice macro shot! <br/></td>', 'You know, only the queen bee ever gets laid, she has multiple partners, and does it in full view of the entire hive.  I''ve never heard of an insect voyeur.  But a really nice macro shot! ', '2004-05-21 23:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(730891, 77674, 13305, '<td valign="top">Marvelous whimsey.  I always thought chocolate would be be the most deadly flavor.  Good composition,  Needs just a little more contrast or more fill light from overhead, I''d like to see a bit more detail around the face/head.  9</td>', 'Marvelous whimsey.  I always thought chocolate would be be the most deadly flavor.  Good composition,  Needs just a little more contrast or more fill light from overhead, I''d like to see a bit more detail around the face/head.  9', '2004-05-21 23:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(730893, 77647, 13305, '<td valign="top">Actually, I think it''s mooning us.   Need to concentrate more on the subjct,  crop in closer or get down right on the same level as the subject. The background while nice is not really and a shallow DOF would be fine for this pic.</td>', 'Actually, I think it''s mooning us.   Need to concentrate more on the subjct,  crop in closer or get down right on the same level as the subject. The background while nice is not really and a shallow DOF would be fine for this pic.', '2004-05-21 23:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(730904, 76951, 13305, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Nice composition, Good illumination on the subjects face. Unique approach to the challenge.  10</td>', 'Interesting.  Nice composition, Good illumination on the subjects face. Unique approach to the challenge.  10', '2004-05-21 23:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(730909, 76996, 13305, '<td valign="top">Good portrait of an older couple.  I won''t comment on the habit.   7</td>', 'Good portrait of an older couple.  I won''t comment on the habit.   7', '2004-05-21 23:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(730912, 76659, 13305, '<td valign="top">Everyone knows that scuba divers are some of the most saftey conscious people in the world.  I don''t think I can make any suggestions to improve on this photo, so 10</td>', 'Everyone knows that scuba divers are some of the most saftey conscious people in the world.  I don''t think I can make any suggestions to improve on this photo, so 10', '2004-05-21 23:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(730914, 76291, 13305, '<td valign="top">Great composition, perfect expression on her face, and those eyes could stop anyone.  Only minor problem is you cut off the top of her head.  10</td>', 'Great composition, perfect expression on her face, and those eyes could stop anyone.  Only minor problem is you cut off the top of her head.  10', '2004-05-21 23:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(730918, 77563, 13305, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet she hears music in her head constantly.  Nice photo for the challeng.  Good DOF and nicely lit, natural pose.  Keep up the good work.  10</td>', 'I''ll bet she hears music in her head constantly.  Nice photo for the challeng.  Good DOF and nicely lit, natural pose.  Keep up the good work.  10', '2004-05-21 23:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(730953, 77699, 2792, '<td valign="top">LMAO, funny concept!  Only thing that, for some strange reason, bothers me is the bottom left of the photo there is that little bit of foliage there.  Would have liked it better if it was just black space there.  But that is a minor detail.  Nice job either way! =-)</td>', 'LMAO, funny concept!  Only thing that, for some strange reason, bothers me is the bottom left of the photo there is that little bit of foliage there.  Would have liked it better if it was just black space there.  But that is a minor detail.  Nice job either way! =-)', '2004-05-22 00:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(730964, 76582, 19841, '<td valign="top">Blurry, not up to the challenge, and poorly composed.</td>', 'Blurry, not up to the challenge, and poorly composed.', '2004-05-22 00:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(730966, 77586, 19952, '<td valign="top">Great crisp shot and a nice doodle too!</td>', 'Great crisp shot and a nice doodle too!', '2004-05-22 00:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(730967, 77374, 19952, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this picture. It''s one of my favorites of this competition. The decision to go with that blue light offsets the infrared mouse and the burning cigarette nicely. Great job!</td>', 'I absolutely love this picture. It''s one of my favorites of this competition. The decision to go with that blue light offsets the infrared mouse and the burning cigarette nicely. Great job!', '2004-05-22 00:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(730970, 76951, 19841, '<td valign="top">The composition doesn''t work for me.  The left side is so much brighter and more contrasty than the right, and the woman''s  face is oddly cropped at the chin.  It''s almost like looking at two different pictures, and one has slipped out of the mat.</td>', 'The composition doesn''t work for me.  The left side is so much brighter and more contrasty than the right, and the woman''s  face is oddly cropped at the chin.  It''s almost like looking at two different pictures, and one has slipped out of the mat.', '2004-05-22 00:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(730976, 77543, 19841, '<td valign="top">Do nuns wear nail polish?  I wish she was in focus.</td>', 'Do nuns wear nail polish?  I wish she was in focus.', '2004-05-22 00:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(730979, 76754, 19841, '<td valign="top">That''s a wonderful photo of a bee, but c''mon, do you really want to brag about your habit of just entering anything you like, and trying to force it to fit the challenge with the title?</td>', 'That''s a wonderful photo of a bee, but c''mon, do you really want to brag about your habit of just entering anything you like, and trying to force it to fit the challenge with the title?', '2004-05-22 00:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(730984, 76229, 19952, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the alcohol theme. I love the color you were able to get for this shot.</td>', 'Nice job on the alcohol theme. I love the color you were able to get for this shot.', '2004-05-22 00:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(730987, 77268, 19841, '<td valign="top">Not enough focus, and washed out.  If her hand was held higher, so that you could crop real close in on it, and still keep her face in the shot, this would work better.  Then, the focused part would take up more of the image.  As it is, there is a lot of empty space that isn''t adding to the image or the idea.</td>', 'Not enough focus, and washed out.  If her hand was held higher, so that you could crop real close in on it, and still keep her face in the shot, this would work better.  Then, the focused part would take up more of the image.  As it is, there is a lot of empty space that isn''t adding to the image or the idea.', '2004-05-22 00:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(730988, 76833, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really great setup and execution for this shot. Got a bit of a "Shining" vibe, but that didn''t scare me too badly. ;-) Nice job!</td>', 'Really great setup and execution for this shot. Got a bit of a "Shining" vibe, but that didn''t scare me too badly. ;-) Nice job!', '2004-05-22 01:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(730989, 76706, 19841, '<td valign="top">Interesting candid shot.  Too bad it looks like she is sticking the cigarette in her ear, but I guess you couldn''t really have gone over to her and asked her to move it.</td>', 'Interesting candid shot.  Too bad it looks like she is sticking the cigarette in her ear, but I guess you couldn''t really have gone over to her and asked her to move it.', '2004-05-22 01:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(730990, 77368, 19841, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the lighting is flat.  And, you know the table top should be green felt! ;)</td>', 'Good idea, but the lighting is flat.  And, you know the table top should be green felt! ;)', '2004-05-22 01:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(730991, 76251, 19952, '<td valign="top">What a great shot! You did a fantastic job with composition, color, clarity -- okay, now it sounds like I''m rating a diamond, but I really like everything about this photo. Great job!</td>', 'What a great shot! You did a fantastic job with composition, color, clarity -- okay, now it sounds like I''m rating a diamond, but I really like everything about this photo. Great job!', '2004-05-22 01:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(730992, 77501, 19841, '<td valign="top">Ahh!  It''s a disembodied baby head!  Really, what is all that black about?</td>', 'Ahh!  It''s a disembodied baby head!  Really, what is all that black about?', '2004-05-22 01:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(730993, 77526, 19841, '<td valign="top">So, your habit is drinking vodka while playing chess on a board lit by cherenkov radiation?  It really is an impressive image, but I can''t help suspecting you just wanted to show off, and didn''t really put much thought into presenting an image of a habit.   10 for image quality, 1 for insulting my intelligence, average 5.5 rounds up to 6.</td>', 'So, your habit is drinking vodka while playing chess on a board lit by cherenkov radiation?  It really is an impressive image, but I can''t help suspecting you just wanted to show off, and didn''t really put much thought into presenting an image of a habit.   10 for image quality, 1 for insulting my intelligence, average 5.5 rounds up to 6.', '2004-05-22 01:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(731000, 77233, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like this uncommon shot of a duck. The textures on the feathers and scales on the foot are amazingly crisp. And the DOF with the grass defined around the duck but blurred in the foreground and background is really great. I would give the shot a little more room at the bottom, but other than that it''s really great.</td>', 'I like this uncommon shot of a duck. The textures on the feathers and scales on the foot are amazingly crisp. And the DOF with the grass defined around the duck but blurred in the foreground and background is really great. I would give the shot a little more room at the bottom, but other than that it''s really great.', '2004-05-22 01:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(731001, 77513, 19780, '<td valign="top">Succinct and understated. I like the off centering of the sign and the rust stains on the door. Could be slightly more saturated - it feels slightly flat.</td>', 'Succinct and understated. I like the off centering of the sign and the rust stains on the door. Could be slightly more saturated - it feels slightly flat.', '2004-05-22 01:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(731004, 77704, 19780, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea for the habits challenge - the color is very nice and evocative of any Starbucks in the world. The horizon line seems a little off - the frame feels a few degrees off clockwise. I''m not sure about the framing of the straw going up and off to the right - composition-wise I think it might work better on the other side.</td>', 'Very nice idea for the habits challenge - the color is very nice and evocative of any Starbucks in the world. The horizon line seems a little off - the frame feels a few degrees off clockwise. I''m not sure about the framing of the straw going up and off to the right - composition-wise I think it might work better on the other side.', '2004-05-22 01:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(731007, 76689, 19780, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed with the bottle in the foreground - I like the composition - I wish the smoke was a little more prominent. It''s very well lit - quite nice and I like the decoloring of the photo - it makes it feel like ash.</td>', 'Nicely framed with the bottle in the foreground - I like the composition - I wish the smoke was a little more prominent. It''s very well lit - quite nice and I like the decoloring of the photo - it makes it feel like ash.', '2004-05-22 01:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(731008, 76251, 19780, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I wish my morning coffee looked like this - that''d wake me up. Or at least please me more. The framing and saturation and composition is all wonderful. I''m not sure about the white and black border, but top marks from me on this one.</td>', 'Beautiful. I wish my morning coffee looked like this - that''d wake me up. Or at least please me more. The framing and saturation and composition is all wonderful. I''m not sure about the white and black border, but top marks from me on this one.', '2004-05-22 01:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(731009, 77065, 19780, '<td valign="top">The colors, especially the plate are wonderful. I like the idea of playing with your food being a habit but without the title, I would have just thought that this was a photo of some sort of mashed potato and pea dish - perhaps a fork in the frame would help. The colors/contrast could be bumped just a smidge. The composition is really good, I like the choice of a plate with banding on it - it helps to pull the eye around the frame.</td>', 'The colors, especially the plate are wonderful. I like the idea of playing with your food being a habit but without the title, I would have just thought that this was a photo of some sort of mashed potato and pea dish - perhaps a fork in the frame would help. The colors/contrast could be bumped just a smidge. The composition is really good, I like the choice of a plate with banding on it - it helps to pull the eye around the frame.', '2004-05-22 01:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(731010, 77657, 19780, '<td valign="top">What a great idea for a healthy habit. I wish the label was a bit sharper and maybe the background either black and matte or lighter (I know the floss wouldn''t show up against a lighter background easily). I like the casual look of it - the floss just lying there.</td>', 'What a great idea for a healthy habit. I wish the label was a bit sharper and maybe the background either black and matte or lighter (I know the floss wouldn''t show up against a lighter background easily). I like the casual look of it - the floss just lying there.', '2004-05-22 01:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(731011, 76797, 16672, '<td valign="top">is there a focus point?</td>', 'is there a focus point?', '2004-05-22 01:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(731013, 76875, 19780, '<td valign="top">What a fun lizard - the reflection on they eye is really wonderful and the way his little claws wrap around the handle. The DOF is great - how it shows the head and shoulders crisply and then the tail is blurred. I don''t care for the banding of the border on the top and bottom.</td>', 'What a fun lizard - the reflection on they eye is really wonderful and the way his little claws wrap around the handle. The DOF is great - how it shows the head and shoulders crisply and then the tail is blurred. I don''t care for the banding of the border on the top and bottom.', '2004-05-22 01:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(731014, 77012, 19780, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting and the contrast on this are a little harsh and low - for the idea of surprise to work, I think a more realistic light source would help. Though it does create some fun shadows.</td>', 'I think the lighting and the contrast on this are a little harsh and low - for the idea of surprise to work, I think a more realistic light source would help. Though it does create some fun shadows.', '2004-05-22 01:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(731016, 77548, 7322, '<td valign="top">Cool photo. Hobby, passion maybe...habit no. The jagged phone line in the top left corner should have been cropped out. I''m feeling like the sky and the trees in the background are a bit too dark but I do like the contrast of the white beech tree against the darker trees and the sky.</td>', 'Cool photo. Hobby, passion maybe...habit no. The jagged phone line in the top left corner should have been cropped out. I''m feeling like the sky and the trees in the background are a bit too dark but I do like the contrast of the white beech tree against the darker trees and the sky.', '2004-05-22 01:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(731017, 76680, 19780, '<td valign="top">Great idea and well executed. The simplicity is really nice. I like the colors - the mild blues and cool whites. I think the DOF could be a little deeper and could include the top of the toothpaste as well as the lid, to try to pull the idea together that it should be put back on the tube. The border is slightly distracting - I think a slightly darker or pure white would work better, but that''s a personal preference.</td>', 'Great idea and well executed. The simplicity is really nice. I like the colors - the mild blues and cool whites. I think the DOF could be a little deeper and could include the top of the toothpaste as well as the lid, to try to pull the idea together that it should be put back on the tube. The border is slightly distracting - I think a slightly darker or pure white would work better, but that''s a personal preference.', '2004-05-22 01:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(731018, 76459, 19780, '<td valign="top">Very inventive angle of a common object. I like the colors and the saturation. It feels a little oversharpened to me, but I think the textures and composition are great.</td>', 'Very inventive angle of a common object. I like the colors and the saturation. It feels a little oversharpened to me, but I think the textures and composition are great.', '2004-05-22 01:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(731019, 77552, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is kind of a weird perspective. The clock looked distorted and odd until I realized you shot from quite a bit below. I don''t know much about Cuckoo clocks so I''m not sure what the arm is doing or what the significance of twice a day is. I can''t decide whether the blurry arm makes this a better photo or bothers me. This really isn''t to my taste.</td>', 'This is kind of a weird perspective. The clock looked distorted and odd until I realized you shot from quite a bit below. I don''t know much about Cuckoo clocks so I''m not sure what the arm is doing or what the significance of twice a day is. I can''t decide whether the blurry arm makes this a better photo or bothers me. This really isn''t to my taste.', '2004-05-22 01:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(731020, 77581, 19780, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition for this challenge. I really like the portrait quality and the detail that includes the well chewed nails and even the DOF to include the wood textures in the background. Probably my favorite of the nail biting.</td>', 'Very nice composition for this challenge. I really like the portrait quality and the detail that includes the well chewed nails and even the DOF to include the wood textures in the background. Probably my favorite of the nail biting.', '2004-05-22 01:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(731023, 77010, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice candid portrait. I wish you could have eliminated the reflections on the glass behind her. I think cropping out the door handle would have made this much better. It would still be obvious that she is outside a public place. I''m giving this a 7.</td>', 'This is a nice candid portrait. I wish you could have eliminated the reflections on the glass behind her. I think cropping out the door handle would have made this much better. It would still be obvious that she is outside a public place. I''m giving this a 7.', '2004-05-22 02:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(731024, 77692, 19780, '<td valign="top">A nice idea for a positive habit. I like the color of the soap and the skin textures. You captured the bubbles really well, but I think it''s a little overexposed, a slightly lower light level or different exposure length would help. A little more context within the frame of running water or a sink or faucet would help to complete the composition well.</td>', 'A nice idea for a positive habit. I like the color of the soap and the skin textures. You captured the bubbles really well, but I think it''s a little overexposed, a slightly lower light level or different exposure length would help. A little more context within the frame of running water or a sink or faucet would help to complete the composition well.', '2004-05-22 02:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(731025, 76542, 7322, '<td valign="top">There are an awful lot of jaggies in the shadow areas and weird white speckle things on her hand. There is a marked lack of contrast in the tones. Interesting crop. Original idea and it is certainly a habit.</td>', 'There are an awful lot of jaggies in the shadow areas and weird white speckle things on her hand. There is a marked lack of contrast in the tones. Interesting crop. Original idea and it is certainly a habit.', '2004-05-22 02:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(731026, 76754, 22068, '<td valign="top">Love this shot! Beautiful colors, great composition, fantastic lighting and focus. Not sure it meets the challenge of habit though. I will deduct a point in my mind. It still deserves a 10.</td>', 'Love this shot! Beautiful colors, great composition, fantastic lighting and focus. Not sure it meets the challenge of habit though. I will deduct a point in my mind. It still deserves a 10.', '2004-05-22 02:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(731029, 77401, 19780, '<td valign="top">The framing on this is very nice - I like the greenery at the top and then in the center of the frame. You captured the story well, with the expert use of DOF. The balcony really helps with the lines of the composition - leading the eye to the window. <br/> <br/>That said, this hardly seems like a habit. An obsession, a preferred activity, a deviance ... a crime perhaps, but not exactly a habit. But I think it''s a great photo and marked it solely on those merits.</td>', 'The framing on this is very nice - I like the greenery at the top and then in the center of the frame. You captured the story well, with the expert use of DOF. The balcony really helps with the lines of the composition - leading the eye to the window.  That said, this hardly seems like a habit. An obsession, a preferred activity, a deviance ... a crime perhaps, but not exactly a habit. But I think it''s a great photo and marked it solely on those merits.', '2004-05-22 02:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(731030, 77425, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t see this as depicting a habit so much as a habitat. This is this child''s environment, apparently, but it isn''t revealing anything about habits accept maybe a habit of littering. Your title might be throwing me off here. It''s a great photo, if a bit too contrasty. Great composition. There just isn''t enough detail in the boy''s face or skin.</td>', 'I don''t see this as depicting a habit so much as a habitat. This is this child''s environment, apparently, but it isn''t revealing anything about habits accept maybe a habit of littering. Your title might be throwing me off here. It''s a great photo, if a bit too contrasty. Great composition. There just isn''t enough detail in the boy''s face or skin.', '2004-05-22 02:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(731031, 77643, 7322, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a very appealing arrangement. It just looks like a snap shot of an assortment of fast food trash.The colors are fairly harmonious.</td>', 'This isn''t a very appealing arrangement. It just looks like a snap shot of an assortment of fast food trash.The colors are fairly harmonious.', '2004-05-22 02:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(731033, 77374, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the eerie blue and the reed peeping out from the mouse. The smoke is a great touch. Well thought out, well executed.</td>', 'I like the eerie blue and the reed peeping out from the mouse. The smoke is a great touch. Well thought out, well executed.', '2004-05-22 02:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(731034, 76589, 7322, '<td valign="top">Always smiling (perpetual cheerfulness, good nature) isn''t a habit so much as a personality trait. I guess there are some instances where constant smiling would become a habit (beauty contestants, game show hosts?) but it is really stretching the idea of a habit. Interesting idea. I don''t care much for the execution. One knife or blade might have been sufficient. This is a bit of overkill.</td>', 'Always smiling (perpetual cheerfulness, good nature) isn''t a habit so much as a personality trait. I guess there are some instances where constant smiling would become a habit (beauty contestants, game show hosts?) but it is really stretching the idea of a habit. Interesting idea. I don''t care much for the execution. One knife or blade might have been sufficient. This is a bit of overkill.', '2004-05-22 02:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(731036, 77704, 8377, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  Excellent use of dof.  Makes me almost feel like I can taste the coffee.  I also like how you took the picture in the shop, to add to the atmospheric value of it.  This picture looks like it should be in an advertisement for Starbucks.  mmm.</td>', 'I really like this photo.  Excellent use of dof.  Makes me almost feel like I can taste the coffee.  I also like how you took the picture in the shop, to add to the atmospheric value of it.  This picture looks like it should be in an advertisement for Starbucks.  mmm.', '2004-05-22 02:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(731038, 77693, 7322, '<td valign="top">One of the better executed close-ups of a nail-biter''s hand...but like the others I''ve seen, it doesn''t show this subject in a new or interesting way. I''m not drawn to this photograph for its own merit outside the challenge guidelines.</td>', 'One of the better executed close-ups of a nail-biter''s hand...but like the others I''ve seen, it doesn''t show this subject in a new or interesting way. I''m not drawn to this photograph for its own merit outside the challenge guidelines.', '2004-05-22 02:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(731040, 77112, 7322, '<td valign="top">This photo doesn''t capture this idea in an interesting way. There isn''t anything of actual visual appeal about a snooze button so a macro shot of one doesn''t make for a dynamic photo.</td>', 'This photo doesn''t capture this idea in an interesting way. There isn''t anything of actual visual appeal about a snooze button so a macro shot of one doesn''t make for a dynamic photo.', '2004-05-22 02:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(731041, 77515, 7322, '<td valign="top">Great shot. A little bright in the highlights of the grass but that is nitpicking.</td>', 'Great shot. A little bright in the highlights of the grass but that is nitpicking.', '2004-05-22 02:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(731042, 77398, 7322, '<td valign="top">A hobby, a passion, a deep need....but a habit? Don''t think so.</td>', 'A hobby, a passion, a deep need....but a habit? Don''t think so.', '2004-05-22 02:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(731044, 77343, 7322, '<td valign="top">You''ve managed to make a mundane scene a bit more appealing than some others who attempted this shot. I think part of the appeal is the warm lighting, the gleaming faucets, and the wrinkles in her hands. It is still mundane and I don''t love it (I ask myself, would I look at this as art outside the challenge guidelines)  but it is well executed.</td>', 'You''ve managed to make a mundane scene a bit more appealing than some others who attempted this shot. I think part of the appeal is the warm lighting, the gleaming faucets, and the wrinkles in her hands. It is still mundane and I don''t love it (I ask myself, would I look at this as art outside the challenge guidelines)  but it is well executed.', '2004-05-22 02:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(731045, 77657, 7322, '<td valign="top">This suffers quite a bit from camera shake. The hot spot at the top of the frame also detracts. I don''t think this perspective is helping much either.</td>', 'This suffers quite a bit from camera shake. The hot spot at the top of the frame also detracts. I don''t think this perspective is helping much either.', '2004-05-22 02:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(731046, 77028, 7322, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Really great composition. The child''s face could be a tich lighter to really stand out from the black background. This could work for the Multiple Lighting Source challenge too! This shot is really several notches above what I''ve been looking at for this challenge. Kudos!</td>', 'Excellent. Really great composition. The child''s face could be a tich lighter to really stand out from the black background. This could work for the Multiple Lighting Source challenge too! This shot is really several notches above what I''ve been looking at for this challenge. Kudos!', '2004-05-22 02:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(731049, 77545, 16106, '<td valign="top">Quite a crowded feild, who will have the best of these shots? quite a nail biter!<br/>you win. Strong lighting, well composed with nothing extraneous.</td>', 'Quite a crowded feild, who will have the best of these shots? quite a nail biter!you win. Strong lighting, well composed with nothing extraneous.', '2004-05-22 02:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(731050, 77213, 7322, '<td valign="top">It looks like she is stirring that with an eyedropper. Nice gray tones and good details. This shot doesn''t quite raise this scene above the mundane but it is well executed.</td>', 'It looks like she is stirring that with an eyedropper. Nice gray tones and good details. This shot doesn''t quite raise this scene above the mundane but it is well executed.', '2004-05-22 02:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(731053, 77673, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice candid portrait. The background is a bit cluttered looking (the baseball bat, the stuff on top of the shelves, the ladder,whatever that is directly under his left elbow) His face looks a little soft focus to depict the strength mentioned in the title. Despite that, it''s a very appealing photo.</td>', 'Nice candid portrait. The background is a bit cluttered looking (the baseball bat, the stuff on top of the shelves, the ladder,whatever that is directly under his left elbow) His face looks a little soft focus to depict the strength mentioned in the title. Despite that, it''s a very appealing photo.', '2004-05-22 02:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(731054, 77702, 7322, '<td valign="top">This might have worked a bit better if I couldn''t see the teddy bear on the shelf in the background or the "Vote" poster, the calandar... To my thinking, bondage is a fetish not a habit. People are extremely concious about their fetishes, to the point of obsession. This depicts a behaviour but a behaviour is not necessarily a habit.</td>', 'This might have worked a bit better if I couldn''t see the teddy bear on the shelf in the background or the "Vote" poster, the calandar... To my thinking, bondage is a fetish not a habit. People are extremely concious about their fetishes, to the point of obsession. This depicts a behaviour but a behaviour is not necessarily a habit.', '2004-05-22 02:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(731055, 77268, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this was intentional on your part bu this is way too high key and contrasty. Some shadow details in her hand and more visible smoke would have been nice. I''m distracted by that area of shadowy lumpiness between her hand and her hair. I like the perspective.</td>', 'I don''t know if this was intentional on your part bu this is way too high key and contrasty. Some shadow details in her hand and more visible smoke would have been nice. I''m distracted by that area of shadowy lumpiness between her hand and her hair. I like the perspective.', '2004-05-22 02:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(731056, 76987, 7322, '<td valign="top">There isn''t enough visual appeal to the sign on the window for it to be the main focus. Cropping the edge of what I assume is the letter "a" for habitat would have made this a little more effective.</td>', 'There isn''t enough visual appeal to the sign on the window for it to be the main focus. Cropping the edge of what I assume is the letter "a" for habitat would have made this a little more effective.', '2004-05-22 02:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(731057, 77527, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is the second time I''ve loked at this photo and I still don''t get it. Is te guy in the corner taking a picture of the person in the distance? What is that thing at the top? Is that a person, a statue, a fence post...? <br/>At any rate, only in very specific circumstances am I considering a hobby a habit for this challenge. Photography can be a passion, a need, an urge but that does not define it as a habit. <br/> <br/>Aesthetically, I like the sky in this shot but I don''t care for the arrangement of the sillouhetted figures. I have a feeling I will be in the minority with this opinion.</td>', 'This is the second time I''ve loked at this photo and I still don''t get it. Is te guy in the corner taking a picture of the person in the distance? What is that thing at the top? Is that a person, a statue, a fence post...? At any rate, only in very specific circumstances am I considering a hobby a habit for this challenge. Photography can be a passion, a need, an urge but that does not define it as a habit.  Aesthetically, I like the sky in this shot but I don''t care for the arrangement of the sillouhetted figures. I have a feeling I will be in the minority with this opinion.', '2004-05-22 02:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(731058, 76294, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a cute shot and well executed. Strangely, I don''t love it and I like animal photos. I can''t quite put my finger on why. Maybe because I can''t see the puppy''s eyes? It might be the perspective; the way the puppy''s body recedes directly behind it.</td>', 'This is a cute shot and well executed. Strangely, I don''t love it and I like animal photos. I can''t quite put my finger on why. Maybe because I can''t see the puppy''s eyes? It might be the perspective; the way the puppy''s body recedes directly behind it.', '2004-05-22 02:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(731059, 77012, 7322, '<td valign="top">Weird idea. Original though. There is too much visual clutter off to either side of the frame. It might have worked if it was cropped to just above his head. That would give it a ''caught-in-the-act'' claustrophobic effect and eliminate a lot of the clutter (like the outlet/light switch thing directly above his head). I''m not sure I would love it that much more but it would be an improvement.</td>', 'Weird idea. Original though. There is too much visual clutter off to either side of the frame. It might have worked if it was cropped to just above his head. That would give it a ''caught-in-the-act'' claustrophobic effect and eliminate a lot of the clutter (like the outlet/light switch thing directly above his head). I''m not sure I would love it that much more but it would be an improvement.', '2004-05-22 02:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(731060, 77654, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m in disagreement that man''s oldest habit is reading the Bible since until the invention of the printing press, most folks didn''t even own a Bible. But daily reading of Scripture is a habit (in the way that brushing one''s teeth, making one''s bed, etc becomes habitual). This is a rather mundane depiction of that habit, however.</td>', 'I''m in disagreement that man''s oldest habit is reading the Bible since until the invention of the printing press, most folks didn''t even own a Bible. But daily reading of Scripture is a habit (in the way that brushing one''s teeth, making one''s bed, etc becomes habitual). This is a rather mundane depiction of that habit, however.', '2004-05-22 02:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(731062, 76639, 7322, '<td valign="top">Decently executed but it doesn''t raise the subject from the mundane.</td>', 'Decently executed but it doesn''t raise the subject from the mundane.', '2004-05-22 02:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(731082, 76951, 16230, '<td valign="top">.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-05 14:20:00.</i></td>', '.', '2004-05-22 03:51:54.000000', '2006-05-05 15:20:00.000000', 1),
(731087, 77128, 16230, '<td valign="top">A creative and interesting idea! Well photographed.</td>', 'A creative and interesting idea! Well photographed.', '2004-05-22 03:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(731093, 77685, 14202, '<td valign="top">Like the focus, composition and viewpoint...maybe a little lighter backdrop... but very good photo at any rate.</td>', 'Like the focus, composition and viewpoint...maybe a little lighter backdrop... but very good photo at any rate.', '2004-05-22 04:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(731104, 76948, 21158, '<td valign="top">you know I cannot find anything wrong with this,</td>', 'you know I cannot find anything wrong with this,', '2004-05-22 05:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(731105, 77674, 21158, '<td valign="top">a little too bright at the top</td>', 'a little too bright at the top', '2004-05-22 05:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(731106, 77700, 21158, '<td valign="top">nice exposure</td>', 'nice exposure', '2004-05-22 05:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(731107, 77695, 21158, '<td valign="top">I like the tone but the focus seems a little soft</td>', 'I like the tone but the focus seems a little soft', '2004-05-22 05:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(731108, 77654, 21158, '<td valign="top">well done</td>', 'well done', '2004-05-22 05:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
