(731315, 76859, 19841, '<td valign="top">I like the use of half-melted ice in this.  Not only is it more realistic than the usual fresh cracked ice in this sort of image, it adds a sense of time passing.</td>', 'I like the use of half-melted ice in this.  Not only is it more realistic than the usual fresh cracked ice in this sort of image, it adds a sense of time passing.', '2004-05-22 10:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
