(731321, 77512, 19841, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a lot of nothing in this image.  I would like this better either with something else in the image, or completely filled with a super macro shot of the end of the cigarette.</td>', 'There seems to be a lot of nothing in this image.  I would like this better either with something else in the image, or completely filled with a super macro shot of the end of the cigarette.', '2004-05-22 10:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
