(731441, 77031, 19780, '<td valign="top">I think it''s great that you captured the fireworks sign in the background. I wish the flames of the tanks were a little more vivid - that would really make the connection. The colors are wonderful and I like the off-centered cluster of the people (though the woman facing us draws focus from the black bottomed balloon). It doesn''t feel like a representation of a habit per se.</td>', 'I think it''s great that you captured the fireworks sign in the background. I wish the flames of the tanks were a little more vivid - that would really make the connection. The colors are wonderful and I like the off-centered cluster of the people (though the woman facing us draws focus from the black bottomed balloon). It doesn''t feel like a representation of a habit per se.', '2004-05-22 13:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
