(731465, 76403, 21367, '<td valign="top">I think you got in just a little too close on this one.  There isn''t enough detail for me to focus on.  I think I might have backed out enough to just catch the curves of the bottle to give the viewer something to associate with the bubbles.  Maybe placing a flashlight (or light) shining from the bottom up through the soda would have helped emphasis the bubbles a bit.  This is an intresting abstract as it is.</td>', 'I think you got in just a little too close on this one.  There isn''t enough detail for me to focus on.  I think I might have backed out enough to just catch the curves of the bottle to give the viewer something to associate with the bubbles.  Maybe placing a flashlight (or light) shining from the bottom up through the soda would have helped emphasis the bubbles a bit.  This is an intresting abstract as it is.', '2004-05-22 14:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
