(731545, 77128, 554, '<td valign="top">The winner!!!!!!!!!!!!<br/>This one really makes me smile. What a wonderful pair of models. Everything about this shot is great...framing, lightly soft focused, contrast, the "sisters", just EVERYTHING!  It is so nice to see a ''raw'' un-ps''s photo. This is why I perfer the limited editing challenges...shows what can be achieved when one knows PHOTOGRAPHY rather than PS skills.  A perfect 10 and my all time favorite. Hang this one like it is or remove the clothing blimishes.  I would leave the beauty spots on the mischievious sister....adds to her charecter. Congrats, hope we''re not disapointed.</td>', 'The winner!!!!!!!!!!!!This one really makes me smile. What a wonderful pair of models. Everything about this shot is great...framing, lightly soft focused, contrast, the "sisters", just EVERYTHING!  It is so nice to see a ''raw'' un-ps''s photo. This is why I perfer the limited editing challenges...shows what can be achieved when one knows PHOTOGRAPHY rather than PS skills.  A perfect 10 and my all time favorite. Hang this one like it is or remove the clothing blimishes.  I would leave the beauty spots on the mischievious sister....adds to her charecter. Congrats, hope we''re not disapointed.', '2004-05-22 17:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
