(731583, 77228, 21367, '<td valign="top">Yup great WMD (weapon of mass destruction) here, sometimes when the neighbors turn the country music up real loud, well (oops thats another story).  This is a great view and the expression on the models face (and clarity) sets this whole shot up nicely.  Could have worked in the unusual viewpoint challenge as well.  Good dof and nothing distracting in the background.  Good Job.</td>', 'Yup great WMD (weapon of mass destruction) here, sometimes when the neighbors turn the country music up real loud, well (oops thats another story).  This is a great view and the expression on the models face (and clarity) sets this whole shot up nicely.  Could have worked in the unusual viewpoint challenge as well.  Good dof and nothing distracting in the background.  Good Job.', '2004-05-22 18:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
