(732253, 76269, 12311, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, sharpness, and detail!  I''ll be curious to learn how you accomplished this one - after the challege.  9</td>', 'Excellent composition, sharpness, and detail!  I''ll be curious to learn how you accomplished this one - after the challege.  9', '2004-05-23 14:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
