(732313, 77337, 21542, '<td valign="top">Good concept, but the card edges lack definition and the lighting doesn''t add any real drama to the shot.</td>', 'Good concept, but the card edges lack definition and the lighting doesn''t add any real drama to the shot.', '2004-05-23 16:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(732314, 77508, 21542, '<td valign="top">Overexposed, harsh lighting, and spots on a dirty lens.</td>', 'Overexposed, harsh lighting, and spots on a dirty lens.', '2004-05-23 16:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(732317, 77523, 21542, '<td valign="top">While I wouldn''t be surprised if you got panned for the amount of harsh "white" in this shot, I think it really works here.  And you''ve caught just enough flame to give us  "the beginning".  Great drama!</td>', 'While I wouldn''t be surprised if you got panned for the amount of harsh "white" in this shot, I think it really works here.  And you''ve caught just enough flame to give us  "the beginning".  Great drama!', '2004-05-23 16:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(732321, 77493, 21542, '<td valign="top">altering it to b&amp;w probably would have brought out a bit more character in the shot, as the colors don''t add anything to this piece (mind you, they don''t really detract, either... I believe the phrase is, "mostly harmless"). I''m going with a 6.</td>', 'altering it to b&w probably would have brought out a bit more character in the shot, as the colors don''t add anything to this piece (mind you, they don''t really detract, either... I believe the phrase is, "mostly harmless"). I''m going with a 6.', '2004-05-23 16:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(732322, 77550, 18834, '<td valign="top">Not so in focus, I don''t know if you were using macro or not, but it would have helped.</td>', 'Not so in focus, I don''t know if you were using macro or not, but it would have helped.', '2004-05-23 16:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(732323, 76566, 18834, '<td valign="top">Out of focus</td>', 'Out of focus', '2004-05-23 16:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(732324, 76229, 18834, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  A very clean and clear shot</td>', 'Great composition.  A very clean and clear shot', '2004-05-23 16:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(732325, 77337, 18834, '<td valign="top">Would have looked clearer with macro</td>', 'Would have looked clearer with macro', '2004-05-23 16:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(732326, 77320, 21542, '<td valign="top">While the idea is quite imaginative, I think this shot may have been overreaching for the metaphor.</td>', 'While the idea is quite imaginative, I think this shot may have been overreaching for the metaphor.', '2004-05-23 16:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(732328, 76170, 21542, '<td valign="top">Crop this to the extreme center of the shot, and I wouldn''t have had to fight all the business of the background.  And of course the sky wask in the upper left is likely to get you in trouble with a lot of folks.</td>', 'Crop this to the extreme center of the shot, and I wouldn''t have had to fight all the business of the background.  And of course the sky wask in the upper left is likely to get you in trouble with a lot of folks.', '2004-05-23 16:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(732330, 76348, 21542, '<td valign="top">The lighting worked out great.  Unfortunately, the overall effect of the shot is drab and blurred.</td>', 'The lighting worked out great.  Unfortunately, the overall effect of the shot is drab and blurred.', '2004-05-23 16:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(732331, 76146, 21542, '<td valign="top">While I enjoy the composition, and get all of the technical imagery in this shot, I personally try to vote on the basis of someone seeing this shot in an open gallery.  I''m going to have to go with a 6 on that scale.</td>', 'While I enjoy the composition, and get all of the technical imagery in this shot, I personally try to vote on the basis of someone seeing this shot in an open gallery.  I''m going to have to go with a 6 on that scale.', '2004-05-23 16:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(732332, 76769, 21542, '<td valign="top">While others may not go wild for it, I''m impressed with both the softening and the choice of high exposure. A solid 8 in my book.</td>', 'While others may not go wild for it, I''m impressed with both the softening and the choice of high exposure. A solid 8 in my book.', '2004-05-23 16:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(732333, 77381, 21542, '<td valign="top">Personal choice, I would have gone for a slightly darker tone and would have caught all of the gauge.  It also bugging me just a bit that the line of the hinge isn''t straight in the frame, but that''s probably being a bit obsessive.</td>', 'Personal choice, I would have gone for a slightly darker tone and would have caught all of the gauge.  It also bugging me just a bit that the line of the hinge isn''t straight in the frame, but that''s probably being a bit obsessive.', '2004-05-23 16:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(732336, 76352, 21542, '<td valign="top">Too high-key.  Makes it look more like an autopsy shot that an entry of artistic merit.  And the more chewed nails I see in this competition, it makes me feel that it''s the _action_ that''s the habit, not the result.</td>', 'Too high-key.  Makes it look more like an autopsy shot that an entry of artistic merit.  And the more chewed nails I see in this competition, it makes me feel that it''s the _action_ that''s the habit, not the result.', '2004-05-23 16:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(732338, 77550, 21542, '<td valign="top">Too high-key, to blurry in spots, and too sharpened in others.  Makes it look more like an autopsy shot that an entry of artistic merit.  And the more chewed nails I see in this competition, it makes me feel that it''s the _action_ that''s the habit, not the result.</td>', 'Too high-key, to blurry in spots, and too sharpened in others.  Makes it look more like an autopsy shot that an entry of artistic merit.  And the more chewed nails I see in this competition, it makes me feel that it''s the _action_ that''s the habit, not the result.', '2004-05-23 16:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(732340, 77343, 21542, '<td valign="top">Overlooking the fact that I keep trying to make out the face in the reflection, I really like the tones used in the shot (as a b&amp;w, this would have really suffered), there''s just the right amount of lather to dictate the action, and the age of the hands gives us all the clues we need to tie it to "habits".  Great work!  A solid 9 from me.</td>', 'Overlooking the fact that I keep trying to make out the face in the reflection, I really like the tones used in the shot (as a b&w, this would have really suffered), there''s just the right amount of lather to dictate the action, and the age of the hands gives us all the clues we need to tie it to "habits".  Great work!  A solid 9 from me.', '2004-05-23 16:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(732342, 77213, 21542, '<td valign="top">Well, the DOF is wonderful.  However, there''s no clue as to what''s in the cup, and since it''s a tiny, plastic cup with a tiny, plastic stick in it that can''t be identified as a spoon, the audience has no way of knowing what the habit is.</td>', 'Well, the DOF is wonderful.  However, there''s no clue as to what''s in the cup, and since it''s a tiny, plastic cup with a tiny, plastic stick in it that can''t be identified as a spoon, the audience has no way of knowing what the habit is.', '2004-05-23 16:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(732343, 77670, 21542, '<td valign="top">Just enough blur to the shot to be distracting.  Also, the colors, though muted, seem to be fighting for dominance.  Try this shot in b&amp;w and it may result in a stronger effect.</td>', 'Just enough blur to the shot to be distracting.  Also, the colors, though muted, seem to be fighting for dominance.  Try this shot in b&w and it may result in a stronger effect.', '2004-05-23 16:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(732344, 76873, 21542, '<td valign="top">To me, at least, you seem to have managed to capture just the right light to define "morning".  DOF is great.  My only criticism might be to have changed the title to "early morning habits", but that''s getting far too picky, even for me. A 9.</td>', 'To me, at least, you seem to have managed to capture just the right light to define "morning".  DOF is great.  My only criticism might be to have changed the title to "early morning habits", but that''s getting far too picky, even for me. A 9.', '2004-05-23 16:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(732345, 77399, 21542, '<td valign="top">You''re likely to get a lot of these comments over and over, but here it comes again...  That''s a word search, not a crossword. The blandest aspect of the shot is you subject, and your viewer is being pelted with some of the harshest colors availible.  And the shot as a whole comes across as a "snapshot" rather than a composed piece.  But you did manage to capture an action, which is what a habit is, unlike a lot of the other entrants here, so I feel that I should mark up for that.</td>', 'You''re likely to get a lot of these comments over and over, but here it comes again...  That''s a word search, not a crossword. The blandest aspect of the shot is you subject, and your viewer is being pelted with some of the harshest colors availible.  And the shot as a whole comes across as a "snapshot" rather than a composed piece.  But you did manage to capture an action, which is what a habit is, unlike a lot of the other entrants here, so I feel that I should mark up for that.', '2004-05-23 17:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(732349, 77552, 21542, '<td valign="top">Loving the long exposure as well as the angle.</td>', 'Loving the long exposure as well as the angle.', '2004-05-23 17:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(732350, 76937, 5364, '<td valign="top">I think you''re just showing off with a completed crossword! This is a good picture, the depth of field is just right.</td>', 'I think you''re just showing off with a completed crossword! This is a good picture, the depth of field is just right.', '2004-05-23 17:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(732351, 76403, 21542, '<td valign="top">To my eye, the only indication of "habit" here at all is the title, and in a competition that is defined by action, this is exceptionally abstract at best.</td>', 'To my eye, the only indication of "habit" here at all is the title, and in a competition that is defined by action, this is exceptionally abstract at best.', '2004-05-23 17:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(732352, 76631, 21542, '<td valign="top">There were bikinis involved, just outside the frame of this shot, weren''t there? ::grin::</td>', 'There were bikinis involved, just outside the frame of this shot, weren''t there? ::grin::', '2004-05-23 17:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(732354, 76397, 21542, '<td valign="top">With the exception of just one tiny note, I think this is one of the best shots I''ve seen in this round... I would love to see just a touch more color saturation, and possibly just a little less green in the spectrum.</td>', 'With the exception of just one tiny note, I think this is one of the best shots I''ve seen in this round... I would love to see just a touch more color saturation, and possibly just a little less green in the spectrum.', '2004-05-23 17:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(732356, 76294, 21542, '<td valign="top">While the slipper''s just a bit overexposed, I''m lovin'' the tongue!  It SO makes the shot!</td>', 'While the slipper''s just a bit overexposed, I''m lovin'' the tongue!  It SO makes the shot!', '2004-05-23 17:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(732357, 77586, 21542, '<td valign="top">SA-WEET!</td>', 'SA-WEET!', '2004-05-23 17:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(732358, 77707, 21542, '<td valign="top">Overall, I like the motion of the shot, but it leaves the finger so undefined as to not allow the viewer to really figure out what''s going on.</td>', 'Overall, I like the motion of the shot, but it leaves the finger so undefined as to not allow the viewer to really figure out what''s going on.', '2004-05-23 17:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(732360, 77397, 21542, '<td valign="top">Yes, it''s a yellow tulip.  I would _assume_ that the habit here is gardening, but there''s really no evidence to that effect.  Most people, including my self, would define a habit as an action, not a flower than could just have easilly come from the local botanical garden.  It is, however, a gorgeous picture of a tulip.</td>', 'Yes, it''s a yellow tulip.  I would _assume_ that the habit here is gardening, but there''s really no evidence to that effect.  Most people, including my self, would define a habit as an action, not a flower than could just have easilly come from the local botanical garden.  It is, however, a gorgeous picture of a tulip.', '2004-05-23 17:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(732362, 77526, 21542, '<td valign="top">"This photo has been validated."<br/> <br/>Gotta love that!  But I have to admit, I''ve met CGI artists that would swear this shot was just REALLY good work in OPEN_GL.<br/> <br/>I am, however,  missing the concept of "habits" here entirely.  Maybe an Absolut bottle would have lant it better effect.</td>', '"This photo has been validated." Gotta love that!  But I have to admit, I''ve met CGI artists that would swear this shot was just REALLY good work in OPEN_GL. I am, however,  missing the concept of "habits" here entirely.  Maybe an Absolut bottle would have lant it better effect.', '2004-05-23 17:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(732369, 77673, 20012, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t fit the challenge very well, but it''s a very expressive picture.</td>', 'This doesn''t fit the challenge very well, but it''s a very expressive picture.', '2004-05-23 17:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(732371, 77648, 20012, '<td valign="top">nice colors, but the softening looks a bit weird to me.</td>', 'nice colors, but the softening looks a bit weird to me.', '2004-05-23 17:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(732375, 77351, 21542, '<td valign="top">Great concept, great composition.  My only concern is that the desaturation of this shot has made it more bland than it could have been otherwise.  Just for kicks (assuming this was a color original), instead of simply desaturating it, try stripping out two of the RGB channels (whichever two leave you with the best tone), then convert back to Greyscale from multichannel.  The face may also be a little contrasty, but that could just be a result of the downsampling to post.</td>', 'Great concept, great composition.  My only concern is that the desaturation of this shot has made it more bland than it could have been otherwise.  Just for kicks (assuming this was a color original), instead of simply desaturating it, try stripping out two of the RGB channels (whichever two leave you with the best tone), then convert back to Greyscale from multichannel.  The face may also be a little contrasty, but that could just be a result of the downsampling to post.', '2004-05-23 17:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(732377, 77685, 21542, '<td valign="top">Too pink.  Try backing off the red channel a bit, and I think you''d have it.</td>', 'Too pink.  Try backing off the red channel a bit, and I think you''d have it.', '2004-05-23 17:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(732381, 77204, 21542, '<td valign="top">I''m missing a reason to think that this these are the returns from a garage sale.  Gimme tags, and I''d believe you.</td>', 'I''m missing a reason to think that this these are the returns from a garage sale.  Gimme tags, and I''d believe you.', '2004-05-23 17:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(732382, 77560, 21542, '<td valign="top">It''s abstract all right...</td>', 'It''s abstract all right...', '2004-05-23 17:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(732387, 77671, 21542, '<td valign="top">The pink panther &amp; the Budda make it for me. ;)</td>', 'The pink panther & the Budda make it for me. ;)', '2004-05-23 17:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(732388, 77350, 21542, '<td valign="top">I''d say it''s procrastination!  Both the TI-92 and Excel 5 are just a LITTLE outdated! ::grin::</td>', 'I''d say it''s procrastination!  Both the TI-92 and Excel 5 are just a LITTLE outdated! ::grin::', '2004-05-23 17:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
