(732648, 77694, 10867, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, the focus on the baby''s eyes is a tad soft.  I''m not an expert on portraits, but from what I''ve read, the focus in a portrait should   be on the eyes, not the nose, as it is in this case.  Apart from that, I really like this image.  The expression is very nice and the skin tones are perfect.</td>', 'Unfortunately, the focus on the baby''s eyes is a tad soft.  I''m not an expert on portraits, but from what I''ve read, the focus in a portrait should   be on the eyes, not the nose, as it is in this case.  Apart from that, I really like this image.  The expression is very nice and the skin tones are perfect.', '2004-05-23 22:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
