(735021, 76589, 21345, '<td valign="top">I can relate...it''s good to know you are not alone...besides the pick  of habit. The photo is very well done...love the color contrast. As well as the imagery.</td>', 'I can relate...it''s good to know you are not alone...besides the pick  of habit. The photo is very well done...love the color contrast. As well as the imagery.', '2004-05-25 11:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
