(735529, 76169, 20679, '<td valign="top">very original and the bulbs are well exposed too. Nice!</td>', 'very original and the bulbs are well exposed too. Nice!', '2004-05-25 17:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(735531, 77397, 20679, '<td valign="top">habit?</td>', 'habit?', '2004-05-25 17:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(735532, 76793, 11897, '<td valign="top">needs a little better focus, not quite sharp enough.</td>', 'needs a little better focus, not quite sharp enough.', '2004-05-25 17:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(735534, 76797, 11897, '<td valign="top">Slightly out of focus , IMHO</td>', 'Slightly out of focus , IMHO', '2004-05-25 17:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(735536, 77028, 20679, '<td valign="top">interesting lighting</td>', 'interesting lighting', '2004-05-25 17:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(735537, 77508, 11897, '<td valign="top">your lighting is a little too direct, slightly washing out the detail.</td>', 'your lighting is a little too direct, slightly washing out the detail.', '2004-05-25 17:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(735541, 77675, 20679, '<td valign="top">oh dear, there are so many of these.....</td>', 'oh dear, there are so many of these.....', '2004-05-25 17:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(735545, 77133, 20679, '<td valign="top">sadly there is not motion blur either in the background or the wheels....it doesn''t show speed at all. The car could have been parked for all we can tell. Try a slower shutter speed and allow at least the wheels to show some movement</td>', 'sadly there is not motion blur either in the background or the wheels....it doesn''t show speed at all. The car could have been parked for all we can tell. Try a slower shutter speed and allow at least the wheels to show some movement', '2004-05-25 17:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(735548, 76261, 11897, '<td valign="top">best of the nose pickers I''ve seen yet.</td>', 'best of the nose pickers I''ve seen yet.', '2004-05-25 17:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(735550, 77656, 20679, '<td valign="top">not very original</td>', 'not very original', '2004-05-25 17:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(735552, 77686, 21675, '<td valign="top">I dont understand the point here...</td>', 'I dont understand the point here...', '2004-05-25 17:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(735556, 77385, 21675, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but is this a habit?</td>', 'Nice picture, but is this a habit?', '2004-05-25 17:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(735612, 76254, 19780, '<td valign="top">I think this is an amazing photo - I love the exposure and the contrast on it. The textures are spot on fabulous and the expression and posture of the man are wonderful at communicating his intense attention to his work. I don''t think many folks are going to connect it to the challenge of habits, but that aside it''s a great candid.</td>', 'I think this is an amazing photo - I love the exposure and the contrast on it. The textures are spot on fabulous and the expression and posture of the man are wonderful at communicating his intense attention to his work. I don''t think many folks are going to connect it to the challenge of habits, but that aside it''s a great candid.', '2004-05-25 18:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(735618, 76830, 19780, '<td valign="top">I think the blues you captured and their relationship to the sky is just wonderful - the contrast with the rust really helps to bring it out. I wonder if a more off-center composition with the center column would help provide just a little more visual interest. I think it was a worthy subject for this challenge.</td>', 'I think the blues you captured and their relationship to the sky is just wonderful - the contrast with the rust really helps to bring it out. I wonder if a more off-center composition with the center column would help provide just a little more visual interest. I think it was a worthy subject for this challenge.', '2004-05-25 18:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(735622, 77387, 19780, '<td valign="top">The choice of a cold colored duotone really sells this as a bitter world of desolation. I like the composition with the figure set far back in the frame and the repetition of the sunlight and shadows with the darkness above (rather forboding). I wish it was just a little crisper so I could make out more details. Excellent, evocative shot. At first I scored it as a six, but I just bumped it up to an eight.</td>', 'The choice of a cold colored duotone really sells this as a bitter world of desolation. I like the composition with the figure set far back in the frame and the repetition of the sunlight and shadows with the darkness above (rather forboding). I wish it was just a little crisper so I could make out more details. Excellent, evocative shot. At first I scored it as a six, but I just bumped it up to an eight.', '2004-05-25 18:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(735699, 77380, 21621, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot.</td>', 'Fantastic shot.', '2004-05-25 19:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(735701, 77006, 21621, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-05-25 19:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(735708, 77706, 21621, '<td valign="top">Very nice, might benefit from a border.</td>', 'Very nice, might benefit from a border.', '2004-05-25 19:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(735709, 76987, 21621, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, very creative.</td>', 'Nice shot, very creative.', '2004-05-25 19:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(735711, 77374, 21621, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, great mood.</td>', 'Nice shot, great mood.', '2004-05-25 19:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(735716, 77044, 21621, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2004-05-25 19:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(735718, 76904, 21621, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-05-25 19:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(735719, 77383, 16531, '<td valign="top">good image for the challenge,too bad about the hot spots.</td>', 'good image for the challenge,too bad about the hot spots.', '2004-05-25 19:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(735727, 77233, 16531, '<td valign="top">great shot .</td>', 'great shot .', '2004-05-25 19:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(735733, 77697, 19780, '<td valign="top">Nicely shot - well framed, I like the skin tones and though it''s slightly overexposed on her cheeks, I dont'' mind it because it gives us the bright glint in her eye. It looks like she was having fun, which is sometimes the hardest thing of all to shoot.</td>', 'Nicely shot - well framed, I like the skin tones and though it''s slightly overexposed on her cheeks, I dont'' mind it because it gives us the bright glint in her eye. It looks like she was having fun, which is sometimes the hardest thing of all to shoot.', '2004-05-25 19:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(735736, 77549, 19780, '<td valign="top">A bit overexposed, but it does help with the composition, with the creases around they eye leading the eye toward the nose and fingers. Not a shot I''d frame and put on my wall, but definitely the only sincere "nose picking" photo of the bunch, so you get an extra point from me.</td>', 'A bit overexposed, but it does help with the composition, with the creases around they eye leading the eye toward the nose and fingers. Not a shot I''d frame and put on my wall, but definitely the only sincere "nose picking" photo of the bunch, so you get an extra point from me.', '2004-05-25 19:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(735738, 77368, 19780, '<td valign="top">A little underexposed but the shot tells a great story - I can see it very clearly. Did you experiment with more extreme angles ... something shot more from a long angle on the table might have been more compelling.</td>', 'A little underexposed but the shot tells a great story - I can see it very clearly. Did you experiment with more extreme angles ... something shot more from a long angle on the table might have been more compelling.', '2004-05-25 19:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(735739, 77550, 19780, '<td valign="top">Good color, but the shadow feels like it dominates and the subject is not crisp enough for the topic or composition.</td>', 'Good color, but the shadow feels like it dominates and the subject is not crisp enough for the topic or composition.', '2004-05-25 19:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(735745, 77636, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the exposure - the highlight across the index finger is very strong and brings the composition together. I like the softness of it but think perhaps it''s too blurry.</td>', 'I like the exposure - the highlight across the index finger is very strong and brings the composition together. I like the softness of it but think perhaps it''s too blurry.', '2004-05-25 19:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(735748, 77365, 19780, '<td valign="top">I thought I commented on this photo but those notes must not have "taken" - so here goes again:<br/> <br/>I really like the colors here, the isolation of the red is really fun. The composition of the lines in the triangle forms and then steps all leading our eye through the frame is really well done - I like the DOF and the textures you captured.</td>', 'I thought I commented on this photo but those notes must not have "taken" - so here goes again: I really like the colors here, the isolation of the red is really fun. The composition of the lines in the triangle forms and then steps all leading our eye through the frame is really well done - I like the DOF and the textures you captured.', '2004-05-25 19:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(735754, 77425, 19780, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo - it''s so poignant - the legacy of litter and garbage and the child making his own toy of kicking a bottle around is a wonderful understatement. The lines of the ground really help to bring the composition together, giving order to an otherwise chaotic foreground. You have a great eye - I like the choice to place the boy off-center and heading off the frame, it gives the sight greater desolation and hopelessness, as if everyone has given up.</td>', 'I really like this photo - it''s so poignant - the legacy of litter and garbage and the child making his own toy of kicking a bottle around is a wonderful understatement. The lines of the ground really help to bring the composition together, giving order to an otherwise chaotic foreground. You have a great eye - I like the choice to place the boy off-center and heading off the frame, it gives the sight greater desolation and hopelessness, as if everyone has given up.', '2004-05-25 19:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(735797, 77265, 18403, '<td valign="top">Probably OK here, but the cartoon character is a copyrighted image.</td>', 'Probably OK here, but the cartoon character is a copyrighted image.', '2004-05-25 20:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(735800, 77381, 18403, '<td valign="top">I can almost smell that wonderful fragrance!</td>', 'I can almost smell that wonderful fragrance!', '2004-05-25 20:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(735810, 76706, 21820, '<td valign="top">Nice candid shot<br/>9<br/>one of the best</td>', 'Nice candid shot9one of the best', '2004-05-25 20:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(735823, 77697, 18403, '<td valign="top">A serious widespreqd problem!!!</td>', 'A serious widespreqd problem!!!', '2004-05-25 20:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(735832, 77343, 16488, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!  Lovely light and contrasting textures.  The color is seductive!  The triplet reflection in the hardware is the only (minor) draw back--wouldn''t be so minor if it were blown up though.  Still, my pick for the win.  Thank you for sharing those lovely hands!</td>', 'This is beautiful!  Lovely light and contrasting textures.  The color is seductive!  The triplet reflection in the hardware is the only (minor) draw back--wouldn''t be so minor if it were blown up though.  Still, my pick for the win.  Thank you for sharing those lovely hands!', '2004-05-25 20:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(735849, 77704, 15506, '<td valign="top">The carmel frapachino is my FAVORITE!</td>', 'The carmel frapachino is my FAVORITE!', '2004-05-25 21:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(735851, 77645, 18403, '<td valign="top">You might have titled this one "The Laughing Hare"! Great shot!</td>', 'You might have titled this one "The Laughing Hare"! Great shot!', '2004-05-25 21:07:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(735866, 77307, 19780, '<td valign="top">The general composition here is not interesting, it shows a habit, but doesn''t really have much of a compelling story to tell or get any emotional reaction from me. That said, I like the colors and exposure, the light is nice a diffused and gives everything a nice soft cast that enhances the details.</td>', 'The general composition here is not interesting, it shows a habit, but doesn''t really have much of a compelling story to tell or get any emotional reaction from me. That said, I like the colors and exposure, the light is nice a diffused and gives everything a nice soft cast that enhances the details.', '2004-05-25 21:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(735867, 77508, 18834, '<td valign="top">too much flash</td>', 'too much flash', '2004-05-25 21:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(735868, 76783, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the expressoin on the face and the extrordinarily long ash on the cigarette. The harsh shadow from the flash distracts from the composition and the soft focus makes some of the better details mushy.</td>', 'I like the expressoin on the face and the extrordinarily long ash on the cigarette. The harsh shadow from the flash distracts from the composition and the soft focus makes some of the better details mushy.', '2004-05-25 21:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(735869, 77264, 19121, '<td valign="top">Thes are some very artistic doodles.  I am a doodler myself, but nowhere near this good.  I also like the chewed up pencil.</td>', 'Thes are some very artistic doodles.  I am a doodler myself, but nowhere near this good.  I also like the chewed up pencil.', '2004-05-25 21:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(735870, 76863, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this, the motion blur is quite nice, but the overall composition and exposure makes it a little uninteresting. A good topic for habits, as it seems to be a common thing where I live.</td>', 'I like the idea of this, the motion blur is quite nice, but the overall composition and exposure makes it a little uninteresting. A good topic for habits, as it seems to be a common thing where I live.', '2004-05-25 21:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(735871, 76542, 19780, '<td valign="top">The composition and concept are very nice here, I like the folds in teh shirt and how they lead the eye back to the subject of the crossed fingers. The photo seems to be oversharpened or just slightly harsh and could use a little bump in the contrast to brighten up the whites.</td>', 'The composition and concept are very nice here, I like the folds in teh shirt and how they lead the eye back to the subject of the crossed fingers. The photo seems to be oversharpened or just slightly harsh and could use a little bump in the contrast to brighten up the whites.', '2004-05-25 21:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(735873, 77694, 19121, '<td valign="top">And a wonderful first habit it is.  Be careful when the teeth come in though.</td>', 'And a wonderful first habit it is.  Be careful when the teeth come in though.', '2004-05-25 21:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(735874, 77065, 18403, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty bad, but my first wife would put raisins in the mashed potatos!  That marriage didn''t last very long.</td>', 'That''s pretty bad, but my first wife would put raisins in the mashed potatos!  That marriage didn''t last very long.', '2004-05-25 21:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(735875, 77148, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like this idea very much and the use of the candle-light is very nice. It creates the sense of late nights and weariness. I am missing some of the details though because of the low light - I can''t make up some of the details of the face and ear and the saucer on the table. A little overall fill light would help.</td>', 'I like this idea very much and the use of the candle-light is very nice. It creates the sense of late nights and weariness. I am missing some of the details though because of the low light - I can''t make up some of the details of the face and ear and the saucer on the table. A little overall fill light would help.', '2004-05-25 21:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(735879, 77381, 19780, '<td valign="top">Your use of diffuse lighting is really nice, it helps to bring out the various textures and tones of the cigars and humidor. The mainly centered, straight-on composition is a little uninteresting, but a well-shot entry.</td>', 'Your use of diffuse lighting is really nice, it helps to bring out the various textures and tones of the cigars and humidor. The mainly centered, straight-on composition is a little uninteresting, but a well-shot entry.', '2004-05-25 21:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(735882, 77255, 20822, '<td valign="top">Dull contrast to this photo</td>', 'Dull contrast to this photo', '2004-05-25 21:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(735883, 77125, 20822, '<td valign="top">would have been better if there had been atleast one point in this picture that was focused in.</td>', 'would have been better if there had been atleast one point in this picture that was focused in.', '2004-05-25 21:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(735884, 76507, 19121, '<td valign="top">What does this have to do with habits?</td>', 'What does this have to do with habits?', '2004-05-25 21:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(735886, 77385, 19780, '<td valign="top">A fascinating capture. I love the reflection of the light across his arms and hands. It creates a wonderful sense of action and excitement. I wish it was just a little crisper focus, but I understand shooting low light and action is difficult. I have trouble relating it to the challenge beyond your title but it must have been fun to shoot.</td>', 'A fascinating capture. I love the reflection of the light across his arms and hands. It creates a wonderful sense of action and excitement. I wish it was just a little crisper focus, but I understand shooting low light and action is difficult. I have trouble relating it to the challenge beyond your title but it must have been fun to shoot.', '2004-05-25 21:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(735887, 77076, 20822, '<td valign="top">rflection of sun is a bit too washed out for my liking.</td>', 'rflection of sun is a bit too washed out for my liking.', '2004-05-25 21:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(735888, 76407, 19780, '<td valign="top">Very colorful and fun shot. The contrast could be bumped up a bit so we could see more details.</td>', 'Very colorful and fun shot. The contrast could be bumped up a bit so we could see more details.', '2004-05-25 21:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(735894, 77635, 19780, '<td valign="top">A nice capture. I like the light and how it does not quite cover the face. The arm up on the shoulder connotes a rather restful and relaxed state. The focus, especially on the top eyelid is very nice, helping to guide the eye to the subject of the composition and the idea of sleep.</td>', 'A nice capture. I like the light and how it does not quite cover the face. The arm up on the shoulder connotes a rather restful and relaxed state. The focus, especially on the top eyelid is very nice, helping to guide the eye to the subject of the composition and the idea of sleep.', '2004-05-25 21:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(735896, 76314, 20822, '<td valign="top">this is a challenge in our house as well</td>', 'this is a challenge in our house as well', '2004-05-25 21:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(735897, 76348, 20822, '<td valign="top">looks like my garage</td>', 'looks like my garage', '2004-05-25 21:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(735899, 77645, 19121, '<td valign="top">Nice smile on the hare, but it has little in common with habits</td>', 'Nice smile on the hare, but it has little in common with habits', '2004-05-25 21:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(735900, 77488, 20822, '<td valign="top">this one made me laugh.  Nice and crisp, easy to relate to.</td>', 'this one made me laugh.  Nice and crisp, easy to relate to.', '2004-05-25 21:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(735905, 77707, 19780, '<td valign="top">This is a bad habit I''m guilty of too ... I like the motion blur, which helps support the idea of motion and rubbing. I''d like the hand and eye to be blurred though and the bridge of the nose to be left in focus for that to work for me. The choice of B&amp;W is nice and the skin tones are nicely exposed.</td>', 'This is a bad habit I''m guilty of too ... I like the motion blur, which helps support the idea of motion and rubbing. I''d like the hand and eye to be blurred though and the bridge of the nose to be left in focus for that to work for me. The choice of B&W is nice and the skin tones are nicely exposed.', '2004-05-25 21:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(735908, 76797, 19780, '<td valign="top">I love the colors on this and the way you framed it with the mirror image. The central seam of the mirrors within the frame is a good anchor for your composition. I wish the photo were larger and crisper so that we got more detail, because I think it''s a great subject for this challenge.</td>', 'I love the colors on this and the way you framed it with the mirror image. The central seam of the mirrors within the frame is a good anchor for your composition. I wish the photo were larger and crisper so that we got more detail, because I think it''s a great subject for this challenge.', '2004-05-25 21:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(735909, 76352, 19780, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very persuasive shot to convince someone that nail-biting is an unappealing habit. There are some small details that detract from the photo though - a softer light would mean less reflection on the nail, which I think would help with the detail/contrast on the photo as while. There are some things in the background, those white blotches that detract from the main subject - a more neutral background would have helped. There seems to be a little hair or thread at the top of the finger as well which doesn''t seem to need to be there. The textures you captured and colors are great - I like the swollen red parts around the cuticle.</td>', 'I think this is a very persuasive shot to convince someone that nail-biting is an unappealing habit. There are some small details that detract from the photo though - a softer light would mean less reflection on the nail, which I think would help with the detail/contrast on the photo as while. There are some things in the background, those white blotches that detract from the main subject - a more neutral background would have helped. There seems to be a little hair or thread at the top of the finger as well which doesn''t seem to need to be there. The textures you captured and colors are great - I like the swollen red parts around the cuticle.', '2004-05-25 21:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(735910, 76948, 19121, '<td valign="top">Great composition and sharpness.  Fits right in with the theme and tells a good story.</td>', 'Great composition and sharpness.  Fits right in with the theme and tells a good story.', '2004-05-25 21:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(735912, 77288, 19780, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed and composed. I like the color of the beer and the skin tones, but the background color melts a little too closely in with the head of the beer and flesh - a little bump in the saturation might have helped.</td>', 'Nicely framed and composed. I like the color of the beer and the skin tones, but the background color melts a little too closely in with the head of the beer and flesh - a little bump in the saturation might have helped.', '2004-05-25 21:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(735913, 77380, 19121, '<td valign="top">Many of us can identify with this...</td>', 'Many of us can identify with this...', '2004-05-25 21:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
