(736320, 76251, 19708, '<td valign="top"><b>Woo Hoo! - My first.</b> Chalk one up for the old E-10.<br/> <br/>Simplicity. PS Auto-level turned background white &amp; I left it that way. A little saturation, cropping &amp; USM was all it needed.<br/> <br/>And to think I almost used my glowing toilet shot.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=78113" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/78113.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/78113.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/78113.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><b>Thanks all!</b> <br/></td>', 'Woo Hoo! - My first. Chalk one up for the old E-10. Simplicity. PS Auto-level turned background white & I left it that way. A little saturation, cropping & USM was all it needed. And to think I almost used my glowing toilet shot.  Thanks all! ', '2004-05-26 01:07:13.000000', NULL, 0),
