(736362, 76251, 16106, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by BradP:</b></div><hr/><i> <b>Woo Hoo! - My first.</b> Chalk one up for the old E-10.<br/> <br/>&lt;snip&gt; </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You cant give your camera credit, this is an idea shot pure and simple. Great idea, idealy executed, very pure and quite deserving. Congratulations.</td>', 'Originally posted by BradP: Woo Hoo! - My first. Chalk one up for the old E-10. <snip>   You cant give your camera credit, this is an idea shot pure and simple. Great idea, idealy executed, very pure and quite deserving. Congratulations.', '2004-05-26 01:27:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(736364, 77383, 7322, '<td valign="top">I was surprised to see this place in the 51% percentile. Not because I don''t like it --- I do. I thought I was getting slammed in the voting. I''m starting to catch on that there is a curve system at work. I happen to like the light coming in over his head. I know it''s considered a ''flaw'' but I think in this case it adds to the atmosphere of the scene. If I had my druthers there would be more detail in the machinery and no cord hanging down over his head...but if you read my shot details you''ll know I was lucky to get what I did. <br/> <br/>Thanks to the folks who commented! I feel pretty good with my ranking all things considered. :D</td>', 'I was surprised to see this place in the 51% percentile. Not because I don''t like it --- I do. I thought I was getting slammed in the voting. I''m starting to catch on that there is a curve system at work. I happen to like the light coming in over his head. I know it''s considered a ''flaw'' but I think in this case it adds to the atmosphere of the scene. If I had my druthers there would be more detail in the machinery and no cord hanging down over his head...but if you read my shot details you''ll know I was lucky to get what I did.  Thanks to the folks who commented! I feel pretty good with my ranking all things considered. :D', '2004-05-26 01:28:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(736406, 77472, 16106, '<td valign="top">In balance to the opinion of others I like the dark base, seems to create an ominous tone, as if some evil has occured here, which it has to 52% of the population.</td>', 'In balance to the opinion of others I like the dark base, seems to create an ominous tone, as if some evil has occured here, which it has to 52% of the population.', '2004-05-26 01:47:47.000000', NULL, 0),
