(736412, 77193, 11078, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote on this Challenge.<br/>But this has a sad feeling to it so maybe that is why your image wasn''t voted high ( Neither was mine at 132)<br/> <br/>As an image itself, I think it is excellent, clear, sharp focus a sad story to tell and definately a bad habit. IMHO I see this as a man who has drunk to much booze and is sleeping it off I guess some people live this way all the time but this guys clothes dont look old <br/>Booze is a habit and getting drunk is so I agree its a habit <br/> <br/>Who knows what people like. I prefer this style to seeing a cup of coffee or a cigarette. I think you just have to be happy with your own image, or you would give up.  <br/> <br/>I think my latest images are the best I''ve done  but they are only doing average so be happy with your own photography and style. It is<br/>good to have different styles imagine if we were all the same <br/>Good luck with your future challenges and least you didnt come 257th LOL!<br/>Sally</td>', 'I didn''t vote on this Challenge.But this has a sad feeling to it so maybe that is why your image wasn''t voted high ( Neither was mine at 132) As an image itself, I think it is excellent, clear, sharp focus a sad story to tell and definately a bad habit. IMHO I see this as a man who has drunk to much booze and is sleeping it off I guess some people live this way all the time but this guys clothes dont look old Booze is a habit and getting drunk is so I agree its a habit  Who knows what people like. I prefer this style to seeing a cup of coffee or a cigarette. I think you just have to be happy with your own image, or you would give up.   I think my latest images are the best I''ve done  but they are only doing average so be happy with your own photography and style. It isgood to have different styles imagine if we were all the same Good luck with your future challenges and least you didnt come 257th LOL!Sally', '2004-05-26 01:50:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(736415, 77501, 7322, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hannafate:</b></div><hr/><i> Ahh!  It''s a disembodied baby head!  Really, what is all that black about? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That was exactly my thought. Creepy. Cute baby and great capture of his expression (although the skin rash is kind of unappealing for such a formal looking portrait). The black on black was a bad idea in my opinion but I guess it worked out for you since it placed fairly high.</td>', 'Originally posted by hannafate: Ahh!  It''s a disembodied baby head!  Really, what is all that black about?   That was exactly my thought. Creepy. Cute baby and great capture of his expression (although the skin rash is kind of unappealing for such a formal looking portrait). The black on black was a bad idea in my opinion but I guess it worked out for you since it placed fairly high.', '2004-05-26 01:51:26.000000', NULL, 0),
