(736983, 76229, 21167, '<td valign="top">Thanks for voting for me this image was pretty impromptu. I can''t say that I''m a big drinker, but I do like to collect different glassware. Also if you were wondering port is the alcohol in the shot glass, it''s all that I had at the time of the shot. Tequila or scotch may have been better ;-)</td>', 'Thanks for voting for me this image was pretty impromptu. I can''t say that I''m a big drinker, but I do like to collect different glassware. Also if you were wondering port is the alcohol in the shot glass, it''s all that I had at the time of the shot. Tequila or scotch may have been better ;-)', '2004-05-26 10:28:15.000000', NULL, 0),
