(737922, 77365, 21203, '<td valign="top">The steps could have many meanings:  "stepped" habit breaking programs; the person ascending and descending these steps day after day to their location; the steps repeating and repeating, an inanimate "habit".  I don''t have much interest in photographs that are merely literal interpretations of the challenge.  Although they may be pleasing from an aesthetic standpoint, many of these photos don''t ask the viewer any questions, are not open to interpretation and do not challenge the viewer.  That is why I try to take a broader, more interpretive approach to the challenges, although this is often at the peril of low marks from people who don''t get it at first glance.  I''m not sure I suceed or come close to sucess with these pics, however, that is at least my goal --- to do something more than a literal interpreation of the challenge.</td>', 'The steps could have many meanings:  "stepped" habit breaking programs; the person ascending and descending these steps day after day to their location; the steps repeating and repeating, an inanimate "habit".  I don''t have much interest in photographs that are merely literal interpretations of the challenge.  Although they may be pleasing from an aesthetic standpoint, many of these photos don''t ask the viewer any questions, are not open to interpretation and do not challenge the viewer.  That is why I try to take a broader, more interpretive approach to the challenges, although this is often at the peril of low marks from people who don''t get it at first glance.  I''m not sure I suceed or come close to sucess with these pics, however, that is at least my goal --- to do something more than a literal interpreation of the challenge.', '2004-05-26 18:55:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(737978, 77701, 10680, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. this was one of my favorites through the challenge. Glad to see it made the top 3. Congrats on the Ribbon! :) <br/>This would make a great print too, I think!</td>', 'This is a great shot. this was one of my favorites through the challenge. Glad to see it made the top 3. Congrats on the Ribbon! :) This would make a great print too, I think!', '2004-05-26 19:27:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(738261, 76251, 13141, '<td valign="top">Coffee looks a little weak.  Should have brewed a stronger pot (unless this is your cup in the evening, then it''s ok).<br/>Just kidding, like the shot, simple yet good use of negative space.</td>', 'Coffee looks a little weak.  Should have brewed a stronger pot (unless this is your cup in the evening, then it''s ok).Just kidding, like the shot, simple yet good use of negative space.', '2004-05-26 21:39:52.000000', NULL, 0),
