(738397, 77371, 21072, '<td valign="top">The yellow thing is a reflection from the tap behind the water.  I could not get rid of it.  I could have made it better if I had of thought more about it.  I was really just taking photos of the water to see what the drops looked like and entered it at the last minute because I thought, hey a shower is a habit, so why not?</td>', 'The yellow thing is a reflection from the tap behind the water.  I could not get rid of it.  I could have made it better if I had of thought more about it.  I was really just taking photos of the water to see what the drops looked like and entered it at the last minute because I thought, hey a shower is a habit, so why not?', '2004-05-26 23:40:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(738475, 77407, 7778, '<td valign="top">Not exactly a technical tour-de-force (the exposure is beginning to wash out the sky and unable to render tones in the brightest margins/the horizon has a slight counter-clockwise tilt/the crop/framing is tight enough above the woman''s head to distract from her grand and solitary splendour), but what a hilarious and surreal capture!<br/> <br/>Although the casual, snap-shot manner contributes some charm to this image, a slight corrective rotation is, IMHO, needed to make it credible.<br/> <br/>The shot is and remains <i>priceless</i>!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-05-26 23:25:39.</i></td>', 'Not exactly a technical tour-de-force (the exposure is beginning to wash out the sky and unable to render tones in the brightest margins/the horizon has a slight counter-clockwise tilt/the crop/framing is tight enough above the woman''s head to distract from her grand and solitary splendour), but what a hilarious and surreal capture! Although the casual, snap-shot manner contributes some charm to this image, a slight corrective rotation is, IMHO, needed to make it credible. The shot is and remains priceless!', '2004-05-27 00:24:57.000000', '2004-05-27 00:25:39.000000', 0),
(738532, 77379, 20395, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry! Rereading my comment seems a little harsh. I really enjoyed this shot, BECAUSE it was disturbing. It doesn''t immediately read "habit", but that doesn''t mean it''s not sucessful as a photograph outside the dictates of the challenge. ''Tis good stuff!</td>', 'I''m sorry! Rereading my comment seems a little harsh. I really enjoyed this shot, BECAUSE it was disturbing. It doesn''t immediately read "habit", but that doesn''t mean it''s not sucessful as a photograph outside the dictates of the challenge. ''Tis good stuff!', '2004-05-27 01:01:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(738578, 76229, 19708, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the placing!<br/> <br/>I guess everyone sees something different in a picture.<br/>I only hit yours as a 5, and suppose it was the too washed out brightness of it.<br/>Composition was great.<br/> <br/>Again, congratulations!</td>', 'Congrats on the placing! I guess everyone sees something different in a picture.I only hit yours as a 5, and suppose it was the too washed out brightness of it.Composition was great. Again, congratulations!', '2004-05-27 01:28:23.000000', NULL, 0),
