(741856, 77678, 17550, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful photo! The toothbrush is a little out of focus, otherwise for me it would have been top 3 -- then again, I guess my taste isn''t the majority taste ;)<br/> <br/>Nonetheless, it''s a shame that many people think that in order for a photo to be rated highly it has to look like it would fit as a magazine ad...</td>', 'What a beautiful photo! The toothbrush is a little out of focus, otherwise for me it would have been top 3 -- then again, I guess my taste isn''t the majority taste ;) Nonetheless, it''s a shame that many people think that in order for a photo to be rated highly it has to look like it would fit as a magazine ad...', '2004-05-29 16:30:41.000000', NULL, 0),
